msgid "Mercenary"
msgstr "傭兵"

msgid "Lost"
msgstr "ロスト"

msgid ""
"It is not clear what happened, but the Lost were once normal people, "
"however, excessive exposure to the volatile Nebula has affected them in "
"disturbing ways."
msgstr ""
"なにがおきたのかははっきりしないが、ロストはかつてふつうの人びとだった。けれ"
"ども、揮発化星雲に過剰にさらされたことが不穏なやりかたで影響したのだ。"

