msgstr "おまえはおれに 20 クレジットの借りがある！"

msgid "You owe me a new paint job!"
msgstr "新しいペンキを塗る仕事の勘定はおまえが払うんだぞ！"

msgid "Fred here said to shoot the red blip."
msgstr "ここにいるフレッドが、赤い点を撃てといったよ。"

msgid "Now you're in for it!"
msgstr "もう、おまえとは因縁ができた！"

msgid "Did you really think you would get away with that?"
msgstr "逃げられるとほんとうに思っているのか？"

msgid "I just painted this thing!"
msgstr "こいつは塗ったばかりだったんだ！"

msgid "I can't wait to see you burn."
msgstr "燃えているあんたを見るのが待ちきれないな。"

msgid "Just. Stop. Moving."
msgstr "ちょっと。止まれ。動いているぞ。"

msgid "Die already!"
msgstr "もう死んだも同然だ！"

msgid ""
"Tell you what, if you can keep dodging for 20 hectostu I'll let you live."
msgstr "あのなあ、20 ヘクト stu 避けつづけられたら、生かしておいてやろう。"

msgid "Stop dodging!"
msgstr "避けるのはやめろ！"

msgid "Okay, that's enough of that!"
msgstr "わかったよ。それでじゅうぶんだろ！"

msgid "I'm gonna torrent you to bits!"
msgstr "あんたがこなごなになるまで連射したくなってきた！"

msgid "Is that the best ye've got, ye scurvy amateurs?"
msgstr ""

msgid "Bring it on, ye sorry excuse for spacefaring scum!"
msgstr "上等だよ、なさけない宇宙旅行者のくずが！"

msgid "Ye aim worse than a blindfolded asteroid!"
msgstr "あんたの射撃は目隠しした小惑星よりひどいな！"

msgid "Ye call that an attack? Ye're more of a nuisance than a threat!"
msgstr "それを攻撃というのか？　危険というより迷惑ってところだな！"

msgid "Ye'll have to do better than that, ye spineless amoeba!"
msgstr ""

msgid "Is that ye best, coward?"
msgstr ""

msgid "Ye'll need more than that to scratch me hull!"
msgstr "あんたにはこっちの船殻をひっかくよりましなことが必要になるな！"

msgid "Ye're about as threatening as a malfunctioning Za'lek drone!"
msgstr "あんたはだいたい故障したザレクのドローンくらいの怖さだな！"

