msgid "\"My fuel isn't for sale.\""
msgstr "｢燃料は売り物ではない｣"

msgid "\"Sorry, my fuel isn't for sale.\""
msgstr "｢申しわけないが、燃料は売り物ではない｣"

#. Most likely no chance to refuel
