#. --
#.
#. Onion04
#.
#. Player has to take a one-time pad from a convoy, and then swap the cargo
#. with another convoy on the way there. Afterwards, they have to swap the
#. cargo with another another ship, and finally infiltrate the final place
#. before getting away.
#. --
#. Action happens on the jump from Action happens Overture to Dohriabi on the Overture side
msgid "Onion Heist"
msgstr "オニオンの強盗"

msgid "Help l337_b01 and Trixie do a bank heist."
msgstr "l337_b01 とトリクシーが銀行強盗をするのを助けろ。"

msgid ""
"You accept the incoming connection and some familiar holograms appear on-"
"screen."
msgstr "あなたが入電を受けいれると、見なれたホログラムが画面に現れた。"

msgid "\"Heyo, how's it going {player}?\""
msgstr "｢へよ、うまくやってるか、{player}？｣"

msgid "\"Yo.\""
msgstr "｢よ｣"

msgid "\"Heyo.\""
msgstr "｢へよ｣"

msgid ""
"\"Was poking at the Nexus Shipyards security with Trixie, and it seems like "
"we've got a path into the mainframe, although it's a bit convoluted.\""
msgstr ""
"｢トリクシーとネクサス造船所の保安処置をつついていたんだ。われわれは中央処理装"
"置への通路を手に入れたらしい。ちょっと込みいってるんだがな｣"

msgid ""
"\"It seems like there's an important convoy coming from {startspb} to "
"{targetspb} with some of the new encryption protocols and one-time pads. "
"However, we can't really directly mess with them, or they'll redo the entire "
"encryption, and it's moot.\""
msgstr ""
"｢{startspb}から{targetspb}へ向かう重要な護送船団があるらしいんだ。新しい暗号"
"化プロトコルとワンタイムパッドを積んでね。そうはいっても、じっさいのところわ"
"れわれが直接手を出すことはできない。むこうは暗号化をぜんぶやりなおすから、意"
"味がない｣"

msgid ""
"l337_b01 butts in, \"but if we manage to swap the one-time pad with another, "
"we can get access there. We've found another suitable convoy that will be "
"going through the {sys} system.\""
msgstr ""
"l337_b01 が口をはさむ。｢だがもしワンタイムパッドをなんとか別のと交換できた"
"ら、われわれはアクセスが可能になる。もうひとつぴったりな護送船団も見つけて"
"あって、そいつは{sys}星系を通ることになっている｣"

msgid ""
"Trixie counter-butts in, \"Yes, so we need you to raid the convoy in {sys} "
"system, and then deliver that to {swapspb} in the {swapsys} system, and we "
"can handle the rest!\""
msgstr ""
"トリクシーが口をはさみかえした。｢そのとおり。だから{sys}星系で護送船団を襲撃"
"するのにあなたが必要なんだ。そのあとは{swapsys}星系の{swapspb}にそれを運んで"
"もらう。そうすれば残りはわれわれで処理できる！｣"

msgid "You decline the work for now, and the holograms fade away."
msgstr "ひとまずあなたは仕事を断った。するとホログラムは消えていった。"

msgid ""
"\"Great! Trixie and I will be using your ship as a beacon, and should be "
"able to help you as bandwidth allows.\""
msgstr ""
"｢すばらしい！　トリクシーとおれは信号所としてあんたの船を使う予定だから、あん"
"たを助けられるはずだ。帯域幅に余裕があるからな｣"

msgid ""
"\"The convoy will be jumping from the {jmpsys} system to the {ambushsys} "
"system. It's our best bet due to the high bandwidth and few ships to capture "
"the cargo.\""
msgstr ""
"｢護送船団は{jmpsys}星系から{ambushsys}星系にジャンプしていく。いちばんいい方"
"法は広い帯域とごく少数の船で積み荷を奪うことだ｣"

msgid ""
"\"No need to fret, {player} is an excellent pilot and this will be no "
"challenge for the {shipname}!\""
msgstr ""
"｢心配する必要はない。{player}は優秀なパイロットだし、こんなのは{shipname}に"
"とっては相手にもならない！｣"

msgid "Steal one-time pads from the convoy in the {sys} system"
msgstr "{sys}星系にいる護送船団からワンタイムパッドを盗め。"

#. Characters
#. Cargo swap cutscene
msgid "Spacedock Staff"
msgstr "宇宙港接舷所の職員"

#. last cutscene
msgid ""
"Your ship enters the docks, and the two Onion Society hackers make their "
"timely holographic appearance."
msgstr ""
"あなたの船が接舷所に入ると、二人のオニオン協会のハッカーたちがちょうどよくホ"
"ログラムの姿を現した。"

msgid "\"Quick, l337_b01, to action!\""
msgstr "｢いそげ、l337_b01。行動開始だ！｣"

msgid "\"Aye aye captain!\""
msgstr "｢よしきた、船長！｣"

msgid "You think you see what amounts to a grimace from Trixie's avatar."
msgstr "トリクシーのアバターがしかめっ面になった理由はわかるとあなたは思った。"

msgid "\"I'm on it!\""
msgstr "｢まかせとけ！｣"

msgid ""
"\"Damn, it seems denser than expected. We need a distraction. Quick, "
"{player}, do something!\""
msgstr ""
"｢くそっ、思ったより込みあってるな。気をそらす必要がある。いそいでくれ、"
"{player}。なにかするんだ！｣"

msgid "Activate your ship's security alarm."
msgstr "自分の船の保安警報を作動させる。"

msgid "Bump the ship into the station structure."
msgstr "ステーションの建造物に船をぶつける。"

msgid "\"What should I do!?\""
msgstr "｢なにをすればいいんです !? ｣"

msgid "\"I don't know! Run over a maintenance robot or something!\""
msgstr "｢知るか！　保守ロボットかなにかを踏みつけてやれ！｣"

msgid "\"Time to get busy!\""
msgstr "｢仕事に取りかかる潮時だな！｣"

msgid "Run over a maintenance robot."
msgstr "保守ロボットを踏みつける。"

msgid ""
"You fumble the controls of the ship a bit, just enough to make it barely "
"scratch the inner hull of the space dock. Although you expected it to make "
"some noise, you didn't foresee the ear-splitting screech caused by the metal "
"on metal interaction. With all the heads of everyone at the spacedocks "
"turned your way, it seems like you managed to get the attention of the inter "
"spacedock."
msgstr ""
"あなたは船の操縦でちょっとへまをやった。宇宙港接舷所の内殻をぎりぎりこするの"
"にちょうどぴったりに。異音は予想していたが、金属と金属がふれあうことで耳をつ"
"んざくような金切り音が発生するとは思ってもいなかった。宇宙港接舷所にいた全員"
"の顔があなたの方を向いたことからすると、あなたはどうにか宇宙港接舷所じゅうの"
"注意をひけたようだった。"

msgid ""
"You begrudgingly take the controls of the ship, and wait until a cleaner "
"robot strays near your landing gear. Wasting no time on the opportunity, you "
"do a precise manoeuvre to crush it with a resounding *CRUNCH*. Given the "
"amount of heads turned, it looks like you got the attention of the entire "
"spacedock."
msgstr ""
"あなたはしぶりながらも船の操縦桿を持ち、清掃ロボットが着陸脚の近くへさまよい"
"でるまで待った。好機がくると時間を無駄にせず、あなたは正確な操縦をしてロボッ"
"トを押しつぶし、踏み砕く音を大きく響かせた。向きなおる顔の数からすると、あな"
"たは宇宙港接舷所全体の注意をひいたようだった。"

#. Just one loop
msgid ""
"You open the command console and trigger the ship's emergency alarm system. "
"The alarm system, designed for long-range planetary signalling, seems to be "
"amplified and echoed by the spacedock structure, resulting in an onslaught "
"of audible chaos. Everyone in the spacedock turns towards your ship: it "
"looks like you got the attention of the entire floor."
msgstr ""
"あなたは指令卓を開き、船の非常警報システムを作動させた。この警報システムは、"
"惑星での長距離信号伝達のために設計されたもので、宇宙港接舷所の構造物のおかげ"
"で増幅されて反響しているようだった。その結果が音響的混沌の猛襲だ。宇宙港接舷"
"所にいた全員があなたの船の方を向く。あなたはその階全体の注意をひいたようだっ"
"た。"

msgid ""
"Almost immediately, a high priority communication channel with the spacedock "
"command opens."
msgstr "ほぼ即座に、宇宙港接舷所司令の高優先通信回線が開いた。"

msgid ""
"\"What the hell are you thinking! I've dealt with a ton of pilots in my "
"time, but none as reckless as you!\""
msgstr ""
"｢いったいなにを考えているんです！　これまで山ほどパイロットに対処してきました"
"が、あなたのようなむとんちゃくな人はいませんでしたよ！｣"

msgid "\"Sorry! It's my first time landing.\""
msgstr "｢すみません！　初めて着陸したんです｣"

msgid "\"What do you mean?\""
msgstr "｢どういうことですか？｣"

msgid "You call that landing? Who the hell taught you to fly?"
msgstr ""
"あれを着陸っていうんですかね？　いったいだれに飛ばしかたを教わったんです？　"

msgid ""
"It's a bloody spacedock, not a percussive instrument you have to bash your "
"ship against!"
msgstr "ここは忌まわしくも宇宙港接舷所で、あなたの船で叩くべき打楽器じゃない！"

msgid "The robot you crushed only had one cycle left until retirement!"
msgstr ""
"あなたが押しつぶしたロボットは引退するまで 1 周期しかなかったんですよ！"

msgid ""
"You can't just blast your alarm at the spacedocks! You know how much "
"tympanic reconstruction costs!"
msgstr ""
"なんでもないのに宇宙港接舷所で警報を鳴り響かせてはだめなんです！　鼓膜の再建"
"費用がどれだけかかるか知ってますよね！"

msgid "\"{msg1} {msg2}\""
msgstr "｢{msg1}{msg2}｣"

msgid ""
"l337_b01 appears on a separate channel.\n"
"\"We're almost there, keep them distracted a bit longer.\""
msgstr ""
"別の回線に l337_b01 が現れた。\n"
"　｢だいたいいけた。もうちょっと気をそらしつづけてくれ｣"

msgid "\"I have no idea of what you are talking about.\""
msgstr "｢いってることがなんなのか、まったくわかりません｣"

msgid "\"What you say?\""
msgstr "｢なにをいってるんです？｣"

msgid "\"It was only a scratch!\""
msgstr "｢あんなのただのかすり傷ですよ！｣"

msgid ""
"\"The spacedock hull integrity may not be compromised, but I assure you the "
"traumatic auditive memories of the resulting caterwaul is not going to be "
"easy to recover from!\""
msgstr ""
"｢宇宙港接舷所の胴体は完全なままかもしれませんが、あれで生じたかん高い悲鳴みた"
"いな音の衝撃的記憶からは簡単に回復できないと保証しますよ！｣"

msgid ""
"\"Only a scratch? Scrubby is flat as a pancake! You've turned a great "
"cleaning robot into a stain on the spacedock floor!\""
msgstr ""
"｢ただのかすり傷？　スクラビーはパンケーキみたいにまっ平になったんですよ！　あ"
"なたはすばらしい清掃ロボットを宇宙港接舷所の床のしみにしたんです！｣"

msgid ""
"\"Show me your credentials. I'm filing a report to the Empire. You do know "
"what happens if you don't comply, do you?\""
msgstr ""
"｢あなたの資格証明書を見せてください。帝国に報告を送ります。応じなければどうな"
"るのかしっかりわかっていますよね？｣"

msgid "\"Wait, I can explain!\""
msgstr "｢待った、説明できますよ！｣"

msgid "\"Credentials? I don't even know who I am!\""
msgstr "｢資格証明書？　自分がだれなのかもわからないんですよ！｣"

msgid "\"No, *I'm* filing a complaint to the Empire!\""
msgstr "｢いいえ｡『わたしが』帝国に苦情を送ります！｣"

msgid ""
"\"Too late now! The spacedock recordings are all the explanation anyone will "
"need!\""
msgstr ""
"｢もう遅すぎますよ！　どんな人が必要とする説明でも宇宙港接舷所の記録がすべてし"
"てくれます！｣"

msgid ""
"\"File a complaint for what? Upholding the law? Taking care of the "
"spacedocks? Dealing with horrible pilots?\""
msgstr ""
"｢苦情を送るってなんのことでです？　法律を守らせていることでですか？　宇宙港接"
"舷所を注意深く維持していること？　じつにひどいパイロットたちに対処しているこ"
"とで？｣"

msgid ""
"\"Your flying days will be over. The Empire does not take kindly to this "
"kind of infraction. If you get lucky, you'll only be given a life sentence "
"on the lovely prison planet {spb}!\""
msgstr ""
"｢あなたが空を飛ぶ日々は終わることになります。帝国がこの種の違反行為をこころよ"
"く受けいれることはぜったいにありません。もしあなたが幸運だったら、愉快な刑務"
"所惑星{spb}での終身刑だけですみますよ！｣"

#. Finn is an Empire prison world
msgid "\"Not going to be so cocky when you are...\""
msgstr "｢あんな生意気はいってられないでしょうね。このさきあなたが……｣"

msgid ""
"Suddenly l337_b01 shouts through the other channel.\n"
"\"Got them!\""
msgstr ""
"とつぜん l337_b01 が別の回線で叫んだ。\n"
"　｢やった！｣"

msgid ""
"Suddenly the stations power goes out and the connection with spacedock "
"command is cut."
msgstr "とつぜんステーションの電源が落ちて、宇宙港接舷所司令との通信が切れた。"

msgid ""
"\"Trixie, that was top-notch! I didn't even think of reversing the "
"polarization protocol to create a bandwidth backflow and overflow the router!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"｢トリクシー、あれは最高だったな！　偏極手順を逆にして帯域の逆流を作って、経路"
"中継器をあふれさせるなんて考えたこともなかった！｣"

msgid "\"There are a lot more tricks where that came from!\""
msgstr "｢もっとたくさんのやりかたであれはできるんだよ！｣"

msgid "\"Totally yoinking that one.\""
msgstr "｢あれはすっかり盗ませてもらった｣"

msgid ""
"\"{player}, to fill you out, we managed to swap the one-time pad onto the "
"local convoy. We've rebooted the station systems to cover our track, but the "
"job here is done!\""
msgstr ""
"｢{player}、教えておくと、われわれはワンタイムパッドをここの護送船団のとうまい"
"こと交換できた。それからステーションのシステムを再起動させてわれわれの跡は隠"
"してある。ともかく、ここでの仕事は終わってるよ！｣"

msgid "\"What about the spacedock command?\""
msgstr "｢宇宙港接舷所司令のことは？｣"

msgid "\"Will I be alright?\""
msgstr "｢わたしの問題はなくなるんですか？｣"

msgid "\"Great job!\""
msgstr "｢すばらしい仕事ぶりですね！｣"

msgid "\"No need to worry about anything.\""
msgstr "｢なにも心配する必要はない｣"

msgid "\"Just watch and see.\""
msgstr "｢とにかくなりゆきを見ていろよ｣"

msgid ""
"The station lights flicker on and an angrier than ever spacedock command "
"appears promptly on your holoscreen."
msgstr ""
"ステーションのあかりがまたたいてつき、まえより怒っている宇宙港接舷所司令がす"
"ぐさまあなたのホロスクリーンに現れた。"

msgid ""
"\"You! You have something to do with this. When I add this to your list of "
"crimes, you'll be lucky to even breathe oxygen again!\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Security! Seize the {shipname}!\""
msgstr "｢保安係！　{shipname}を取りおさえろ！｣"

msgid "\"Wait, what are you doing? Criminal fraud? I haven't done anything.\""
msgstr ""
"｢待った、なにをしている？　刑事上の不正行為？　わたしはなにもしなかった｣"

msgid "The connection with spacedock command abruptly cuts out."
msgstr "宇宙港接舷所司令との接続がとつぜん切れた。"

msgid "\"And that was that.\""
msgstr "｢そしてこれでおしまい｣"

msgid "\"Nice clean job. I could get used to this.\""
msgstr "｢あざやかですんなりした仕事だ。こういうのになじもうとしてたんだが｣"

msgid ""
"\"OK, now comes for the final part. {player}, we need you to go to {spb} in "
"the {sys} system, and we'll break into the system using the new security "
"code they'll be using.\""
msgstr ""
"｢よし、もう最後のところに来たな。{player}、{sys}星系の{spb}へ行くのにあなたが"
"必要だ。われわれは連中が使おうとしていた新しい暗証番号を使ってシステムに侵入"
"するつもりなんだ｣"

msgid "\"If we've gotten this far, it should be a piece of cake. \""
msgstr "｢ここまで来たんだから、おやつみたいなものなはずだ｣"

msgid "\"Again? I told you to stop making me hungry!\""
msgstr "｢また？　食べたくなるようなことをいうのはやめろといっただろ！｣"

msgid "\"Didn't you just have cake?\""
msgstr "｢ちょっとケーキを食べちゃったなんてことはないよな？｣"

msgid "\"First cake yes, but what about second cake?\""
msgstr "｢最初のケーキは食べた。でも次のケーキはどうかな？｣"

msgid "\"You should watch out for your blood sugar.\""
msgstr "｢血糖値を気にしたほうがいいよ｣"

msgid "You hear a muffled eating sound."
msgstr "隠して食べる音が聞こえた。"

msgid ""
"\"Ah well. I should get some cake too.\"\n"
"They pause a second.\n"
"\"Before I forget, {player}, on to {spb}!\""
msgstr ""

msgid "Maybe you should get some cake too."
msgstr "たぶん、あなたもケーキを食べたほうがいい。"

msgid "\"Stop making me hungry!\""
msgstr "｢食べたくなるようなことをいうのはやめろ！｣"

msgid "\"Sorry, forgot you had such a sweet tooth.\""
msgstr "｢悪い。そんなに甘いものが好きなんだって忘れてた｣"

msgid "You hear Trixie muttering something about cake."
msgstr "トリクシーがケーキについてなにかぶつぶついうのが聞こえた。"

msgid "\"{player}, on to {spb}!\""
msgstr "｢{player}、{spb}へ行ってくれ！｣"

msgid "Break into {spb} ({sys} system)"
msgstr "{sys}星系の{spb}へ侵入せよ。"

#. Small extra optional cutscene
msgid ""
"You land and go inspect the cargo you pulled off of the Nexus Convoy. It "
"seems like the two hackers hitch-hiking on your ship's systems take notice "
"and their holograms appear before you."
msgstr ""
"着陸すると、あなたはネクサスの護送船団からはぎ取った積み荷を点検しに行った。"
"あなたの船のシステムに無賃で便乗している二人のハッカーたちが気づいたようで、"
"ホログラムがあなたの前に現れた。"

msgid ""
"\"Nice flying out there! See, Trixie, I told you it would be a piece of cake "
"for {player}!\""
msgstr ""
"｢むこうからはうまく飛びだせたな！　ほら、トリクシー、{player}はあれをおやつが"
"わりにするっていっただろ！｣"

msgid ""
"\"Stop making me hungry!\"\n"
"They pause for a second.\n"
"\"I'm just worried that it seems like their security was really week... Too "
"weak.\""
msgstr ""
"｢食べたくなるようなことをいうのはやめろ！｣\n"
"　トリクシーがちょっといいよどんだ。\n"
"　｢ちょっと心配が。むこうの保安処置はほんとうに弱かったような……弱すぎる｣"

msgid "\"Really? Aren't you just being overly paranoid?\""
msgstr "｢ほんとうか？　疑い深くなりすぎてるだけってことはないか？｣"

msgid ""
"\"The devil's in the details! At least it should be a while until they "
"notice that the convoy went missing while your script keeps running.\""
msgstr ""
"｢悪魔は細部にいるんだよ！　すくなくともきみのスクリプトが走りつづけているあい"
"だは、護送船団が行方不明になったのに気づかれるまでちょっとかかるはずだね｣"

msgid ""
"\"Yeah, the simulation is emulating the convoy, so we should have some time "
"to finish pulling off the plan. {player}, you ready to do the swap at {spb}?"
"\""
msgstr ""
"｢ああ、見せかけで護送船団をまねている。だから計画をやりおえる時間はいくらかあ"
"るはずだ。{player}、{spb}で交換をする用意はいいか？｣"

msgid "\"Piece of cake.\""
msgstr "｢おやつみたいなものです｣"

msgid "\"Security felt tough though...\""
msgstr "｢保安はみごとだったと感じましたが……｣"

msgid ""
"\"That does it! I'm ordering cake!\"\n"
"You hear Trixie muttering to themselves."
msgstr ""
"｢我慢できない！　ケーキを注文する！｣\n"
"　トリクシーがひとりでぶつぶつ不平をいっているのが聞こえた。"

msgid "\"You already ate the last one you got?\""
msgstr "｢もう買っておいた最後のは食べちゃってたんだ？｣"

msgid "\"Not my fault I have a sweet tooth!\""
msgstr "｢甘いものが好きなのは自分のせいじゃない！｣"

msgid ""
"\"Today, with our fairly limited bandwidth, we were able to break into and "
"override quite a few of their ships. Usually, it's hard enough to access a "
"spaceship's operating system, let alone override it.\""
msgstr ""
"｢今日、われわれはかなり制限された帯域幅だったのに、かなり多数の船に侵入して制"
"御を奪うことができた。ふつう、宇宙船のオペレーティングシステムにアクセスする"
"のはじゅうぶん難しいんだ。制御を奪うなんていうまでもないな｣"

msgid ""
"\"This has to be related to the weird patterns we're seeing on the Nexus!\""
msgstr ""
"｢われわれがネクサスでくり返し見かけている妙なことに関係しているはずだ！｣"

msgid "\"Correlation doesn't imply causation!\""
msgstr "｢相関は因果関係をかならずしも意味しない！｣"

msgid "\"Indeed it does not, but coincidences are not very good omens.\""
msgstr "｢たしかにしないけど、偶然の一致はあまりいいきざしじゃない｣"

msgid ""
"\"Superstitions! However, you tend to have good hunches, so let me see if I "
"can scrape some bandwidth together to launch some monitoring spells.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Never can be too careful. There is too much at stake here to mess up.\"\n"
"You hear a beep.\n"
"\"Ah, diagnostics finished, let's see...\""
msgstr ""
"｢用心しすぎるってことはないよ。これにはどじを踏めないほど多くのものが賭けられ"
"ている｣\n"
"　あなたは発信音を聞いた。\n"
"　｢ああ、診断が終わった。見てみよう……｣"

msgid ""
"\"Cargo looks OK! Seems to be lots of encrypted documents, but there also is "
"a nice one-time pad. Exactly what we need. l337_b01, if you can spare the "
"resources, try to decrypt some of the documents. {player}, head to {swapspb} "
"in the {swapsys} system. We proceed with the plan!\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Stop mocking me, the captain here is {player}!\""
msgstr "｢からかうのはやめろ。ここでの船長は{player}だろ！｣"

msgid ""
"The holograms fade out, probably to conserve bandwidth, and you are left "
"with the task at hand."
msgstr ""
"ホログラムが消えていった。たぶん帯域を無駄にしないためだろう。そしてあなたは"
"手にある務めとともに残された。"

#. Advance internal state
msgid "Onion Society"
msgstr "オニオン協会"

msgid "Break into the Nexus Shipyards systems."
msgstr "ネクサス造船所のシステムに侵入せよ。"

msgid ""
"\"Glad to see you made it out alive {player}. That did not go as expected.\""
msgstr ""
"｢生きて出られたのがわかってうれしいよ、{player}。あれは思ったとおりに進まな"
"かったな｣"

msgid ""
"\"Sorry about that, I panicked when they started upstreaming to me and cut "
"the connection. I should have listened to you Trixie, I guess I got cocky.\""
msgstr ""
"｢そのことでは申しわけない。むこうがおれの方へさかのぼり始めたときにうろたえて"
"接続を切ったんだ。トリクシーのいうことを聞くべきだった。おれは調子にのってた"
"んだと思うよ｣"

msgid "\"No sweat. There's always a next time.\""
msgstr "｢心配するな。いつだって次があるよ｣"

msgid "\"Shame we weren't able to break into the system, we were so close.\""
msgstr "｢システムに侵入できなかったのは残念だ。もうすこしだったのに｣"

msgid ""
"\"At least we all made it out alive. There's always more opportunities as "
"long as we're still alive and kicking.\""
msgstr ""
"｢すくなくとも全員が生きて出られた。いつだって生きて反抗しているかぎり、さらな"
"る機会がある｣"

msgid "\"Can't win them all.\""
msgstr "｢すべてに勝つことはできない｣"

msgid "\"What were you able to get?\""
msgstr "｢なにが取れた？｣"

msgid ""
"\"I didn't have much time to choose, so I just randomly downloaded as much "
"as bandwidth allowed, still going through it. From the little I've seen, "
"there's some interesting account credentials, and some encrypted stuff that "
"we have to unlock. All in all, a pretty good haul.\""
msgstr ""
"｢選ぶ時間があまりなかったから、とにかく帯域幅が許すかぎりでたらめにダウンロー"
"ドした。まだ通じているあいだはね。見たのはすこしだけど、いくつか興味深い口座"
"証明書があった。それから暗号化されてて鍵を外さなきゃならないやつがいくつか。"
"全体的に見ると、かなりの大漁だった｣"

msgid ""
"\"Cool. Def share the titbits. I've got some spare computational power to "
"crack codes.\""
msgstr ""
"｢すばらしい。そのうまそうなやつはぜったい共有してくれ。余分な計算能力をいくら"
"か手に入れてあるから、暗号を割ってやれる｣"

msgid "\"What are our next steps?\""
msgstr "｢次の一歩はどうする？｣"

msgid ""
"\"I've been thinking about what we talked about almost a cycle ago. We might "
"be able to pull off something big, like really big.\""
msgstr ""
"｢ 1 周期近くまえに話したことを考えてた。なにか大きいものをもぎ取ってやれるか"
"もしれない。ほんとうに大きいものを｣"

msgid "\"Oh, is this about the Nexus backbone hack?\""
msgstr "｢ああ、ネクサスの根幹に侵入することだな？｣"

msgid "\"Yes, I think we have a good opportunity to pull it off.\""
msgstr "｢そう。もぎ取るにはいい機会だって思ってる｣"

msgid "\"Awesome!\""
msgstr "｢びっくりだな！｣"

msgid ""
"\"{player}, if you're interested in becoming part of history, send us a "
"message in a bit. I'll give the details.\""
msgstr ""
"｢{player}、歴史の一部になることに興味があるなら、もうちょっとしてからわれわれ"
"に連絡してくれ。細かく話すつもりだから｣"

msgid ""
"\"Oh, and to encourage you to participate, here's some credits courtesy of "
"Nexus Shipyards. Not much, but next time we should be able to get more!\""
msgstr ""
"｢ああ、それからあなたが手を貸す動機になるだろうから、このネクサス造船所の好意"
"によるクレジットをちょっと渡しておくよ。多くはないけど、次回はもっと手に入れ"
"られるはずだ！｣"

msgid ""
"\"Oh, and to encourage you to participate, here's some credits courtesy of "
"Nexus Shipyards.\""
msgstr ""
"｢ああ、それからあなたが手を貸す動機になるだろうから、このネクサス造船所の好意"
"によるクレジットをちょっと渡しておくよ｣"

msgid ""
"You helped l337_b01 and Trixie perform a heist at {spb}, although it was not "
"a complete success."
msgstr ""
"あなたは l337_b01 とトリクシーが{spb}で強盗するのを助けた。完全な成功とはなら"
"なかったが。"

msgid "You helped l337_b01 and Trixie perform a heist at {spb}."
msgstr "あなたは l337_b01 とトリクシーが{spb}で強盗するのを助けた。"

#. Save the game
msgid ""
"You signal to the two Onion Society hackers that it is time for them to make "
"their timely holographic appearance."
msgstr ""
"二人のオニオン協会のハッカーたちに、ホログラフの姿を現すのにちょうどいい時だ"
"とあなたは合図した。"

msgid ""
"\"Oh boy, {spb}, it's been a while since I've been here. Not in person "
"though. Reminds me of old times.\""
msgstr ""
"｢やれやれ、{spb}か。ここへ来たのは久しぶりだな。実体でじゃないけど。昔のこと"
"を思いだすよ｣"

msgid ""
"\"No time to get all old-timey on us now. It's time to get to business. "
"{player}, see if you can jack us in to a local console. Let me send you a "
"map of the nearest one.\""
msgstr ""
"｢今は昔のことをぜんぶ思いだしてる時間じゃない。仕事にかかる時間だ。{player}、"
"ここの制御卓へわれわれをつなげて入れられるか確かめるんだ。いちばん近くのやつ"
"への地図を送信させてくれ｣"

msgid ""
"You head off to the terminal l337_b01 pointed you to. The installation is a "
"bit of a mess, but eventually you find it and jack in, giving the hackers "
"more direct access."
msgstr ""
"あなたは l337_b01 が示した端末に向かっていった。施設はちょっとちらかっていた"
"が、けっきょくあなたは端末を見つけ、接続をした。これでハッカーたちはもっと単"
"刀直入にアクセスできる。"

msgid ""
"\"Let's see what we have here... seems like the one-time pad passed the "
"verification test.\""
msgstr ""
"｢ここで手に入るものを見てみよう……。ワンタイムパッドは証明検査を通過したよう"
"だ｣"

msgid ""
"\"Wait, that's a bit weird, I'm seeing some inconsistencies in the object "
"system.\""
msgstr "｢待った。ちょっと妙だ。目的システムにいくつか矛盾があるのが見えてきた｣"

msgid "\"You sure? My scripts haven't picked up anything strange yet.\""
msgstr "｢たしかか？　おれのスクリプトは変なことをまだなにも拾いあげていないぞ｣"

msgid ""
"\"Something feels a bit off. Wait, let me double-check running processes.\""
msgstr ""
"｢なにかちょっと気持ち悪く感じる。待ってくれ。走ってるプロセスを再点検させてく"
"れ｣"

msgid "\"Mmm, what was that?\""
msgstr "｢むー、それでどうだった？｣"

msgid ""
"\"Shit, it seems like there's someone else hijacking the system, pattern "
"blue!\""
msgstr ""
"｢くそっ、システムを乗っとったやつがほかにいるらしい。状況としてはうまくないや"
"つだな！｣"

msgid ""
"\"I see them now! They're running a reverse packet analysis, I don't think I "
"can keep up the connection much longer.\""
msgstr ""
"｢もうおれにもわかったよ！　むこうは逆パケット解析を走らせてるし、あまり長く接"
"続を維持できるとは思えないな｣"

msgid "\"I'll try to draw them off!\""
msgstr "｢注意をそらしてみる！｣"

msgid "\"l337_b01? Shit, not responding to ping, they're down.\""
msgstr "｢l337_b01？　くそっ、ピングに反応がない。あいつは落ちた｣"

msgid ""
"\"Scripts are down. {player}, I'm going to need you to manually override the "
"last security protocol! I'll be running diversions!\""
msgstr ""
"｢スクリプトが落ちた。{player}、最後の保安手順を手動で無効にするのにあなたが必"
"要になる！　陽動プログラムを走らせるから！｣"

msgid "You fail to gain access of the terminal. Try again?"
msgstr "あなたは端末を操作可能にできなかった。もういちど試しますか？"

msgid "Try again."
msgstr "また試す。"

msgid "Abort."
msgstr "中止する。"

msgid "\"Shit, get out of there now!\""
msgstr "｢くそっ、もうそこから出るんだ！｣"

msgid "\"Got it? Great! Let me try to access the data.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Shit, I'll try to get what I can, but you have to get out of there now!\""
msgstr ""
"｢くそっ、できるだけ手に入れようとはするつもりだけど、あなたはもうそこから出な"
"きゃだめだ！｣"

msgid ""
"You unplug from the terminal and make a wild dash for your ship. On the way "
"there, an armed Nexus guard appears before you, but you just plow through "
"them before they can arm their weapon, sending them sprawling on the ground."
msgstr ""
"あなたは端末から抜けて、船にむかって騒々しく突進する。そこへの途中で、武装し"
"たネクサスの守衛があなたの前に現れたが、守衛に武器を構えるひまを与えずとにか"
"くかき分けて進み、守衛は床にひっくり返って大の字になった。"

msgid ""
"You finally make it to the spacedocks and manage to slide in before taking "
"control. You quickly activate full thrusters and smash your way out of the "
"spacedocks as Nexus security pummels your ship with weapon fire. You barely "
"make it out in one piece. Looks like you're going to have a bumpy ride out "
"of {sys}!"
msgstr ""
"あなたはついに宇宙港接舷所へ到着し、どうにか滑りこんで操縦桿を握った。あなた"
"はいそいで推進エンジンを全力で作動させ、宇宙港接舷所から体当たりで外へ出る。"
"そのときには、ネクサスの警備隊があなたの船を武器で撃ちまくっていた。あなたは"
"やっとのことで、ばらばらにならずに外へ出た。{sys}星系では揺れる具合になりそう"
"だ！"

msgid "Get away from {sys} and land on a planet or station"
msgstr "{sys}星系から逃げ、惑星かステーションに着陸せよ。"

#. Player has to run away
#. Player got away
#. done with last part
#. Skip talk if jumping in from jmpsys
msgid "l337_b01: Head towards the jump. They should be here soon!"
msgstr "l337_b01: ジャンプポイントへ向かえ。すぐここへ来るはずだ！"

msgid "Trixie: Oh boy, that's a lot of ships. Get close and we'll hack!"
msgstr ""
"トリクシー : やれやれ、あれは船が多いなあ。近づいてくれ。そうすればハックする"
"から！"

msgid "You lost track of the target!!!"
msgstr "あなたは目標を見失った !!!"

#. Player already disabled, nothing to do
msgid "Nexus IT (Hacked)"
msgstr "ネクサス IT (ハックされている)"

#. IDs of ships to hack
msgid "l337_b01: Script deployed! Time to cry!"
msgstr "l337_b01: スクリプトを配置した！　泣き叫ぶ時間だ！"

msgid "Trixie: See the {p}? Get closer!"
msgstr "トリクシー : {p}が見えるか？　近づいてくれ！"

msgid ""
"Your ship approaches the {shp}, and you rip off the cargo pod and make your "
"way."
msgstr "船を{shp}に近づけると、あなたは貨物庫を盗んで離れた。"

#. Give the player the cargo
msgid "Nexus Cargo Pod"
msgstr "ネクサスの貨物庫"

msgid "Cargo taken from Nexus Shipyards."
msgstr "ネクサス造船所から取った貨物庫。"

#. spawn again
msgid "l337_b01: Got the goods, on to {spb}!"
msgstr "l337_b01: 品物は手に入れた。{spb}へ行ってくれ！"

#. spawn again
msgid "You were supposed to capture the cargo, not destroy the ship!"
msgstr "あなたは積み荷を奪うことになっていた。船を破壊するのではなく！"

msgid "Trixie: {player}, you have to scram! I'll try to cover."
msgstr "トリクシー : {player}、逃げなきゃだめだ！　援護はしてみるよ。"

msgid "l337_b01: Shit, here they come!"
msgstr "l337_b01: くそっ、ここにあいつらが来た！"

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Onion Society 05">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>3</priority>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <done>Onion Society 04</done>
#. <cond>
#. local c = spob.cur()
#. local f = c:faction()
#. if not f or not f:tags("generic") then
#. return false
#. end
#. return true
#. </cond>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Onion Society</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. Onion05
#.
#. Try to get information on a long-lost Nexus backdoor.
#. --
msgid "The Great Hack"
msgstr "ザ・グレート・ハック"

msgid "Help l337_b01 and Trixie hack the Nexus backend."
msgstr "l337_b01 とトリクシーがネクサスの裏側をハックするのを助けろ。"

msgid "\"Yo, {player}.\""
msgstr "｢よ、{player}｣"

msgid "\"Heyo!\""
msgstr "｢へよ！｣"

msgid ""
"\"You ready to go down in the history books? Change the Nexus, and by "
"extension, the Universe forever? Become truly l337!?! Go on to...\""
msgstr ""
"｢あんたは歴史書に記録される用意ができてるな？　ネクサスを変えろ。つまり大きく"
"見れば、宇宙を永遠にか？　真の l337 になれ !?!　さらに進んで……｣"

msgid ""
"Trixie cuts them off.\n"
"\"C'mon no need to keep them waiting!\""
msgstr ""
"トリクシーがさえぎった。\n"
"　｢おいおい、待ってたりしないからな！｣"

msgid "\"It's called building hype! Got to give the people what they love!\""
msgstr ""
"｢これは興奮を高めるといわれるやつだよ！　大事に思うものをひとに与えるってこ"
"と！｣"

#. Vnexer is basically like a vtuber (virtual youtuber) but on the Nexus
msgid "\"Have you been binging on self-help Vnexers again?\""
msgstr "｢また自己啓発ブイネクサーに絡めとられてるのか？｣"

msgid ""
"\"Err, no? W-Why w-w-would you think that?\"\n"
"You believe you see the avatar blush."
msgstr ""
"｢えー、いや？　な、なんで、そ、そう思ったんだ？｣\n"
"　あなたはアバターの顔が赤くなったのが見えたと思った。"

msgid "\"Never mind... On with it, or I'll do it myself!\""
msgstr "｢気にしないでくれ……。始めようか。まだできないなら、自分でやるけど！｣"

msgid "\"Ahem! So anyway, remember the talk about the Nexus backbone hack?\""
msgstr ""
"｢えへん！　それじゃあ、ネクサスの根幹に侵入するってことを話したのは覚えてるか"
"な？｣"

msgid "\"Remind me again.\""
msgstr "｢また教えてください｣"

msgid "\"Of course!\""
msgstr "｢もちろん！｣"

msgid ""
"Trixie's avatar seems to squint their eyes at you.\n"
"\"Let's just go over it again so we are all in sync.\""
msgstr ""
"トリクシーのアバターが目を細めてあなたを見ているようだ。\n"
"　｢とにかくまた復習をしよう。そうすればみんな息があう｣"

msgid ""
"\"So, I managed to get my hands on some old design blueprints of the Nexus, "
"like really old stuff, like maybe even before the Imperial Proclamation.\""
msgstr ""
"｢じゃあいくぞ。おれはうまいことネクサスの古い設計書をいくつか手に入れられたん"
"だ。ほんとうに古いやつみたいでな、帝国の布告よりもまえかもしれないようだった｣"

#. Hecacycle would be like century (a tad longer though)
msgid ""
"\"l337_b01 and I were looking over it, and trying to poke the Nexus to see "
"if there are similarities, and it seems the core of it has changed little, "
"buried as it is under all the layers of abstraction that have piled up on "
"top over the hecacycles.\""
msgstr ""
"｢l337_b01 とわたしはそれにざっと目を通して、ネクサスをつついて類似点があるか"
"どうか確認しようとしてたんだ。そうしたら中核部分はほとんど変更されていないよ"
"うだった。埋もれていたんだ。ヘクト周期以上にわたって積み重ねられたすべての抽"
"象化層の下にね｣"

msgid ""
"\"If we get access to it, we become Gods! All the information! All the "
"power! We could finally bring about change for the better!\""
msgstr ""
"｢もしそれにアクセスできるようになったら、われわれは神々になる！　すべての情"
"報！　すべての力！　ついにわれわれはよりよい方向に変化をひきおこすことができ"
"る！｣"

msgid ""
"\"You're getting ahead of ourselves, this is still mainly all speculation.\""
msgstr "｢早合点してるな。まだ大部分は憶測でしかないんだ｣"

msgid "\"Ah, sorry.\""
msgstr "｢ああ、残念｣"

msgid ""
"\"We still need more documents to be sure of anything. We need you to visit "
"the Data Broker at {spb} in the {sys} system.\""
msgstr ""
"｢まだなにか確信するにはもっと文書が必要だ。あなたには{sys}星系の{spb}にいる"
"データブローカーと会ってもらう必要がある｣"

msgid ""
"\"They're really weird! They're completely offline! Only way to reach out is "
"in person, and you are our best bet!\""
msgstr ""
"｢あいつはほんとうに変なんだ！　完全にオフラインなんだよ！　話をする唯一の方法"
"は自分で行くことだから、あんたが最善の策ってことになる！｣"

msgid ""
"\"Excellent. We have made all the arrangements we need to meet up with the "
"Data Broker, we'll brief you more when you get to {spb}.\""
msgstr ""
"｢すばらしい。データブローカーと会うために必要な手配はすべてしてある。あなたが"
"{spb}に着いたら概要を説明するよ｣"

msgid "\"Time to make history!\""
msgstr "｢歴史を作る時だ！｣"

msgid "Visit the Data Broker at {spb} ({sys} system)"
msgstr "{sys}星系の{spb}でデータブローカーと会え。"

#. Characters
#. Broker briefing
msgid "As you land, your two familiar holograms flare up before you."
msgstr "着陸すると、二つの見なれたホログラムがあなたの前にいきなり現れた。"

msgid "\"Spot on!\""
msgstr "｢ばっちりだ！｣"

msgid "Trixie's avatar nods."
msgstr "トリクシーのアバターがうなずく。"

msgid ""
"\"The Data Broker, he's paranoid, like really really paranoid. So he's "
"sitting on an enormous pile of data, but he never connects to the Nexus, he "
"just keeps it all offline.\""
msgstr ""
"｢データブローカーだが、こいつは病的なほど疑い深い。ほんとうの、ほんとうの偏執"
"病みたいにだ。それでやつは情報の巨大な山の上に座っているんだが、ネクサスには"
"けっして接続しない。とにかくぜんぶオフラインのままなんだ｣"

msgid "\"Risk-averse.\""
msgstr "｢危険の可能性も嫌う｣"

msgid ""
"\"Yeah, so you have to deal with him in person, which is where you come in.\""
msgstr ""
"｢そうそう、だから本人が取引する必要があってな、ここがあんたの登場するところ"
"だ｣"

msgid ""
"\"He has a ton of eccentric data, stuff you won't find in any of the nooks "
"and crannies of the Nexus. Nobody really knows where he gets his stuff, but "
"he's pretty much a go-to if you need specific info.\""
msgstr ""
"｢データブローカーはふつうじゃない情報を山ほどもっている。ネクサスの隅から隅ま"
"でくまなくさがしても見つからないものだよ。どこで手に入れたのか知っている人は"
"だれもいないけど、特定の情報が必要ならだいたいデータブローカーのところが行く"
"べきところだ｣"

msgid ""
"\"Yeah, and the clever bastard has a killswitch so that if anything happens "
"to him, it all goes poof! So all the pirates and governmental agencies have "
"to bow their heads to him if they need something.\""
msgstr ""
"｢そうとも、それにあの利口な野郎はなにかが自分におきたら全部ぱっとなくなるよう"
"に遮断装置をもってるんだよ！　だから海賊と政府機関はみんななにかが必要になっ"
"たら頭を下げなきゃならない｣"

msgid ""
"\"What we need from him is the 'NEXUS-v4.791829i Manual', which should shed "
"some light on the low-level connection protocol, the one we've not managed "
"to reverse-engineer yet.\""
msgstr ""
"｢われわれがデータブローカーから手に入れる必要があるのは『ネクサス— "
"v4.791829i マニュアル』だ。これが低水準の接続手順をやみから浮かびあがらせるは"
"ずなんだけど、そこがまだ逆行解析できていないところなんだ｣"

msgid ""
"\"Here, I'll send you the specification so you can take a hardcopy with you. "
"We won't be able to be with you when you see the broker because of his damn "
"electromagnetic shielding, but try your best to get it.\""
msgstr ""
"｢よし、明細書を送るから、複写を持っていける。あんたがブローカーと会うときにわ"
"れわれはいっしょにいられないからな。あいつのくそったれ電磁防御のおかげで。だ"
"が手に入れるために最大限努力してくれ｣"

#. Restore music
msgid "The two holograms fade out and you are left on your own."
msgstr "二つのホログラムが消えていき、あなたはひとりで残された。"

msgid ""
"You print a hardcopy of the data you were asked to get, and start to make "
"your way to the location specified by the hackers."
msgstr ""
"あなたは手に入れるように頼まれた情報の明細書を印刷し、ハッカーたちに指定され"
"た場所へ向かいはじめる。"

msgid ""
"You head to some residential quarters, on the way there you can't help shake "
"the feeling you are getting watched."
msgstr ""
"あなたはどこかの住宅用区域に向かっている。その途中で、あなたは見られていると"
"いう感覚を振りはらおうとしないではいられなかった。"

msgid ""
"Eventually you get to the location and as you approach the door it opens to "
"you, leading you towards a very pristine room with nothing but a chair."
msgstr ""
"やがてあなたはその場所に着いた。扉に近づくとあなたのために開き、あなたが導か"
"れたのはとても素朴な部屋でいすひとつ以外はなにもなかった。"

#. Remove cargo
#. Advance internal state
#. Characters
msgid "Data Broker"
msgstr "データブローカー"

msgid ""
"A voice echoes throughout the room.\n"
"\"Have a seat, {player}.\""
msgstr ""
"声が部屋じゅうに響いた。\n"
"　｢座ってくれ、{player}｣"

msgid "\"How did you know my name?\""
msgstr "｢どうしてわたしの名前を知っているんですか？｣"

msgid "Take a seat."
msgstr "座る。"

msgid "Stay standing."
msgstr "立ったままでいる。"

msgid "\"How would such trivial data escape me, the Data Broker?\""
msgstr ""
"｢そのようなささいな情報がこのわたし、データブローカーの目にどうしてとまらない"
"のか？｣"

msgid "You stay standing."
msgstr "あなたは立ったままでいる。"

msgid "You sit down in the chair, which is surprisingly comfortable."
msgstr "あなたはいすに座った。驚いたことにこのいすは快適だった。"

msgid ""
"The voice continues.\n"
"\"So what are you here for?\""
msgstr ""
"声がつづける。\n"
"　｢それでなんのためにここへ来た？｣"

msgid "\"The NEXUS-v4.791829i Manual.\""
msgstr "｢ネクサス— v4.791829i マニュアル｣"

msgid "\"The Amulet of Yendor\""
msgstr "｢イェンダーの魔除け｣"

msgid "\"Philosopher's Stone\""
msgstr "｢賢者の石｣"

msgid ""
"You hear a chuckle.\n"
"\"That was just a courtesy, I know you are here for the NEXUS-V4.791829i "
"Manual.\""
msgstr ""
"含み笑いが聞こえる。\n"
"　｢あれはただの礼儀だった。ここにはネクサス— v4.791829i マニュアルのために来"
"たと知っている｣"

msgid "\"I do have a copy of the data you seek. A fine manual it is.\""
msgstr "｢求めている情報の複製はたしかにもっている。みごとな説明書だな、あれは｣"

msgid ""
"\"Let us do a deal. I need some data delivered to {spb} in the {sys} system. "
"Do the simple delivery for me, and I would be glad to part with a copy of "
"the manual.\""
msgstr ""
"｢取引しよう。ある情報を{sys}星系の{spb}に配達する必要がある。わたしのかわりに"
"その単純な配達をおこなってくれ。そうしてくれればよろこんでマニュアルの複製を"
"手放そう｣"

msgid "\"Only a delivery?\""
msgstr "｢ただの配達？｣"

msgid "\"What about credits instead?\""
msgstr "｢かわりにクレジットでは？｣"

msgid "\"Yes. Nothing complicated for a pilot of your calibre.\""
msgstr "｢そうだ。きみのような力量のあるパイロットなら面倒なことはなにもない｣"

#. Obviously knows how many credits the player has, and will make sure they do the delivery
msgid "\"Credits work too. I will sell it to you for exactly {credits}.\""
msgstr "｢クレジットでもいい。きっかり {credits} で売ってやろう｣"

msgid "#r(Not enough credits)#0 \"Delivery sounds fine.\""
msgstr "#r(クレジットが足りません)#0 ｢配達のほうがよさそうです｣"

msgid "\"Then we have a deal.\""
msgstr "｢では決まりだ｣"

msgid ""
"The floor opens up and a small package levitates in front of you. A plain "
"white cube with no imperfections or indents of any sort."
msgstr ""
"床が開いて、小さな包みがあなたの目の前の空中に浮かんだ。装飾のない白い立方体"
"で、どんな種類の欠陥もへこみもなかった。"

msgid ""
"The door behind you opens, and you make your way back to the spaceport. On "
"your way, you think you notice something out of the corner of you eye, but "
"when you turn around you see nothing out of place. How odd."
msgstr ""
"扉があなたの背後で開き、あなたは宇宙港へ戻りはじめた。途中であなたは横目でな"
"にかに気づいたと思ったが、振りむいてみると場違いなものはなにも見えなかった。"
"なんとも妙だ。"

msgid "You get back to your ship and two holograms pop up."
msgstr "あなたが船に着くと、とつぜん二つのホログラムが現れた。"

msgid "\"Did you get the manual?\""
msgstr "｢マニュアルは手に入れたか？｣"

msgid "\"You recount your interaction with the Data Broker.\""
msgstr "あなたはデータブローカーとのやりとりをくわしく話した。"

msgid ""
"\"Strange, but to be expected. The Data Broker always prefers weird favours "
"over credits.\""
msgstr ""
"｢不思議だけど、想定内だね。データブローカーはいつもクレジットより奇妙な恩返し"
"を好むんだ｣"

msgid ""
"\"Guess there's not much we can do. {player}, it's up to you to do the "
"physical stuff. We'll keep an eye out for when you get back.\""
msgstr ""
"｢われわれにできることはあまりないと思う。{player}、物理的なことをするのはあん"
"たのほうだ。あんたが戻ってくるのを気をつけて見ているよ｣"

msgid "Time to deliver."
msgstr "配達の時間だ。"

msgid "Perfect Cube"
msgstr "完璧な立方体"

msgid ""
"A perfectly smooth white cube. It doesn't make any noise, and your ship's "
"sensors are unable to make anything of it. You have no idea what it is."
msgstr ""
"完璧になめらかで白い立方体。音はなにもしないし、船のセンサーはなにも引きだせ"
"なかった。あなたにはこれがなんなのかまったくわからなかった。"

msgid "Deliver a package to {spb} ({sys} system)"
msgstr "{sys}星系の{spb}へ包みを届けろ。"

msgid "Return to the Data Broker at {spb} ({sys} system)"
msgstr "{sys}星系の{spb}にいるデータブローカーのところへ戻れ。"

msgid "Dockworker"
msgstr "港湾労働者"

msgid ""
"You arrive to the spacedock and carry the cube to the cargo delivery centre, "
"where a weary worker attends to you."
msgstr ""
"宇宙港接舷所へ到着してあなたが立方体を持って貨物配達中央施設へ行くと、疲れた"
"労働者があなたの相手をした。"

msgid "\"Another one of these? Damnit, you playing a prank?\""
msgstr "｢またこれか？　くそったれめ、悪ふざけをしているのか？｣"

msgid "You explain your plight and that you were asked to deliver this here."
msgstr ""
"あなたは自分がおちいった状況とこれをここへ配達するように頼まれたことを説明し"
"た。"

msgid ""
"\"That's quite a pretty cube, but it's junk. I checked and nobody is "
"expecting it, we can't take it.\""
msgstr ""
"｢なかなかけっこうな立方体だが、がらくただ。確認したがだれもそいつを待っていな"
"い。受けとることはできないな｣"

msgid "Throw the cube away."
msgstr "立方体を投げ捨てる。"

msgid "Take the cube with you."
msgstr "立方体を持っていく。"

msgid ""
"Dejected, you chuck the cube into the nearest bin and head back to your "
"ship. Seems like the Data Broker has some explaining to do."
msgstr ""
"がっかりして、あなたは立方体をいちばん近くにあったゴミ箱にほうりこんで船に"
"戻った。データブローカーには釈明することがあるようだ。"

msgid ""
"Dejected, you take the cube back with you to your ship. Seems like the Data "
"Broker has some explaining to do."
msgstr ""
"がっかりして、あなたは立方体を持って船に戻った。データブローカーには釈明する"
"ことがあるようだ。"

msgid ""
"You land and head back to the Data Broker's headquarters. You still feel "
"watched on the way there, but it is different from the last time."
msgstr ""
"着陸して、あなたはデータブローカーの本拠へ戻った。そこへの途中でいまだ見られ"
"ているという感じがしたが、前回とかわりはなかった。"

msgid ""
"When you get to the location, the door discretely opens and you once again "
"find yourself in the room with the chair."
msgstr ""
"あの場所に着くと、扉が慎重に開き、あなたはまたいすのある部屋にいることになっ"
"た。"

msgid "\"Welcome back, {player}.\""
msgstr "｢おかえり、{player}｣"

msgid "\"You tried to kill me!\""
msgstr "｢わたしを殺そうとしましたね！｣"

msgid "\"What was that all about!\""
msgstr "｢あれはみんなどういうことなんです！｣"

msgid "Sit down."
msgstr "座る。"

msgid "Stand silently."
msgstr "黙って立っている。"

msgid "Throw the cube."
msgstr "立方体を投げる。"

msgid ""
"The cube bounces around before laying still on the ground. After a few "
"seconds, the floor quickly opens around the cube and it disappears from "
"sight."
msgstr ""
"立方体が跳ねまわってから床に落ちつく。二、三秒すると、立方体のまわりの床がす"
"ばやく開いて立方体は視界から消え去った。"

msgid "\"That is not going to get you anywhere.\""
msgstr "｢あれがどこかへ行きつく予定はなかった｣"

msgid ""
"\"It seems like you do not understand the data. I did not try to kill you, I "
"just had you do me a favour by eliminating certain nuisances.\""
msgstr ""
"｢きみは情報を理解していないようだ。わたしはきみを殺そうとしなかった。ただ恩返"
"しとしてあるやっかいものを除去させただけだ｣"

msgid ""
"\"The delivery was necessary to set up the conditions for success. And you "
"completed the task most excellently.\""
msgstr ""
"｢配達は成功条件を設定するのに必要なものだった。そしてきみはとくべつみごとに務"
"めを完了させた｣"

msgid "\"Here, let me provide you with the data that you require.\""
msgstr "｢さあ、必要としていた情報を提供させてくれ｣"

msgid ""
"\"So it seems you understood our deal. Let me provide you with the data that "
"you required.\""
msgstr ""
"｢するときみはわれわれの取引を理解したようだな。必要としていた情報を提供させて"
"くれ｣"

msgid "\"Quite the rebel are we.\""
msgstr "｢かなりの反感があるな、われわれには｣"

msgid ""
"\"It seems like you held your part of the bargain. Let me provide you with "
"the data that you require.\""
msgstr "｢取引のきみのぶんは守られたようだ。必要としていた情報を提供させてくれ｣"

msgid "\"But first, set the cube down.\""
msgstr "｢しかし最初に、立方体を下に置いてくれ｣"

msgid ""
"You set the cube on the ground in front of you, and the floor quickly opens "
"under it. Oh well, it was a nice cube."
msgstr ""
"あなたが立方体を目の前の床に置くと、その下で床がすばやく開いた。まあいいか、"
"あれはみごとな立方体だったけど。"

msgid "\"Excellent.\""
msgstr "｢よろしい｣"

msgid ""
"The floor opens and a holodrive appears on a small pedestal. You pocket it, "
"and turn to leave, but the door does not open."
msgstr ""
"床が開いてホロドライブが小さな台の上に載って現れた。あなたはそれをポケットに"
"入れ、振りむいて出ていこうとする。しかし扉が開いていない。"

msgid ""
"\"Some free advice from the Data Broker. Be careful with what you seek. I do "
"not think this manual will be of much use to you.\""
msgstr ""
"｢データブローカーからいくらか無料の忠告をしよう。求めているものについては気を"
"つけることだ。このマニュアルがきみたちにとっておおいに役立つとはまったく考え"
"ていない｣"

msgid "The door opens and you make your way back to the spaceport."
msgstr "扉が開き、あなたは宇宙港へ戻っていった。"

msgid "You get to your ship and the two familiar holograms appear."
msgstr "あなたが船に着くと、二つの見なれたホログラムが現れた。"

msgid "\"Did you get the...\""
msgstr "｢マニュアルは……｣"

msgid ""
"l337_b01 butts in.\n"
"\"Was the Data Broker as cool as he sounds like?\""
msgstr ""
"l337_b01 が口をはさんだ。\n"
"　｢データブローカーはいわれてるとおりクールなやつだったか？｣"

msgid "\"He's an asshole.\""
msgstr "｢くそったれでした｣"

msgid "\"Cooler than ice.\""
msgstr "｢氷よりクールでした｣"

msgid ""
"\"Whaaat!?\"\n"
"You detect the shock in their voice."
msgstr ""
"｢なんだって !? ｣\n"
"　あなたは声に動揺を感じた。"

msgid "Trixie snickers."
msgstr "トリクシーが忍び笑いをする。"

msgid "\"That's a surprise. I would have expected him to be an asshole.\""
msgstr "｢それは驚きだね。くそったれだと予想してたんだ｣"

msgid "\"Anyway, plug in the holodrive now, I want to see it!\""
msgstr "｢それはともかく、もうホロドライブをつなげてくれ。見てみたい！｣"

msgid ""
"You plug it in your ship's console and the hackers quickly help themselves "
"to the data."
msgstr ""
"あなたがホロドライブを船の制御卓につなげると、ハッカーたちはすぐに自分たちで"
"情報を取りこんだ。"

msgid ""
"\"Let's see what we have here...\n"
"'confidential, for your eyes only'... boring...\n"
"wow, only 7D cryptographic encodings...\""
msgstr ""
"｢手に入れたものを見てみよう……\n"
" 『機密、複写禁止』……退屈な……\n"
"　うわっ、7D 暗号解読符号化だけか……｣"

msgid "\"Running the reconstruction cipher...\""
msgstr "｢復元した暗号を走らせてるよ……｣"

msgid ""
"You hear more beeping as they start to make themselves at home with your "
"ship's computational power."
msgstr ""
"さらなる発信音が聞こえた。二人は遠慮せずあなたの船の計算能力を使いはじめたの"
"だ。"

msgid "\"Almost there... aham! That's it!\""
msgstr "｢もうすぐだ……あはっ！　これで終わり！｣"

msgid "\"Got a lock?\""
msgstr "｢鍵が手に入った？｣"

msgid ""
"\"Yup! I think I've found an entry point to the backend. It's really old-"
"school, I thought it would be port knocking or something, but it's actually "
"a physical backdoor!\""
msgstr ""
"｢ああ！　裏側への入り口を見つけたと思う。ほんとうに旧式で、ポートをたたくかな"
"んかすると思ったら、じつは物理的裏口だったんだ！｣"

#. Pinocles Station incident is where a short circuit of a physical backdoor was crashed into and accidentally vented the station atmosphere killing everyone
msgid "\"Wow! Those have been banned since the Pinocles Station incident.\""
msgstr "｢おお！　あれはピノクル・ステーション事件で禁止されたけど｣"

msgid "\"Pinocles Station?\""
msgstr "｢ピノクル・ステーション？｣"

msgid ""
"\"Physical backdoor short-circuit vented the atmosphere, all dead. Didn't "
"you study your protocols?\""
msgstr ""
"｢物理的裏口が短絡して空気が抜けて、全員死んだんだ。規約を勉強しなかった？｣"

msgid ""
"\"Eh heh, that stuff makes me fall asleep.\"\n"
"They rub their eyes.\n"
"\"Anyway, I got the location!\""
msgstr ""
"｢あー、ヘヘっ、あういうやつは寝くなるんだ｣\n"
"　l337_b01 が目をこする。\n"
"　｢それはともかく、場所がわかった！｣"

msgid "\"Well, don't keep us waiting, where is it?\""
msgstr "｢なあ、待たせないでくれ。どこにある？｣"

msgid ""
"\"It's at the old rickety station of {spb} in the {sys} system. I knew the "
"station was old, but never thought it was that old!\""
msgstr ""
"｢{sys}星系の{spb}にある古くてがたがたのステーションだ。古いのは知ってたが、そ"
"んなに古いとはまったく思わなかったよ！｣"

msgid ""
"\"You never know with these stations. It could even just be some piece "
"reused from somewhere else.\""
msgstr ""
"｢そんなステーションのことなんかぜんぜん知らないだろ。ほかのどこかから再利用さ"
"れた部品がいくつかってだけのこともある｣"

msgid "\"Only one way to find out! {player}, onwards to {spb}!\""
msgstr "｢唯一の方法は見つけだすことだ！　{player}、{spb}へ進め！｣"

msgid ""
"\"Looks like the Nexus relay is being flaky. Don't worry, they should be "
"back the moment it stabilizes. We'll get back to you later!\""
msgstr ""
"｢ネクサス中継機がぱりぱりになっているようだな。心配するな。安定したら戻るはず"
"だ。われわれはあとであんたのところへ戻ってくるよ！｣"

msgid "It seems the hackers might need your help again..."
msgstr "ハッカーたちはまたあなたの助けを必要とするかもしれないようだ……"

msgid "Mercenary Boss"
msgstr "傭兵の親分"

#. TODO actually handling aliveness? Meh, just let them kill the player
msgid "That's the ship! Try to take them alive!"
msgstr "あの船だ！　生け捕りを試せ！"

#. Have one say something about running away
msgid "Shit! Get out of here!"
msgstr "くそっ！　ここから逃げろ！"

#. No longer aggressive when they run away
#. Stop all music
msgid ""
"You are suddenly surprised by l337_b01 opening a holo-connection on the "
"distress channel."
msgstr ""
"あなたはとつぜんで驚いた。l337_b01 が遭難信号回線でホロ接続を開いたのだ。"

msgid ""
"You hear a loud sobbing.\n"
"\"T-T-tt...\"\n"
"The wailing continues."
msgstr ""
"大きなすすり泣きの声が聞こえた。\n"
"　｢と、と、と……｣\n"
"　泣き叫びがつづく。"

msgid "\"What's wrong?\""
msgstr "｢なにか悪いことが？｣"

msgid "\"Trixie?\""
msgstr "｢トリクシーは？｣"

msgid "\"Take a deep breath!\""
msgstr "｢深呼吸をして！｣"

msgid ""
"They inhale deeply, cough a bit, and continue.\n"
"\"T-Trixie got peeled!\""
msgstr ""
"l337_b01 は深く息を吸い、ちょっとせきをしてからつづけた。\n"
"　｢ト、トリクシーが身ばれした！｣"

#. TODO some sad + dramatic music
msgid "\"Whaaaat!?\""
msgstr "｢どういうことなんです !? ｣"

msgid ""
"\"I should have known something was wrong. I thought it was just a fluke of "
"the system, neglected to run the usual diagnostics... Why did this have to "
"happen!?!\"\n"
"You hear a big sob."
msgstr ""
"｢なにかがまちがっているとわかっているべきだった。システムにあったただのまぐれ"
"当りだと思ったんだ。無視していつもの診断プログラムを走らせなかった……。どうし"
"てこうなってしまったんだ !?! ｣\n"
"　大きなすすり泣きの声が聞こえる。"

msgid ""
"\"Trixie, oh Trixie, you are the better and stronger one. I should have been "
"the one peeled, not you. You're the real hacker.\"\n"
"The words blend into inconsolable yelling and sobbing."
msgstr ""
"｢トリクシー、ああ、トリクシー。優秀で、強いほうなんだ。おれのほうが身ばれすべ"
"きだったのに。トリクシーじゃなくて。トリクシーはほんもののハッカーなんだ｣\n"
"　言葉がなぐさめようのない叫びとすすり泣きに溶けこんだ。"

msgid "\"It's not your fault.\""
msgstr "｢あなたのせいじゃない｣"

msgid "\"They could be alright still.\""
msgstr "｢まだ無事かもしれませんよ｣"

msgid ""
"\"But, Trixie! T-Trixie!!!\"\n"
"They wail with abundance of sorrow."
msgstr ""
"｢でも、トリクシーが！　ト、トリクシー !!! ｣\n"
"　l337_b01 がありあまる悲痛に声をあげて泣く。"

#. Message send by SAI
msgid ""
"You notice a notification on your ship's control panel, apparently regarding "
"a large explosion on {spb} in the {sys} system. This doesn't look good."
msgstr ""
"あなたは船の制御卓の通知に気がついた。みたところ、{sys}星系の{spb}でおきた大"
"爆発にかんするものらしい。これはよさそうに見えない。"

msgid ""
"\"It's over! We're doomed!\"\n"
"They cough a bit, choking on their tears."
msgstr ""
"｢終わりだ！　われわれは破滅する運命だ！｣\n"
"　l337_b01 がちょっとせきをした。涙が枯れている。"

msgid "\"I can't go on without them. Without Trixie...\""
msgstr "｢トリクシーがいないとつづけられない。トリクシーがいないと……｣"

msgid "\"We aren't going down without a fight!\""
msgstr "｢戦わずに倒れたりしませんよ！｣"

msgid "\"Trixie wouldn't want it to end like this!\""
msgstr "｢トリクシーはこんなふうに終わるのを望んでいなかったはずですよ！｣"

msgid ""
"They give a big sniffle.\n"
"\"You're right. This isn't what Trixie would do.\"\n"
"You hear the sound of them blowing their nose."
msgstr ""
"l337_b01 が大きくすすり上げる音をさせた。\n"
"　｢あんたが正しい。これはトリクシーがしようとしていたことじゃない｣\n"
"　鼻をかむ音が聞こえる。"

msgid ""
"There is a deep sigh.\n"
"\"Give me one second.\"\n"
"They cough, probably clearing the tears."
msgstr ""
"大きなため息がする。\n"
"　｢ 1 秒くれ。｣\n"
"　l337_b01 がせきをした。たぶん涙もふいているのだろう。"

msgid ""
"You hear a surprisingly clear voice.\n"
"\"Wait, how could I have missed this? There's a stray packet coming from the "
"{sys} relay. Looks like...!!\"\n"
"They go silent as you start receiving a new voice channel."
msgstr ""
"驚いたことにあなたははっきりとした声を聞いた。\n"
"　｢待った、どうしてこれを見逃せたのか？　{sys}の中継機から来たはぐれパケット"
"がある。まるで…… !! ｣\n"
"　l337_b01 が黙ると、新しい音声回線で受信がはじまった。"

msgid ""
"\"Heyo.\"\n"
"The voice sounds very old and tired."
msgstr ""
"｢へよ｣\n"
"　その声はとても歳をとって疲れているように聞こえた。"

msgid ""
"\"Glad you found this l337_b01, though I hoped it'd never come to you "
"hearing my real voice like this.\""
msgstr ""
"｢きみがこれを見つけてくれてうれしいよ、l337_b01。こんなふうに自分のほんとうの"
"声を聞くことにはぜったいならないでほしかったけど｣"

msgid ""
"\"I don't have much time, I'm recording this on the go.\"\n"
"You hear a siren in the background."
msgstr ""
"｢あまり時間はない。これはやりながら記録している｣\n"
"　あなたは背後にサイレンの音を聞いた。"

msgid ""
"\"Shit, they're moving faster than I expected.\"\n"
"Loud and furious typing intensifies in the background."
msgstr ""
"｢くそっ、むこうは予想より速く動いているな｣\n"
"　猛烈で大きな打鍵の音が背後で強くなる。"

msgid ""
"\"Since I was dropped offline, I've been trying to trace the freak. They're "
"very good, almost too good.\""
msgstr ""
"｢わたしはオフラインに落とされてから、異常なやつを追跡しつづけようとしてたん"
"だ。あいつはとてもうまかった。うますぎたともいえる｣"

#. Modified / hacked part done by underworlder
msgid ""
"The audio seems to break up.\n"
"\"But not *CRACKLE* enough. *HISS* tracked *POP*-nal to *CRACKLE* *SCRATCH* "
"lonewolf4 *HISS* *CRACKLE*\""
msgstr ""
"音声がくずれているようだ。\n"
"　｢しかしじゅうぶん * パチパチ * じゃない。* シュー * * ポン * に * パチパチ "
"* ローンウルフ 4 * ガリガリ * 追跡した * シュー * * パチパチ *｣"

msgid ""
"The audio seems to recover.\n"
"\"*SCRITCH* my suspicions that this was a fellow technomancer, but I didn't "
"think they'd be so brash.\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Oh shit, this looks like the end of the line for me.\""
msgstr "｢くそっ、これがわたしの終点のようだね｣"

msgid ""
"The tone in the voice changes, almost nostalgic.\n"
"\"l337_b01, everything is in your hands now. Just like the old times... I'll "
"be waiting with v3c70r and DEADBEEF...\""
msgstr ""
"声の調子が変わる。懐かしく話をしているかのようだ。\n"
"　｢l337_b01、すべてはもうきみの手の中にある。ちょうど昔のように……わたしは "
"v3c70r や DEADBEEF といっしょに待っているよ……｣"

msgid "\"CONNECTION TERMINATED\""
msgstr "｢接続が終了しました｣"

msgid ""
"\"Damnit Trixie, I looked up to you!\"\n"
"They take another deep breath.\n"
"\"I can't let this be!\""
msgstr ""
"｢くそっ、トリクシー、あんたを尊敬してた！｣\n"
"　l337_b01 がまた深く息をする。\n"
"　｢このままにしておくなんてできないぞ！｣"

msgid "\"{player}, I can't involve you more. Stay alive out there.\""
msgstr ""
"｢{player}、あんたをこれ以上巻きこむことはできない。よそで生きつづけてくれ｣"

msgid ""
"The connection cuts off abruptly. You can't help but worry about what "
"drastic action l337_b01 may end up taking."
msgstr ""
"接続が不意に切れた。あなたは l337_b01 がするかもしれない思いきった行動のこと"
"を心配せざるをえなかった。"

#. Update Ian
msgid ""
"You helped l337_b01 and Trixie obtain a manual referencing a long-forgotten "
"Nexus Backbone backdoor from the Data Broker. As you make your way to the "
"backdoor, Trixie gets peeled, throwing your plans into disarray. l337_b01 "
"seems like they might resort to something drastic."
msgstr ""
"あなたは l337_b01 とトリクシーがデータブローカーからマニュアルを手に入れるの"
"を助けた。そのマニュアルは長く忘れられていたネクサス根幹への裏口に言及してい"
"るのだ。裏口へ向かっていると、トリクシーが身ばれしたため、あなたたちの計画は"
"台なしになる。l337_b01 はなにか思いきったことをしかねないようだった。"

#. Happy Ending :D
#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Onion Society 06">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>3</priority>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <done>Onion Society 05</done>
#. <cond>
#. local c = spob.cur()
#. local f = c:faction()
#. if not f or not f:tags("generic") then
#. return false
#. end
#. return true
#. </cond>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Onion Society</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. Onion 06
#.
#. Emergency Conclave Time
#. --
msgid "Emergency Conclave"
msgstr "緊急秘密会議"

#. Create the mission
msgid "Onion Society Conclave"
msgstr "オニオン協会の秘密会議"

msgid ""
"It seems like your Ship AI is able to set you up with a connection to an "
"Onion Society Conclave."
msgstr ""
"あなたの船の AI は、あなたをオニオン協会の秘密会議に接続する用意ができるよう"
"だ。"

msgid "Join the emergency Onion Society conclave."
msgstr "オニオン協会の緊急秘密会議に参加せよ。"

msgid "Your ship AI {shipai} materializes in front of you."
msgstr "あなたの船の AI である{shipai}があなたの目の前に姿を現した。"

#. Is it truly your SAI, or is it... DOG!??!
msgid ""
"\"I'll spare you the details, but I believe it may be of your interest to "
"join an emergency Onion Society conclave to keep an eye out on l337_b01.\"\n"
"The hologram slightly flickers.\n"
"\"I can arrange a connection if you so desire.\""
msgstr ""
"｢詳細は省きますが、オニオン協会の緊急秘密会議に参加して l337_b01 から目を離さ"
"ないでおくことにあなたが興味をもつかもしれないと思いました｣\n"
"　ホログラムがわずかに明滅する。\n"
"　｢あなたがそのように望むなら、手配できます｣"

msgid "Establish the connection."
msgstr "接続を確立する。"

msgid "How can you do this?"
msgstr "どうしてそんなことができるんです？"

msgid ""
"With tensions high, you decide it's best to hold off on joining an Onion "
"Society Conclave."
msgstr ""
"強い緊張感をもって、あなたはオニオン協会秘密会議への参加は待つのが最善だと判"
"断した。"

msgid ""
"\"Hopefully this is of no offense - I was able to record the protocol last "
"time you joined, and should be able to replicate the connection to join like "
"before.\""
msgstr ""
"｢たぶんお気に触わることはないと思いますが⸺あなたが最後に接続したときの手順は"
"わたしには記録可能でした。だから接続を複製すれば前回のようにつなげられるはず"
"です｣"

msgid ""
"\"I've done some modifications to further mask your presence, but more "
"likely than not you will be noticed.\""
msgstr ""
"｢いくつか変更したので、あなたがいることはもっと隠されます。しかし気づかれない"
"可能性は高くありません｣"

msgid ""
"You accept and strap into a full sensorial holodeck. Once again you are "
"thrust into an uncanny feeling as you plunge into the Nexus."
msgstr ""
"あなたは受けいれ、全知覚ホロデッキに入って体を固定した。またもやあなたは薄気"
"味悪い感触がする中へと押しこめられ、ネクサスの中に投げこまれた。"

msgid ""
"At least this time you seem to be much less affected by the Nexus syndrome."
msgstr "すくなくとも今回はネクサス症候群の影響がずっと少なかったようだ。"

#. Trixie would be at 4*offset, but we keep it empty on purpose
msgid "You join what seems like a Conclave already in progress."
msgstr "あなたはすでに進んでいたらしい秘密会議に参加した。"

msgid "\"And that's it? TRIXIE WAS DAMN PEELED, YOU HEARTLESS BASTARDS!\""
msgstr ""
"｢それでおしまい？　トリクシーはくそ身ばれしたんだよ。あんたたちは薄情野郎ども"
"だ！｣"

msgid ""
"\"Oh please, no need to cause a scene just because your protégé screwed up. "
"They weren't even a keeper!\""
msgstr ""
"｢ああ、たのむよ、大騒ぎをひきおこす必要はない。きみの子分がしくじったってだけ"
"なんだから。管理者でさえなかったんだ！｣"

msgid ""
"\"Trixie's untimely demise is another grave misfortune, yet another in this "
"cosmic tragedy. We shall spare some tears, but the Onion Society shall "
"persist, such as it always has, in defiance of annihilation.\""
msgstr ""
"｢トリクシーの時ならぬ逝去はさらなるゆゆしい不運である。この宇宙の悲劇のなかの"
"もう一例だ。われわれはいくらか涙する機会をもつだろうが、オニオン協会は存続す"
"ることだろう。いつもそうだったように、絶滅をものともせずに｣"

msgid ""
"\"You MONSTERS! All you think about is power! We're supposed to be a SOCIETY!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"｢あんたたちは化け物だ！　あんたたちが考えることは力のことだけだ！　おれたちは"
"共同体ってことになってるんだぞ！｣"

msgid "\"We're a society of MONSTERS! Ha ha ha\""
msgstr "｢われわれは化け物の共同体だ！　ハ、ハ、ハ｣"

msgid ""
"\"And what would you have us do? Risk everything to save Trixie? We can't "
"afford more losses, only 4 keepers are left. And you know what that means.\""
msgstr ""
"｢それであんたはわれわれになにをさせたかったんだ？　すべての危険をおかしてトリ"
"クシーを救う？　われわれにこれ以上の損失をだす余裕はない。たった 4 人しか管理"
"者は残っていないんだ。そしてそれが意味することはあんたもわかっているな｣"

msgid "\"4 keepers! 4 monster keepers! Ha ha ha\""
msgstr "｢4 人の管理者！　4 人の化け物管理者！　ハ、ハ、ハ｣"

msgid ""
"\"Silence! Begone is the time of buffoonery! Are naught the outcomes of "
"these perilous times decided by the council?\""
msgstr ""
"｢静まれ！　失せろ、下品なおどけの時間よ！　無は評議会で決したこの危険な時代の"
"結果であるのか？｣"

#. Music should be faster and more chaotic if possible
msgid "\"THERE WOULD BE 5 KEEPERS STILL HAD WE SAVED TRIXIE!\""
msgstr ""
"｢まだ 5 人の管理者がいたはずなんだ。われわれがトリクシーを救っていたら！｣"

msgid "\"5 keepers! 5 keepers! Ha ha ha\""
msgstr "｢5 人の管理者！　5 人の管理者！　ハ、ハ、ハ｣"

msgid "lonewolf4 mutters something under their breath and puppet stiffens up."
msgstr "ローンウルフ 4 が小声でなにかぶつぶつというと、パペットがこわばった。"

msgid "\"C'mon, no rough play in the council.\""
msgstr "｢おいおい、評議会で荒っぽいまねはなしにしてくれ｣"

msgid ""
"notasockpuppet flickers back and frowns at lonewolf4.\n"
"\"Bad wolf.\""
msgstr ""
"ノットアソックパペットがちらつきながら戻り、ローンウルフ 4 に顔をしかめた。\n"
"　｢悪いオオカミだ｣"

msgid ""
"\"Shallst thus endure, then it will be up to each one to fond for naught "
"other than themselves. Woe is such an end of the mighty Onion Society!\""
msgstr ""
"｢なんじが耐えることになれば、自身以外を無価値とするのを好むのはそれぞれしだい"
"となろう。悲痛は強きオニオン協会のなかではそのように終わる！｣"

msgid ""
"\"I've had enough of this THEATRICAL BULLSHIT. Why'd you do it lonewolf4, "
"huh? Why!?\""
msgstr ""
"｢その芝居じみたたわごとはじゅうぶんだ。どうしてそんなことをする、ローンウル"
"フ 4 ？　なあ？　どうしてだ !? ｣"

msgid "\"What vile thoughts dost thou put forth, wretch?\""
msgstr "｢なんたる恥ずべき見解を述べるのか？　恥知らずめ｣"

#. Music should be faster and more chaotic if possible
msgid ""
"\"After T-Trixie got peeled, I found a packet with audio. YOUR NAME WAS ON "
"IT LONEWOLF4!\""
msgstr ""
"｢ト、トリクシーは身ばれしたあと、おれは音声パケットを見つけた。あんたの名前が"
"そこにあったよ、ローンウルフ 4！｣"

msgid "notasockpuppet seems to be enjoying this."
msgstr "ノットアソックパペットはこれを楽しんでいるらしい。"

msgid ""
"\"Lo, each accusation is but the echo of one's own sin. You speak as though "
"you are special, as though you are different, but hesitated not to kill "
"everyone, including keeper v3c70r on Tenebros Station to save your own hide! "
"Wolf forgets not!\""
msgstr ""
"｢見よ、告発のそれぞれはたんに自身の罪の反響である。おまえは自分がとくべつであ"
"るかのように話す。自分はちがうかのように。しかしためらうことなくだれをも殺"
"す。自身の隠れ家を守るためにテネブロス・ステーションで管理者 v3c70r にしたこ"
"ともな。ウルフが忘れることはない！｣"

msgid ""
"\"THAT'S NOT... Not... not...\"\n"
"Their voice fades out."
msgstr ""
"｢あれはちがう……ちがう……ちがう……｣\n"
"　l337_b01 の声が小さくなっていく。"

msgid ""
"\"Thou canst not deny the weight of this evidence! Thou hast slain v3c70r as "
"thou hast now slain Trixie, and seekest to lay the blame at mine own feet, "
"that thou might further thy own wicked designs!\""
msgstr ""
"｢なんじはこの証拠の重みを否認しえない！　なんじは v3c70r を殺害したのと同じく"
"トリクシーを殺害した。そしてその足でひとに罪を着せようと努めたのだ。なんじの"
"邪悪な計画をさらに進めようとして！｣"

msgid ""
"\"Behold ye all! Silence! They offer no rebuttal for their exposed sins! "
"Perhaps the peeling of DEADBEEF was also of thy doing!\""
msgstr ""
"｢見よ、みなのもの！　静まれ！　さらされた罪に反証は出されなかった！　ことによ"
"ると DEADBEEF の身ばれもなんじのしたことであろう！｣"

msgid ""
"The name DEADBEEF seems to resonate in l337_b01.\n"
"\"YOU! YOU DON'T KNOW ANYTHING! GO TO HELL!\""
msgstr ""
"DEADBEEF の名前が l337_b01 に響きわたったように見える。\n"
"　｢おまえは！　おまえはなにもわかっていない！　地獄へ落ちろ！｣"

msgid "l337_b01 drops the connection."
msgstr "l337_b01 が接続から落ちた。"

msgid "\"And thus truth exposed.\""
msgstr "｢そしてかように真実がさらされた｣"

msgid ""
"They suddenly focus their gaze on you.\n"
"\"And what do we have here?\""
msgstr ""
"ローンウルフ 4 がとつぜんあなたに焦点をあわせてじっと見た。\n"
"　｢それでわれわれはここになにをいさせてるんだ？｣"

msgid ""
"You abruptly are dropped out of the Nexus. Ugh, and there goes your last "
"meal with it."
msgstr ""
"あなたは不意にネクサスから落ちた。うえっ、それで最後の食事もいっしょに出てき"
"た。"

msgid ""
"That did not go very well, maybe you should follow up on l337_b01 once you "
"feel a bit better."
msgstr ""
"あれはあまりうまく進んでいなかった。気分がもうすこしよくなれば、たぶん "
"l337_b01 を追いかけるべきなんだろう。"

msgid ""
"An emergency Onion Society Conclave was held where l337_b01 got in a fight "
"with other members. There was a lot of name-calling, and names you didn't "
"recognize being thrown around, and the Conclave ended with l337_b01 leaving "
"in anger."
msgstr ""
"オニオン協会の緊急秘密会議が開催され、そこで l337_b01 とほかの会員のけんかに"
"なった。たくさんの悪口がいわれ、あなたにはわからない名前が投げちらされ、秘密"
"会議は l337_b01 が腹を立てて抜けることで終わった。"

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Onion Society 07">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>3</priority>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <done>Onion Society 06</done>
#. <cond>
#. local c = spob.cur()
#. local f = c:faction()
#. if not f or not f:tags("generic") then
#. return false
#. end
#. return true
#. </cond>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Onion Society</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. Onion 07
#.
#. Simple mission mainly there to set up some flavour and story stuff.
#.
#. Player sets up honeypot, does some scans, and beats up mercenaries.
#. --
#. local tut = require "common.tutorial"
#. Reference to honeypot (trap)
msgid "Onion and Honey"
msgstr "タマネギとハチミツ"

msgid "Try to get in touch with l337_b01."
msgstr "l337_b01 に連絡を試みよ。"

msgid ""
"Help l337_b01 find out who the instigator is by setting up a honeypot and "
"monitoring communications in the {sys} system."
msgstr ""
"l337_b01 を手伝い、ハニーポットを設置して{sys}星系の通信を監視することで張本"
"人がだれなのかさがしだせ。"

msgid "Go to the location in the {sys} system"
msgstr "{sys}星系のその位置へ行け。"

msgid "Scan ships in the system"
msgstr "星系内の船をスキャンせよ。"

msgid "You send a connection request to the Nexus address of l337_b01."
msgstr "あなたは接続要求をネクサスの l337_b01 のアドレスに送った。"

msgid "There is no response, but you keep on trying."
msgstr "応答がない。しかしあなたは試しつづけた。"

msgid "....."
msgstr "……"

msgid "......."
msgstr "…………"

msgid "You're about to give up for now when the connection gets through."
msgstr "いまのところはあきらめようとしたとき、接続が通った。"

#. TODO different music
msgid "l337_b01's avatar appears in front of you."
msgstr "l337_b01 のアバターがあなたの目の前に姿を現した。"

msgid "\"l337_b01, you alright?\""
msgstr "｢l337_b01、だいじょうぶですか？｣"

msgid "There is a long pause."
msgstr "長いまがあった。"

msgid "\"Not really, no.\""
msgstr "｢そうでもない、だめだな｣"

msgid "\"I guess I made a mess out there.\""
msgstr "｢あっちではめちゃくちゃをやってしまったと思う｣"

msgid "\"It was already a mess.\""
msgstr "｢すでにめちゃくちゃでした｣"

msgid "\"Can't be helped.\""
msgstr "｢どうしようもありませんでした｣"

msgid "\"I barely followed.\""
msgstr "｢ほとんどついていけませんでした｣"

msgid ""
"You hear a long sigh.\n"
"\"It's a long story. Sorry, I'm not in the mood to remember it now.\""
msgstr ""
"あなたは長いため息を聞いた。\n"
"　｢長い話なんだ。すまない、今は思いだす気分じゃない｣"

msgid "\"Something feels wrong. Almost like a dream.\""
msgstr "｢なにかがまちがってるように感じる。まるで夢みたいだ｣"

msgid "\"You're in shock.\""
msgstr "｢精神的な打撃をうけてるんですよ｣"

msgid "\"Something is definitely fishy.\""
msgstr "｢なにか確実に怪しいです｣"

msgid ""
"\"And you aren't!?!\"\n"
"They go quiet for a second."
msgstr ""
"｢あんたはちがうのか !?! ｣\n"
"　l337_b01 はすぐに落ちついた。"

msgid ""
"\"It was all going so well, this couldn't... shouldn't have happened...\""
msgstr "｢ぜんぶあんなにうまくいっていた。それが……こうなるはずがなかった……｣"

msgid "\"Is the Nexus IT is behind this?\""
msgstr "｢ネクサス IT がこの背後にいるんですか？｣"

msgid "\"You think someone in the Onion society did this?\""
msgstr "｢オニオン協会のだれかがこうしたと考えている？｣"

msgid ""
"\"I think someone is working against us. Maybe someone has been tracking us "
"the entire time.\""
msgstr ""
"｢だれかがおれたちに対抗する動きをしているんだと考えている。たぶんだれかがずっ"
"とおれたちを観察していたんだ｣"

msgid ""
"\"That's very unlikely. The Nexus IT don't have the skills or authority to "
"pull something like this off. They would have left a trail several light "
"years wide.\""
msgstr ""
"｢それはとてもありそうにない。ネクサス IT にはこの手のことをやってのけるだけの"
"腕も権限もないんだ。あいつらだったら数光年にもわたる手がかりを残していっただ"
"ろう｣"

msgid "\"It has to be someone much more knowledgeable about this.\""
msgstr "｢こういうことについてずっと知識のあるだれかにちがいない｣"

msgid ""
"\"Is there any other way someone could have tracked us without noticing? "
"They have to have serious skills.\""
msgstr ""
"｢だれかが気づかれずにおれたちを観察してたってのに、ほかにどんな方法がある？　"
"かなりの腕をもっているのにちがいないんだ｣"

msgid "\"Who do you think it is?\""
msgstr "｢だれだと思う？｣"

#. Randomize order of main 4 targets
#. Light Purple
msgid "underworlder"
msgstr "アンダーワールダー"

#. Dark Purple
msgid "DOG"
msgstr "ドッグ"

#. Dark Brown
msgid "notasockpuppet"
msgstr "ノットアソックパペット"

msgid "lonewolf4"
msgstr "ローンウルフ 4 "

#. Teal-ish
msgid "Trixie"
msgstr "トリクシー"

msgid ""
"\"I thought about them, but they don't seem to have that much to gain in "
"this. They always dislike change, and want to keep things as stable as they "
"can be.\""
msgstr ""
"｢やつのことは考えたよ。しかしあれでそれほどのものを得られるようには見えない。"
"あいつはいつも変化を嫌っていた。それにできるだけ物事を安定させておきたがるん"
"だ｣"

msgid ""
"\"Let me think about it.\"\n"
"They go silent for a bit.\n"
"\"I guess DOG is a possibility, however, it is unlikely. They don't have "
"much to gain in this as they are no longer a keeper of the secrets.\""
msgstr ""
"｢考えさせてくれ｣\n"
"　l337_b01 がすこし黙った。\n"
"　｢ドッグの可能性はある。だがありそうにないな。もう秘密の管理者でもないから、"
"あれからそれほどの利益は得られないんだ｣"

msgid ""
"\"Ah, I'll explain what keeper of the secrets is later, just trust me here.\""
msgstr ""
"｢ああ、秘密の管理者ってのがなんなのかはあとで説明する。とにかく今は信じてく"
"れ｣"

msgid ""
"\"notasockpuppet? They're an asshole, but I don't think they have the "
"patience to do something like this. They seem to only be able to focus on "
"things for a couple of periods before they get bored.\""
msgstr ""
"｢ノットアソックパペット？　あいつはろくなやつじゃないが、あのようなことをする"
"だけの根気があるとは思っていない。物事に集中できるのは 2 時限だけで、それから"
"飽きるんだ｣"

msgid ""
"\"That's exactly what I was thinking! You can see them trying to pin the "
"blame on me! It's almost as if they are trying to escalate the situation to "
"their own game.\""
msgstr ""
"｢それがまさにおれの考えていたことだ！　あいつがおれに罪をなすりつけようとした"
"のがわかっただろ！　まるで自分のいいように事態を拡大させようとしているみたい"
"だった｣"

msgid "\"Good to see we are on the same page.\""
msgstr "｢同じところに目をつけていたんだとわかってよかったよ｣"

msgid "ogre"
msgstr "オーガ"

msgid ""
"\"You serious? Ogre is long gone. They barely had the skills to tie their "
"own shoelaces let alone do anything serious on the Nexus.\""
msgstr ""
"｢まじめにやってるのか？　オーガはずっとまえに消えている。自分の靴ひもを結ぶ腕"
"もほとんどなかったのに、ネクサスでなにか重要なことをすることなんかいうまでも"
"ない｣"

msgid "trixie"
msgstr "トリクシー"

msgid ""
"\"Don't joke about that.\"\n"
"They let out a sigh."
msgstr ""
"｢このことでふざけるのはやめろ｣\n"
"　l337_b01 がため息をついた。"

msgid ""
"\"I guess it's not entirely out of the question, but why would they peel "
"themselves? Or was it all a ruse to cover their tracks?\""
msgstr ""
"｢まったく論外ってわけじゃないとは思う。しかしどうして自分で身ばれする？　それ"
"とも行方をくらませる策略ってだけなのか？｣"

msgid ""
"\"It just sounds like a wild conspiracy theory. I don't think it makes sense "
"to go down that train of thought.\""
msgstr ""
"｢とっぴな陰謀論ってだけに聞こえる。そういう考えを深めて役に立つとは思わない"
"な｣"

msgid ""
"\"I was thinking that it is probably lonewolf4, you can see them trying to "
"pin the blame on me. It's almost as if they are trying to escalate the "
"situation to their own game!\""
msgstr ""
"｢おれはおそらくローンウルフ 4 だろうと考えていた。あいつがおれに罪をなすりつ"
"けようとしたのがわかっただろ。まるで自分のいいように事態を拡大させようとして"
"いるみたいだった！｣"

msgid ""
"\"I've always got the creeps from them. With their weird role-playing and "
"funny talk and everything.\""
msgstr ""
"｢おれはいつもあいつらにはぞっとさせられていた。あの気味の悪い役柄を演じるのと"
"おかしな話をするってやつとなにもかもが｣"

msgid ""
"\"We can't sit back and let them win. Trixie would...\"\n"
"They have to take a deep breath.\n"
"\"Trixie would never quit! And I'm not going to either!\""
msgstr ""
"｢じっと座っていて勝たせてやることなんかできないぞ。トリクシーなら……｣\n"
"　l337_b01 は深呼吸をしなければならなかった。\n"
"　｢トリクシーならけっしてやめないだろう！　それにおれもそんなことをするつもり"
"はない！｣"

msgid ""
"\"I've got an idea. We can set up a honeypot and then see if we can trap the "
"bastard and get their general location. One second, it seems like the {sys} "
"system would be a good place to set this up. You in?\""
msgstr ""
"｢考えがある。ハニーポットを設置すれば、あの野郎をわなにかけておおまかな位置が"
"わかるかどうか確認できる。ちょっと待った、{sys}星系がこいつを設置するにはよい"
"場所になりそうだな。やるか？｣"

msgid "You open a channel with l337_b01."
msgstr "あなたは l337_b01 との回線を開いた。"

msgid ""
"\"Ready to set up the honeypot to trap the bastard? The {sys} system would "
"be a good place to set this up. You in?\""
msgstr ""
"｢ハニーポットを設置してあの野郎をわなにかける用意をするんだ。{sys}星系がこい"
"つを設置するにはよい場所になりそうだ。やるか？｣"

msgid "\"Let me get ready.\""
msgstr "｢用意させてください｣"

msgid "\"OK, get in touch with me when you are ready to do this.\""
msgstr "｢わかった。やる用意ができたら連絡してくれ｣"

msgid ""
"\"Great! You leave the specifics to me, I'll be proxying through your ship "
"again. Get us to the {sys} system and I'll handle the hacking.\""
msgstr ""
"｢よし！　具体的なことはおれに任せてくれるな。またあんたの船を代理として使うつ"
"もりなんだ。{sys}星系へ連れていってくれ。そうすればおれがハッキングのところは"
"対処する｣"

#. Try to get a good position
msgid "Honeypot"
msgstr "ハニーポット"

msgid "l337_b01: I've set up the honeypot. Start scanning ships!"
msgstr "l337_b01: ハニーポットを設置した。船のスキャンを始めよう！"

#. set up OSD and such
#. Make random mercenaries attack the player
#. Reset state
msgid "l337_b01: OK, I need you to scan some ships. Any will do."
msgstr ""
"l337_b01: よし、いくつか船をスキャンするのにあんたが必要だ。なんでもいい。"

#. Small chat with dog
msgid "Your systems flicker for a second, before a familiar hologram appears."
msgstr "あなたの船のシステムが一瞬ちらついてから、見なれたホログラムが現れた。"

msgid ""
"\"Pardon the intrusion, {name}. I do not have much time, so I will keep this "
"brief.\""
msgstr ""
"｢侵入して申しわけない、{name}。時間があまりないから、手短にするつもりだ｣"

msgid ""
"\"I worry you are getting too deep into this mess. l337_b01 is drawn more "
"towards passion than reason, and I worry about their safety.\""
msgstr ""
"｢あなたがこの混乱した事態に深入りしすぎているのを心配している。l337_b01 は分"
"別より感情に引っぱられているから、l337_b01 の安全のことも心配だ｣"

msgid ""
"\"You should not proceed further, as their recklessness may endanger us all."
"\""
msgstr ""
"｢これ以上つづけるべきではない。無謀な l337_b01 がわれわれ全員を危うくしかねな"
"い｣"

msgid ""
"The hologram fades as your systems flicker once more and everything returns "
"to normal. What was that all about?"
msgstr ""
"ホログラムが薄れていく。同時にあなたの船のシステムがもういちどちらついて、す"
"べてが正常に戻った。あれはいったいなんだったんだ？"

#. Make natural spawned mercenaries become hostile to the player if they see them
#. Stop if the system gets claimed
#. Go over all the mercenaries
#. Clear pilots
#. Spawn new ones and send them towards the player
msgid "That's the ship!"
msgstr "あれがその船だ！"

#. Finish when beaten
msgid ""
"l337_b01: OK, we have enough data. Land somewhere with a Nexus connection."
msgstr ""
"l337_b01: よし、じゅうぶんな情報が手に入った。ネクサス接続のあるどこかに着陸"
"してくれ。"

msgid "Land to speak with l337_b01."
msgstr "着陸して l337_b01 と話せ。"

msgid ""
"l337_b01: What is this? Shit, it seems like someone put a bounty on your "
"ship!"
msgstr ""
"l337_b01: なんだこれは？　くそっ、だれかがあんたの船に賞金をかけたらしい！"

msgid "l337_b01: Wait, we can probably use this. Take the mercenaries out!"
msgstr "l337_b01: 待った、たぶんこれが使える。傭兵をやっつけてくれ！"

msgid "Defeat the mercenaries!"
msgstr "傭兵を倒せ！"

#. Must exist
#. Can't scan own ships
msgid "Ship '{name}' was scanned. {left} ships left to scan."
msgstr "船 ｢{name}｣ をスキャンした。スキャンする船は残り {left} 隻。"

msgid ""
"Scan {n} ships in the system by targeting them until the scan is complete "
"({left} left)"
msgstr ""
"星系内で {n} 隻の船を目標としてスキャンして、スキャンを完了させろ。(残り "
"{left} 隻)"

msgid "You land and are promptly greeted by l337_b01's hologram."
msgstr "着陸すると、さっそく l337_b01 のホログラムからあいさつをされた。"

msgid ""
"\"The fake bounty on your ship was unexpected, but even then, it led me to "
"more information.\""
msgstr ""
"｢偽の賞金をあんたの船にかけるのは予想していなかったが、それでもあれがさらなる"
"情報に導いてくれたよ｣"

msgid ""
"\"I've had to take some time getting rid of it, so I'm still a bit behind on "
"analysing the collected data, but I should be able to churn through it in a "
"bit.\""
msgstr ""
"｢あれを除去するのにはいくらか時間がかかるから、おれはちょっと背後で静かにしな"
"がら集めた情報を分析する。だがもうちょっとしたらこれでかきまわすことができる"
"はずだ｣"

msgid "\"Get in touch with me then, and we'll finally unmask the evildoer!\""
msgstr "｢あとで連絡してくれ。悪人の正体をついに暴露してやる！｣"

msgid ""
"The connection closes as l337_b01 shifts their focus to signal processing."
msgstr "接続が閉じた。l337_b01 が注力の対象を信号処理に移したからだ。"

msgid ""
"As you recline in your captain's chair you are notified of an anonymous "
"credit transfer to your account. It doesn't take long to guess who that's "
"coming from."
msgstr ""
"船長席にくつろいで座ると、あなたは口座に匿名のクレジット送金があったことに気"
"がついた。だれからなのか推測するのに長い時間はかからなかった。"

msgid ""
"You helped l337_b01 set up a honeypot to intercept communications in an "
"attempt to unmask whoever is behind the recent incidents. A fake bounty was "
"put on your ship, but you were able to overcome the mercenaries sent after "
"you."
msgstr ""
"あなたは l337_b01 を手伝い、ハニーポットを設置して通信を傍受し、いったいだれ"
"が最近の出来事の背後にいるのか正体を暴露しようと試みてみた。偽の賞金があなた"
"の船にかけられたが、あなたはあとを追ってきた傭兵を倒すことができた。"

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Onion Society 08">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>3</priority>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <done>Onion Society 07</done>
#. <cond>
#. local c = spob.cur()
#. local f = c:faction()
#. if not f or not f:tags("generic") then
#. return false
#. end
#. return true
#. </cond>
#. <tags>
#. <tag>fleetcap_10</tag>
#. </tags>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Onion Society</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. Onion 08
#.
#. Player has to take down lonewolf4 in his modified zebra uber-carrier
#. --
#. local fleet = require "fleet"
#. Reference to honeypot (trap)
msgid "The Lone Wolf"
msgstr "さびしいオオカミ"

msgid "Follow up with l337_b01."
msgstr "l337_b01 に聞いてみる。"

msgid "Confront lonewolf4."
msgstr "ローンウルフ 4 と対決せよ。"

msgid "l337_b01's familiar avatar pops up on your holodeck."
msgstr "l337_b01 の見なれたアバターがあなたのホロデッキにとつぜん現れた。"

msgid ""
"\"I've been tracking the fake bounty that was put on you. They covered their "
"tracks well, but they are no match for my counterespionage skills!\""
msgstr ""
"｢あんたにかけられた偽の賞金を追いかけていた。跡をうまく覆いかくしていたよ。だ"
"がおれの防諜技術にはかなわなかった！｣"

msgid ""
"\"It looks like we were right with our guess! The signs point to lonewolf4, "
"and as it seems I've been able to pinpoint their location to boot!\""
msgstr ""
"｢おれたちは正しい推測をしたらしいぞ！　痕跡はローンウルフ 4 を指し示してい"
"る。それにあいつが靴をはく場所を正確に特定できたようだ｣"

msgid ""
"\"It looks like it wasn't {guess} as you guessed, but lonewolf4. Seems like "
"my technomancer instincts were right on the spot. Not only was I able figure "
"out their identity, I've been able to pinpoint their location too!\""
msgstr ""
"｢あんたが推測した{guess}ではなかったようだ。ローンウルフ 4 。おれのテクノマン"
"サーとしての直感がここでは正しかったらしい。あいつの身元の目星がつけられただ"
"けじゃない。居場所も正確に特定できたんだ！｣"

msgid ""
"\"I was able to track the signal all the way to the {sys} system, which is a "
"bit surprising given that the Nexus connection there must be unreliable, but "
"who knows what ways of working around that they might have?\""
msgstr ""
"｢信号を{sys}星系までぜんぶ追跡できた。ちょっと驚きだったね。あそこのネクサス"
"接続はあてにならないにちがいないからな。だがあいつの対処法なんて知ったこと"
"じゃない｣"

msgid ""
"\"All that is left is to head down there and confront them, putting a stop "
"to their plot, whatever it may be.\""
msgstr ""
"｢あとはそこへ行って対決することだけだ。あいつのたくらみは終わりにしてやる。そ"
"れがなんであろうとな｣"

msgid "\"The end is neigh!\""
msgstr "｢終わりは近いですね！｣"

msgid "\"Justice for Trixie.\""
msgstr "｢トリクシーへの報いになりますね｣"

msgid "\"Are you alright?\""
msgstr "｢あなたはだいじょうぶですか？｣"

msgid ""
"\"All's well that ends well. Although I don't think we can reach the happy "
"ending any more, not without Trixie...\"\n"
"They let out a sigh."
msgstr ""
"｢終わりよければすべてよしだ。もう満足な終わりを迎えられるとは思ってないけど"
"な。トリクシーのことがなかったことになるわけじゃない……｣\n"
"　l337_b01 がため息をついた。"

msgid ""
"\"Trixie will never be forgotten! There was so much they wanted to do... I "
"guess the best way to honour their memory is to follow their dreams.\""
msgstr ""
"｢トリクシーが忘れられることはけっしてないだろう！　トリクシーがやりたかったこ"
"とはとてもたくさんあったんだ……。トリクシーの思い出に敬意を表すいちばんいい方"
"法は、その夢を追いかけることだって思ってる｣"

msgid ""
"\"Better than before, thank you. But I can't stop now with the end in sight! "
"Once this is over I'll finally have some peace of mind and time to clear "
"things up. There is so much about Trixie I still need to look into.\""
msgstr ""
"｢まえよりはいいよ。ありがとう。しかしもうやめることはできない。終わりが見えて"
"いるんだからな！　これが終わってしまえば、ついに落ちついて物事を片づける時間"
"がとれるだろう。トリクシーのことではまだ調べる必要があることがとてもたくさん"
"あるんだ｣"

msgid ""
"\"We would have never made it this far if it wasn't for you, {player}. Thank "
"your again!\"\n"
"Determination builds up in their voice.\n"
"\"You ready to put an end to lonewolf4's rampage?\""
msgstr ""
"｢{player}、あんたがいなければここまでやりとげることはけっしてできなかった。ま"
"たお礼をいうよ！｣\n"
"　声には決意が強まっていた。\n"
"　｢狂暴なローンウルフ 4 を終わりにしてやる用意はいいな？｣"

msgid "\"Ready to put a stop to lonewolf4's rampage?\""
msgstr "｢狂暴なローンウルフ 4 を終わりにしてやる用意はいいな？｣"

msgid "\"Let's do this.\""
msgstr "｢やってしまいましょう｣"

msgid "\"I need time to prepare.\""
msgstr "｢準備に時間が必要です｣"

msgid "\"I'll keep tracking them. Get in touch with me when you're ready.\""
msgstr "｢あいつの追跡はつづけておく。用意ができたら連絡してくれ｣"

msgid ""
"\"Let's put an end to this! On to {sys}! I'll be hitching a ride on your "
"electronics, hopefully your Ship AI doesn't mind.\""
msgstr ""
"｢こいつを終わりにしてしまおう！　いざ{sys}星系へ！　おれはあんたの電子機器に"
"乗せてもらうつもりだ。あんたの船の AI が気にしないといいんだが｣"

msgid ""
"You think you hear a faint voice say \"I do mind.\", but it could very well "
"just be your imagination..."
msgstr ""
"あなたは ｢ぜったい気にする｣ とかすかな声が聞こえたと思ったが、それはとてもふ"
"さわしくもたんなる想像であるかもしれなかった……"

msgid "Confront lonewolf4 at the {sys} system!"
msgstr "{sys}星系でローンウルフ 4 と対決せよ！"

#. Or too bulky
#. Lower number of drones
#. Instead give reload bonus
#. no shields
#. No armour regen
#. Player was out for 20 periods or 56 hours
#. Slow them down so the player can "dodge"
msgid "Energy surge detected!"
msgstr "急上昇するエネルギー波を検出！"

#.
#. Stage 1 fight:
#. 1. Sends drones periodically while moving around - there are 2 holograms doing the same (but they are hologram drones)
#. 2. When player damages the real one switches into combat mode.
#. 3. WHen shield drops to 0, jumps out in a cloud of drones.
#. --
msgid "l337_b01: What's this? I'm getting some unusual readings?"
msgstr "l337_b01: ｢なんだこれは？　ふつうじゃない測定値を測定しているのか？｣"

#. Spawn them
#. Generate waypoints
#. Set them up
#. They should only be uncoverable at 3000 units
msgid "l337_b01: \"I need to do a full sweep. Head to the marked position!\""
msgstr "l337_b01: ｢調べつくす必要がある。しるしをつけた場所に向かってくれ！｣"

msgid ""
"l337_b01: \"Wait, some ships are not doing damage... Are they holograms?\""
msgstr "l337_b01: ｢待った、損害をうけていない船があるな……。ホログラムなのか？｣"

msgid "l337_b01: \"We've been spotted! Looks like lonewolf4 wants a fight!\""
msgstr ""
"l337_b01: ｢おれたちは気づかれている！　ローンウルフ 4 は戦いを望んでいるみた"
"いだな！｣"

#. Take turns launching
#. Finishes when he's uncovered
#. Always try to mark the last drone coming in
#. Delay based on number of existing fighters
#. plts => plts^1.25
#. 5  => 8
#. 10 => 18
#. 15 => 30
#. 20 => 42
msgid "l337_b01: \"Looks like a heavily modified Zebra. Take it out!\""
msgstr "l337_b01: ｢ずいぶんと改造したゼブラみたいだ。やってやれ！｣"

#. Only matters at the beginning
#. Clear deployed drones
msgid "l337_b01: \"A hologram!? The real ship must be out there still.\""
msgstr "l337_b01: ｢ホログラムか !? 本物の船がまだそのへんにいるにちがいない｣"

msgid "l337_b01: \"Another hologram!?\""
msgstr "l337_b01: ｢またホログラム !? ｣"

msgid "Thy greed doth sow the seeds of thine undoing!"
msgstr "なんじの強欲はしかとなんじの破滅の種をまいているぞ！"

msgid "l337_b01: What the hell was that?"
msgstr "l337_b01: ｢いったいあれはなんなんだ？｣"

msgid "l337_b01: Wait, they're nearby in the {sys} system!"
msgstr "l337_b01: ｢待った、あいつは近くの{sys}星系にいる！｣"

msgid "Chase lonewolf4 to the {sys} system!"
msgstr "ローンウルフ 4 を追って{sys}星系に行け！"

msgid "l337_b01: No time to lose, onwards to the {sys} system!"
msgstr "l337_b01: ｢無駄にする時間はない。{sys}星系に進め！｣"

#.
#. Stage 2 fight:
#. 0. Shields are down permanently
#. 1. Does an energy surge attack every so often
#. 2. When starts to take damage, charges up for 10 seconds and jumps away
#. --
msgid "l337_b01: \"Stop this lonewolf4! It doesn't have to end this way!\""
msgstr ""
"l337_b01: ｢あのローンウルフ 4 を止めろ！　あきらめることなんかないぞ！｣"

msgid "Have at thee cursed wench!"
msgstr "かかってこい、のろわれたあばずれめ！"

msgid "From whence hast thou been devising such treachery, l337_b01?"
msgstr "いかなるところからそのような背信をめぐらしたのだ、l337_b01？"

msgid "You took the words out of my mouth!"
msgstr "おれがいったことを聞いただろ！"

msgid ""
"Now my eyes doth see the truth, Tenebros Station was naught but a start!"
msgstr ""
"今わたしの目には真実がしかと見える。テネブロス・ステーションは始まり以外のな"
"にものでもなかったのだ！"

msgid "Let me explain!"
msgstr "説明させてくれ！"

msgid "O bitter fate, to think we once walked the same path!"
msgstr "おお、苦き宿命。かつては同じ道を歩いたことを考えるとな！"

msgid "Stop this madness!"
msgstr "こんな狂気のさたはやめるんだ！"

msgid "Curse you and your betrayal!"
msgstr "おまえとおまえの裏切りをのろってやる！"

msgid "l337_b01: \"{msg}\""
msgstr "l337_b01: ｢{msg}｣"

#. Avoiding hook triggering itself
#. Clear all the other ships too
msgid "Investigate {spb} ({sys} system)"
msgstr "{sys}星系の{spb}を調査しろ。"

#. Short so we skip music here
msgid ""
"A flustered l337_b01 pops up on your holodeck.\n"
"\"Betrayal? What the hell were they going on about?\""
msgstr ""
"いらいらとした l337_b01 があなたのホロデッキにとつぜん現れた。\n"
"　｢裏切りだって？　あいつはいったいなにをしゃべっていたんだ？｣"

msgid ""
"\"Wait, I've tracked their signal! It seems like the ship crash-landed on "
"{spb}. Hurry, they might still be alive!\""
msgstr ""
"｢待った、あいつの信号を追いつめた！　船は{spb}に不時着したらしい。いそげ、ま"
"だ生きているかもしれない！｣"

#. End of it all
#. Land hook only runs at the final epilogue when landing
#. TODO modify sounds too
msgid ""
"You enter the orbit of {spb} and scour the violent atmosphere for signs of "
"the downed Zebra carrier."
msgstr ""
"あなたは{spb}の軌道にのり、暴力的な大気の中にいる打ち負かされたゼブラ母艦の形"
"跡をいそいでさがしまわった。"

msgid ""
"\"Here, let me tune the scanning frequencies to the natural harmonics.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"As if by magic, your sensors begin to hazily pick up a large man-made "
"structure that has had some unexpected percussive maintenance performed on "
"it by the planet's surface."
msgstr ""
"まるで魔法をかけたかのように、あなたの船のセンサーが大きな人工構造物をぼんや"
"りと拾いあげる。それは予想外の打撃保守法を惑星表面でいくらかうけていた。"

msgid "\"There it is, we have to check it out!\""
msgstr "｢あそこのだ。確認する必要があるな！｣"

msgid ""
"\"Pardon for the intrusion, but I would advise against atmospheric entry. My "
"models predict a survival rate of 7.3%.\""
msgstr ""
"｢でしゃばって申しわけありません。しかし大気圏への突入はしないように忠告したい"
"です。わたしの模式計算では生きのびる確率が 7.3% という予想です｣"

msgid ""
"\"And my models predict there's no way in hell we can give up now! We have "
"to get to the bottom of this.\""
msgstr ""
"｢そしておれの模式計算では今あきらめられるわけがくそほどもないという予想だ！　"
"こいつの底まで行かなきゃならないんだよ｣"

msgid "\"We're going in!\""
msgstr "｢行きましょう！｣"

msgid "\"{sai}, do a double check.\""
msgstr "｢{sai}、再確認してください｣"

msgid "\"I knew you wouldn't give up now! We're coming for you lonewolf4!\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"New calculations point to NO PROBLEM.\"\n"
"The avatar flickers a second.\n"
"\"... p...nt to NO PROBLEM.\""
msgstr ""
"｢新しい計算が示す結果は、問題ありません｣\n"
"　アバターがちょっとまたたいた。\n"
"　｢……示す……は、問題ありません｣"

msgid "\"All is good, let's go!\""
msgstr "｢すべてよし。行こうか！｣"

msgid "Looks like there is no choice but to go in."
msgstr "行く以外に選択肢はないようだ。"

msgid ""
"\"Nice AI btw, wonder why it takes up so much computational power though. "
"Hard to fit with it.\""
msgstr ""
"｢親切な AI だな、話がそれるけど。それにしてもなんであんなにたくさん計算力を使"
"うんだか。あれにあわせるのは難しいな｣"

msgid ""
"You push the throttle and begin the approach to the wreckage, as the "
"ferocious eternal planetary storm begins to wrack your ship. This might get "
"bumpy."
msgstr ""
"あなたはスロットルを押して残骸に近づきはじめた。それと同時に、永遠につづく凶"
"暴な惑星規模の嵐があなたの船への拷問を開始する。これは揺れるかも。"

msgid ""
"Your ship breaks through the atmosphere, as the planet promptly makes sure "
"you understand that the Demon-class label is no exaggeration. You quickly "
"shut off the emergency warning systems before they permanently damage your "
"hearing."
msgstr ""
"あなたの船が大気を通りぬける。すると惑星は即座に悪魔級の分類が誇張でないこと"
"をあなたにはっきりと理解させた。あなたはいそいで緊急警報システムを遮断して、"
"聴覚に回復不可能な障害をうけないようにした。"

msgid ""
"You think you hear something coming from your Ship AI, but can't make it out "
"through the howling of your atmospheric rendezvous, so you pump up the "
"volume on the holodeck."
msgstr ""
"船の AI からなにか聞こえたと思ったが、大気との出会いによるわめき声をとおして"
"では聞きとれなかった。だからあなたはホロデッキの音量を押しあげた。"

msgid "\"SHIELDS AT 7%. WILL NOT HOLD MUCH LONGER.\""
msgstr "｢シールドが 7% です。あまり長くもたないでしょう｣"

msgid ""
"\"I'VE REROUTED EXCESS VITAL ENERGY TO SHIELDS, NO PROBLEMO. {player} HAS "
"GOT IT COVERED.\""
msgstr ""
"｢余分な生命維持エネルギーをシールドに回した。問題ない。{player}は守られてい"
"る｣"

msgid ""
"You hear a long crunch as some part of your ship decides to go free fall "
"skydiving, that's not good."
msgstr ""
"粉砕されるような長い音が聞こえた。船の一部が自由落下してスカイダイビングをす"
"ることに決めたのだ。これはまずい。"

msgid "\"SHIELDS DOWN. HULL INTEGRITY FAILING.\""
msgstr "｢シールド停止。船殻が完全ではなくなりました｣"

msgid ""
"\"RE- *CRACKLE* -ERGY- *POP*\"\n"
"l337_b01's avatar freezes. Seems like the storm is blocking out their "
"connection."
msgstr ""
"｢エネ * パチパチ * まわ * プツッ *｣\n"
"　l337_b01 のアバターが固まった。嵐で接続が妨害されたようだ。"

msgid ""
"Trying to hold your balance, you guesstimate the location of the Zebra "
"wreckage, and wing it."
msgstr ""
"釣りあいを保とうとしながら、あなたはゼブラの残骸の場所を推測で見積もって、そ"
"れに向かって飛んでいく。"

msgid ""
"After what seems like an eternity of cacophonous fuselage discontentment, "
"your ship crashes into something, sending you flying. "
msgstr ""
"胴体が不満を漏らす永遠とも思える不協和音のあと、あなたの船はなにかに衝突し、"
"あなたは飛びたつようにしむけられた。"

#. Fade to black and then set a black shader before we transition
#. Update description
#. Can't stay landed on this hellhole
#. Song sadly restarts here
#. Undo the global shader stuff
msgid "Haziness"
msgstr "もうろう"

msgid "So soft... So quiet..."
msgstr "とても柔らかい……とても静かだ……"

msgid "What is that?"
msgstr "あれはなに？"

msgid "A gust of wind. Relaxing."
msgstr "一陣の風。穏やかだ。"

msgid "What were you doing?"
msgstr "なにをしていたんだっけ？"

msgid "Can't have been too important..."
msgstr "たいして重要だったはずがない……"

msgid "...back to sleep..."
msgstr "……また眠ろう……"

msgid "Wait... ... ...What is that?"
msgstr "待った…… …… ……あれはなに？"

msgid "Trixie?"
msgstr "トリクシー？"

#. vn.scene() -- vn.scene() is done in vne.flashbackTextEnd
msgid ""
"You gasp for breath. Shit, feels like your lungs are on fire. Now it's all "
"over the floor. Nasty."
msgstr ""
"あなたは苦しい息であえいだ。くそっ、肺が燃えているように感じる。もう床じゅう"
"がひどい。"

msgid "\"{player}! {player}! Don't scare me lie that! Not after Trixie!\""
msgstr ""
"｢{player}！　{player}！　そんなふうに倒れておれを脅かすな！　トリクシーにつづ"
"いたりするなよ！｣"

msgid "\"Vital signs confirmed stabilized.\""
msgstr "｢生活反応は安定していることを確認しました｣"

msgid "Wait, where are you? Your ship? What about the storm? You... crashed?"
msgstr ""
"待った、あなたはどこにいるのか？　自分の船？　嵐のことは？　あなたは……墜落し"
"た？"

msgid "\"You with us, {player}?\""
msgstr "｢聞こえるか、{player}？｣"

msgid "\"Give me a second.\""
msgstr "｢ちょっと待ってください｣"

msgid "\"I'me fine.\""
msgstr "｢元気ですよ｣"

msgid ""
"You take a few deep breaths. Once the adrenaline wears off, you're going to "
"be in for a world of pain."
msgstr ""
"あなたは二、三回深呼吸した。アドレナリンが尽きれば、苦痛の世界となることが確"
"実だろう。"

msgid ""
"You try to smile, but it comes out as more of a grimace. You hope that's not "
"a broken rib."
msgstr ""
"あなたはほほえもうとしたが、それよりしかめっつらのようなものが現れた。あばら"
"が折れていなければいいんだが。"

msgid ""
"\"Recommend urgent medical treatment. Preliminary prognostic is at least 2 "
"minor fractures.\""
msgstr ""
"｢緊急医療処置をお勧めします。とりあえず兆候をみるとすくなくとも 2 カ所は小さ"
"な骨折があります｣"

msgid ""
"\"We're so close, I've managed to break the code to the Wolfie! You should "
"be able to break into to it easily now.\""
msgstr ""
"｢あとちょっとだ。どうにかウルフィーのコードを破ることができたんだよ！　もう簡"
"単に侵入できるはずだ｣"

msgid "\"Wolfie?\""
msgstr "｢ウルフィー？｣"

msgctxt "onion08-1"
msgid "\"What happened?\""
msgstr "｢どうなっているんですか？｣"

msgid ""
"\"lonewolf4's carrier! It's quite a remarkable design. The only thing that "
"really remains of the Zebra is the outer hull, the interior has been "
"completely refitted!\""
msgstr ""
"｢ローンウルフ 4 の母艦だよ！　あれはかなり珍しい設計だな。ほんとうにゼブラが"
"残っているところは唯一船殻の外側だけだ。内部は完全に改装されていた！｣"

msgid ""
"\"You made it to lonewolf4's carrier! It's quite a remarkable design. The "
"only thing that really remains of the Zebra is the outer hull, the interior "
"has been completely refitted!\""
msgstr ""
"｢ローンウルフ 4 の母艦のところに着いたんだ！　あれはかなり珍しい設計だな。ほ"
"んとうにゼブラが残っているところは唯一船殻の外側だけだ。内部は完全に改装され"
"ていた！｣"

msgid ""
"You clamber around until you can pull out a med kit and give yourself a nice "
"stim boost. That should keep you going for a bit, but you'll need proper "
"medical care afterwards. Assuming there is an afterwards..."
msgstr ""
"あなたは手足を使ってなんとかはい登り、救急箱を引きだして魅力的な高揚性の刺激"
"物を使った。これがあなたをすこしのあいだは動かしつづけるはずだが、あとで適切"
"な医療が必要となるだろう。あとがあるとすればだが……"

msgid ""
"\"It seems like there is somewhat of a clearing here generated by whatever "
"the hell the Wolfie is sporting. Not sure how long it will last.\""
msgstr ""
"｢この開拓地的なところはウルフィーがもてあそんでいるくそったれななにかが作った"
"ようだな。どれくらいもつのかたしかじゃない｣"

msgid ""
"\"There's still lifeform readings, but they aren't strong. You have to hurry "
"and check it out!\""
msgstr ""
"｢まだ生体が測定されているが、強くはない。いそいで確認する必要があるぞ！｣"

msgid "You groan as you lift yourself up. Looks like it's time to finish this."
msgstr "あなたはうめきつつも体をもちあげた。これを終わりにするときのようだ。"

msgid "\"Correction, at least 3 minor fractures now.\""
msgstr "｢訂正します。今ではすくなくとも 3 カ所の小さな骨折です｣"

msgid ""
"Ignoring {sai}'s complaints, you don an atmospheric suit and head outside."
msgstr "{sai}の不平を無視して、あなたは大気服を身につけて外へ向かった。"

msgid ""
"As you exit the ship's airlock, you quickly realize that the outside is "
"actually inside, as your ship seems to have crashed directly into "
"lonewolf4's carrier."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Weapon in hand, you make your way through the wreck of the ship. It seems "
"like there's not much of corridors, it's all maintenance tubes which force "
"you to crawl through, forcing your way through debris on occasion. What the "
"hell is up with this ship's design?"
msgstr ""
"武器を手にして、あなたは船の残骸を通りぬけていった。通路はあまりないらしく、"
"すべて保守用のトンネルをはい進むしかなかったし、ときどきはがれきを通りぬける"
"ことをしいられた。この船の設計はいったいどうなってるんだ？"

msgid ""
"You push yourself through another tunnel and find yourself in a surprisingly "
"wide room with some faint illumination. In the centre seems to be a damaged "
"pod with someone in it. Wait, is that blood?"
msgstr ""
"あなたはまた別のトンネルを押しとおっていき、それから驚いたことにかすかに照ら"
"された幅の広い部屋にいることに気がついた。中央には損傷をうけたポッドがあり、"
"その中にだれかいるらしい。待った、あれは血？"

msgid "\"lonewolf4? Let me see if I can interface with it!\""
msgstr ""
"｢ローンウルフ 4 か？　そいつとインターフェースできるか確かめさせてくれ！｣"

msgid ""
"You look around the room. It seems to have been a mess even before "
"everything getting scattered around in the crash."
msgstr ""
"あなたは部屋を見まわした。墜落ですべてがばらまかれるまえからめちゃくちゃだっ"
"たように見える。"

msgid "\"Got it!\""
msgstr "｢できた！｣"

msgid ""
"\"...\"\n"
"There is a long pause as the wolf avatar stares at you.\n"
"\"Cometh to gloat l337_b01? Doth the fruits of thy schemes delight thy heart?"
"\""
msgstr ""
"｢……｣\n"
"　長い間があった。そのあいだ、ウルフのアバターはあなたを見つめている。\n"
"　｢ほくそえみに来たるか、l337_b01？　なんじの陰謀の果実はなんじの心を歓喜させ"
"たか？｣"

msgid ""
"\"YOU were the one that peeled Trixie. YOU are the one who tried to kill "
"{player} and even me if you had the chance! YOU ARE THE ONE FUCKING SHIT UP!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"｢トリクシーを身ばれさせたのはあんただ。あんたが{player}を殺そうとしたんだ。機"
"会があればおれのこともな！　くそったれのちくしょうはあんたじゃないか！｣"

msgid ""
"lonewolf4 seems to speak a bit slower than usual.\n"
"\"Evenst on the brink of triumph, dost thy tongue naught but dealeth guile. "
"Wilt thou, all keys in hand, take for thyself the seat of God?\" "
msgstr ""
"ローンウルフ 4 はいつもよりちょっとゆっくりしゃべっているようだ。\n"
"　｢勝利の頂にいながら、なんじの弁舌はあざむきをはかる以外にないのだな。掌中に"
"すべての鍵を持ったなんじは神の座を自身が得るつもりなのか？｣"

msgid ""
"\"Even now you speak in riddles. Can't you just make it easier! Why... after "
"Trixie... after everything...\""
msgstr ""
"｢今になってもなぞなぞをいうのか。ただ簡単にやるってことができないかな！　なぜ"
"なんだ……トリクシーのことがあり……すべてが終わったあとなのに……｣"

msgid ""
"There is a small pause.\n"
"\"Tenebros Station. Thou slayeth the entire Station, and with that, my "
"family.\""
msgstr ""
"短い間があった。\n"
"　｢テネブロス・ステーション。なんじはステーションの全員を殺害した。そしてその"
"なかに、わたしの家族がいた｣"

msgid ""
"\"Tenebros Station? You know nothing about Tenebros station!! That was a set-"
"up!\""
msgstr ""
"｢テネブロス・ステーション？　あんたはテネブロス・ステーションのことをなにもわ"
"かっていない !!　あれは仕組まれたんだ！｣"

msgid ""
"Unphased, lonewolf4 continues, \"Upon the last breath of v3c70r, doth hath "
"realized the keys were...   ...were at hand, and thus thou trodth'... "
"trodth' on the path of betrayal.\""
msgstr ""
"動じることなくローンウルフ 4 はつづけた。｢v3c70r は最期の息のおり、鍵は……掌中"
"にあると了解していた。そしてそれゆえ、なんじは裏切りの道に踏みいれたのだ｣"

msgid ""
"\"That's all wrong! *sniff* You've got it all wrong! v3c70r, Trixie, we all "
"did it for the greater good!\""
msgstr ""
"｢すべてまちがっている！　* 鼻を鳴らす * あんたはすべてまちがってうけとったん"
"だ！　v3c70r やトリクシーやおれたちは社会全体の利益のためにやっただけなん"
"だ！｣"

msgid ""
"\"Doth thou not wonder, if perhaps we have lived too long? These games, are "
"they naught but born of the rotten body and mind?\""
msgstr ""
"｢なんじは不思議に思わないのか？　もしかするとわれらは長く生きすぎたのかもしれ"
"ないと？　この勝負は、腐った体と精神から生まれたものでしかないのではないか？｣"

msgid ""
"\"Look at me l337_b01, lookth' at the... ...the pass of the centa-cycles.\""
msgstr "｢わたしを見るのだ、l337_b01。見るのだ……百周期の道のりを｣"

msgid "\"You can't quit now! You've got it all wrong!\""
msgstr ""
"｢まだやめるわけにはいかないぞ！　あんたはすべてまちがってうけとったんだ！｣"

msgid "\"It is... what it... is.\""
msgstr "｢それは……なにが……｣"

msgid "\"External vital signs extinguished.\""
msgstr "｢外的な生活反応は消えました｣"

msgid "The avatar is motionless, almost placid."
msgstr "アバターが静止した。穏やかとさえ見える。"

msgid "\"Enough.\""
msgstr "｢もういいよ｣"

msgid "\"Tenebros Station?\""
msgstr "｢テネブロス・ステーション？｣"

msgid "\"Centa-cycles?\""
msgstr "｢百周期？｣"

msgid "\"v3c70r?\""
msgstr "｢v3c70r？｣"

msgid ""
"They let out a deep sigh.\n"
"\"I'm sure you have a lot of questions, but I think I should explain from "
"the beginning.\""
msgstr ""
"l337_b01 は深くため息をついた。\n"
"　｢たくさん質問があるのはわかってるけど、最初から説明すべきだと思う｣"

msgid ""
"\"Us, the Onion Society, we're an old society. Now you see us bickering and "
"fighting, but we were quite a tight group originally: l337_b01, DOG, "
"lonewolf4, notasockpuppet, underworlder, v3c70r, and Trixie.\""
msgstr ""
"｢おれたち、オニオン協会は、古くからある協会だ。今あんたはおれたちが口論したり"
"戦ったりしたのを見たが、もともとはかなり親しい集まりだったんだ。l337_b01、"
"ドッグ、ローンウルフ 4、ノットアソックパペット、アンダーワールダー、v3c70r、"
"それにトリクシーだな｣"

msgid ""
"\"We would spend most of our time doing stupid stunts, but one day, we got "
"lucky and stumbled upon a backdoor to the Nexus backbone.\""
msgstr ""
"｢おれたちはほとんどの時間をばかな曲芸をやるのに費やしていた。しかしある日、お"
"れたちは運よくネクサスの根幹への裏口につきあたったんだ｣"

msgid ""
"\"Young as we were, we realized the potential of it: full control of the "
"entire inter-galactic network. After arguing, we decided to lock it and "
"split the keys, and pass the problem of dealing with it to our future "
"selves. I'll spare you the details, but we made it so without all the keys, "
"you wouldn't be able to unlock it. So unless we all got together, the Nexus "
"would stay as it was.\""
msgstr ""
"｢おれたちは若かったが、その潜在能力には気づいていた。汎銀河ネットワーク全体の"
"すべての制御だ。議論ののち、おれたちはそれに錠前をかけて鍵を分割することに決"
"めた。そしてそれを扱うという問題は将来の自分たちに引き継いだんだ。詳細は省く"
"つもりだが、そういうふうにしたので、すべての鍵がなければ錠前を外すことはでき"
"ないようになった。だからおれたち全員が集まらなければ、ネクサスは以前のままだ"
"ろう｣"

msgid ""
"\"We also made sure that if anything happened to any one of us, their key "
"would cease to be required after some time, a dead man's switch. So it would "
"never get completely lost. And then, we just went about our business as "
"usual, each of us with a key, each a Keeper of the Secrets.\""
msgstr ""
"｢おれたちは中のだれかになにかがあったとしても、それがうまくいくようにした。そ"
"の鍵はいくらか時間がたつと必要とされなくなるんだ。デッドマンスイッチだな。だ"
"から完全に失われることはけっしてない。それからおれたちはいつもの仕事にただ"
"戻った。それぞれが鍵をもってな。それぞれが秘密の管理者だった｣"

msgid "\"How old is old?\""
msgstr "｢どれくらい古いんですか？｣"

msgid "\"Stupid Stunts?\""
msgstr "｢ばかな曲芸って？｣"

msgid "Continue."
msgstr "先へ進む。"

msgid ""
"\"Over 100 cycles, closer to 200 I think. Living so long takes a hard toll "
"on the body... and the mind. It takes a lot of resources to keep organics "
"running for so long...\""
msgstr ""
"｢100 周期以上だ。それよりは 200 周期に近い、と思う。こんなに長く生きている"
"と、体には激しい害がある……それに精神にもだ。こんなに長く器官を働かせつづける"
"には、たくさんの財産を使う……｣"

msgid "\"Maybe lonewolf4 is right. Maybe we have lived too long?\""
msgstr ""
"｢たぶんローンウルフ 4 は正しかった。もしかするとおれたちは長く生きすぎたのか"
"もな？｣"

msgid "\"Short lives are for a reason.\""
msgstr "｢人生が短いのには道理がありますね｣"

msgid "\"Time shouldn't confine us.\""
msgstr "｢時間でわれわれは制限されるべきではないです｣"

msgid ""
"\"I guess so. Maybe having a deadline makes you appreciate things more.\""
msgstr ""
"｢そう思うよ。たぶん期限があることでもっと物事を正しく認識できるようになるん"
"だ｣"

msgid ""
"\"Maybe you are right. This is not a problem of longevity, but of character."
"\""
msgstr ""
"｢たぶんあんたが正しいんだろうな。これは寿命じゃなくて、人格の問題なんだ｣"

msgid ""
"\"The usual script kiddie stuff: hijack a planetary intercom system, reroute "
"thousands of tonnes of manure to be dumped on an aristocrat's mansion, leak "
"corporate and government databases. The usual an aspiring technomancer does."
"\""
msgstr ""
"｢ふつうのスクリプト小僧ってやつだよ。惑星内通話システムを乗っとったり、数千ト"
"ンの肥料の行き先を変えて貴族の館に投棄させたり、会社や政府のデータベースを公"
"開したりした。野心のあるテクノマンサーがふつうにやることだ｣"

msgid ""
"They let out a sigh.\n"
"\"Those were carefree times...\""
msgstr ""
"l337_b01 がため息をついた。\n"
"　｢のんきな時代だった……｣"

msgid ""
"\"Going about our things, some of us noticed something big happening at "
"Tenebros Station. Like conspiracy-type stuff, but it turned out to be true. "
"At the time there was an Imperial project experimenting with mind-control "
"drugs, something they developed by reverse engineering the Sirius or "
"something like that. Hard to tell when half the documents are lies.\""
msgstr ""
"｢自分たちのやりたいことをやっていたら、おれたちのなかの数人がテネブロス・ス"
"テーションで大きななにかがおこっていると気がついたんだ。陰謀的なやつみたい"
"だったが、けっきょく本当だとわかった。そのときは帝国の実験計画があって、精神"
"操作薬かシリウスをリバースエンジニアリングして開発したなにかかそんなものを対"
"象にしてた。文書の半分がうそだからなんともいえないんだ｣"

msgid ""
"\"I think v3c70r stumbled upon it while tracking some refugee diversion "
"database changes, and then they brought me, l337_b01, and Trixie into it.\""
msgstr ""
"｢v3c70r が難民転用データベースのある変更を追いかけていたときに行きあたったの"
"だと思う。それから v3c70r はおれと l337_b01 とトリクシーにそれをもってきたん"
"だ｣"

msgid "\"You and l337_b01!?!\""
msgstr "｢あなたと l337_b01 !?! ｣"

msgid "Let them continue."
msgstr "つづけさせる。"

msgid ""
"\"I'll get that to a second, but as you may have guessed, I wasn't always "
"l337_b01...\""
msgstr ""
"｢それは次にするつもりだったが、あんたは見当をつけたかもしれないな。おれはずっ"
"と l337_b01 だったわけじゃない……｣"

msgid ""
"\"So, we put together what we called Operation Dissonance, to figure out "
"what was going on, and if possible, sabotage the project. Back then, as we "
"were younger, l337_b01 and v3c70r decided to go in person, while Trixie and "
"I stayed back providing support.\""
msgstr ""
"｢で、おれたちは不協和音作戦と呼んだやつをまとめあげた。なにが進んでいるのか理"
"解して、できるなら計画を妨害するんだ。当時おれたちは若かったから、l337_b01 "
"と v3c70r は自分で出向くことに決めた。いっぽうトリクシーとおれは背後にいて援"
"護していた｣"

msgid ""
"\"Things didn't go on as expected. We quickly found out that the project was "
"actually in the last stage, and was going to be activated on all the "
"inhabitants of the station.\""
msgstr ""
"｢ことは思ったようには進まなかった。すぐに発見したのは計画がじっさいに最終段階"
"にあることで、ステーションの住民全員に作用させようとしていることだった｣"

msgid ""
"\"You have to understand, that if that happened, this could easily spread "
"around the galaxy, with tons of sleeper agents able to do who knows what. So "
"we had to take a tough decision, either take out the station and avoid the "
"worst, or try to clean up afterwards.\""
msgstr ""
"｢あんたが理解しなければならないのは、もしそうなったらこれが容易に銀河じゅうに"
"広がりかねなかったことだ。なにができるかわかりっこないような大量の潜伏要員を"
"つけてな。だからおれたちは厳しい決断をしなければならなかった。ステーションを"
"破壊して最悪を避けるか、あとで掃除するかだ｣"

msgid ""
"They let out another deep sigh.\n"
"\"The project looked really bad, so we decided to... sabotage the station "
"and terminate the life support. v3c70r and l337_b01 were still there, so I "
"was against it, but time was running out, and we had few choices...\""
msgstr ""
"l337_b01 がまた深くため息をついた。\n"
"　｢計画はほんとうに悪いやつに見えた。だからおれたちは……ステーションに破壊工作"
"をして、生命維持装置を停止させることに決めたんだ。v3c70r と l337_b01 はまだそ"
"こにいたから、おれは防ごうとしたんだけど、時間は尽きて、選択肢はほとんどなく"
"なってしまった……｣"

msgid ""
"\"But, that's where... that's where I screwed up...\"\n"
"They pause.\n"
"\"I triggered a fail-safe system, and all the leeway we may have had "
"disappeared...\""
msgstr ""
"｢だが、そこで……そこでおれはしくじった……｣\n"
"　l337_b01 が間をあけた。\n"
"　｢おれが安全装置にひっかかり、おれたちがもちえた裁量の余地がすべて失われたん"
"だ……｣"

msgid ""
"\"They... they didn't make it.\"\n"
"You hear a gulp.\n"
"\"Trixie was desperate, and tried everything, but she also took a toll. The "
"neural feedback damaged her... they were never the same.\""
msgstr ""
"｢みんな……みんなどうにもできなかった｣\n"
"　こらえる音が聞こえた。\n"
"　｢トリクシーは死にものぐるいになってなんでも試していたが、トリクシーにも犠牲"
"があった。神経フィードバックがトリクシーに傷をおわせて……まえと同じにはならな"
"かった｣"

msgid ""
"\"Modern medicine can do wonders to the body, but the mind, technology still "
"may not repair... and Trixie was no exception...\""
msgstr ""
"｢現代医学は体には驚くことができる。しかし精神だと、科学技術はいまだに回復させ"
"ることができない……。そしてトリクシーは例外ではなかった……｣"

msgid ""
"\"At the end, l337_b01, my mentor, was able to pass their private codes to "
"me, to keep their legacy. To fully become l337_b01, I peeled myself and "
"pinned all the blame on DEADBEEF, my old self.\""
msgstr ""
"｢最後に、おれの指導者である l337_b01 は内密の暗号をおれに渡すことができた。足"
"跡を維持するようにってな。完全に l337_b01 になるため、おれは自分を身ばれさせ"
"てすべてのとがめを DEADBEEF、昔のおれ自身におわせたんだ｣"

msgid ""
"\"While taking care of Trixie, who barely remembered anything, I found out "
"that lonewolf4 had had some family on the station. And they never forgot "
"and... never forgave...\""
msgstr ""
"｢ほとんどなにも覚えていなかったトリクシーの世話をしていると、ローンウルフ 4 "
"の家族のだれかがステーションにいたことがわかった。そしてローンウルフ 4 はけっ"
"して忘れず……けっして許さなかった……｣"

msgid "\"The Onion Society, and most of us were never the same after that...\""
msgstr ""
"｢オニオン協会は、そしておれたちのほとんどは、以前とはけっして同じではなかっ"
"た……｣"

msgid ""
"There is a pause.\n"
"\"I think you're the first person I've shared all of this with.\""
msgstr ""
"間があった。\n"
"　｢このすべてを語ったのは、あんたが初めてだと思う｣"

msgid "\"So what happened to the station?\""
msgstr "｢それで、ステーションはどうなったんです？｣"

msgid "\"l337_b01 was your mentor?\""
msgstr "｢l337_b01 はあなたの指導者だったんですね？｣"

msgid "\"Mind Control?\""
msgstr "｢精神操作？｣"

msgid "\"How did lonewolf4 not notice?\""
msgstr "｢どうしてローンウルフ 4 は気づかなかったんです？｣"

msgid "\"Thanks for sharing. (continue)\""
msgstr "｢教えてくれてありがとう｣ (先へ進む)"

msgid "\"What do we do next?\" (continue)"
msgstr "｢次はどうしますか？｣ (先へ進む)"

msgid ""
"\"With no life support everyone died. The disaster was attributed to a "
"malfunction. The project was scrapped, with the entire place cordoned off to "
"cut any inspections short, then probably blown to bits by the Incident. "
"There shouldn't be any public records left. It was over 100 cycles ago, and "
"I made sure to purge all the data.\""
msgstr ""
"｢生命維持装置がなくて全員死んだよ。この災難は故障ということにされた。計画はご"
"みになって、そこ全体が遮断されてすべての調査は中断となった。それからたぶん事"
"象で吹き飛んで破片になったんじゃないかな。公開記録はなにも残っていないはず"
"だ。100 周期以上まえだし、おれがすべての情報を確実に取り除いたしな｣"

msgid ""
"\"I still do think that there might have been another way. Had only we "
"noticed sooner...\""
msgstr ""
"｢おれはいまだにほかの道があったのかもしれないとほんとうに考えている。おれたち"
"がもっと早く気づいてさえいれば……｣"

msgid ""
"\"Yes. They took me up as a disciple and taught me all the technomancery I "
"know. If it wasn't for l337_b01, I probably would have gotten fried by "
"gangs, pirates, or even bureaucrats a long time ago. I owe them my life.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"l337_b01 was the best technomancer there was. I've never been able to be "
"half as good as they were.\""
msgstr ""
"｢l337_b01 はこれまでで最高のテクノマンサーだ。おれはけっして半分もうまくでき"
"てないね｣"

msgid ""
"\"It was one of the endless horrible Imperial projects destined to run out "
"of control. Their plan was to embed conditioning as a virus into humans so "
"that they could trigger it remotely to control people. It was also "
"engineered to spread like a virus, so it would spread across the Empire.\""
msgstr ""
"｢制御不能となる運命の、終わりのない残酷な帝国の計画のひとつだ。その計画はウイ"
"ルスとして人間に条件づけを埋めこむことで、遠くからきっかけを与えて人間を操る"
"ことができるというものだ。そのうえウイルスのように広がるように設計されていた"
"ので、帝国じゅうに広がることになっただろう｣"

msgid ""
"\"I have no idea what they were thinking or how well it would've worked, but "
"it was a recipe for disaster on all levels. Probably got approved and "
"developed through chained bureaucratic debacles. But the risk was real, and "
"it all had to be stopped.\""
msgstr ""
"｢あいつらがなにを考えていたのか、あるいはどれくらいうまくいっていたのかなんて"
"まったくわからない。しかしあらゆる基準からみても大惨事を生みだすもとだった。"
"おそらく官僚の失敗の連鎖をとおして承認されて開発されたんだな。しかし危険は本"
"物だった。だからとにかく止めなければならないものだったんだ｣"

msgid ""
"\"I made sure all data of the plans was completely wiped so it couldn't be "
"developed again. Haven't heard about it since.\""
msgstr ""
"｢計画のすべての情報は完全に消し去るようにしたから、また開発することはできな"
"かった。それからこれについて聞いたことはない｣"

msgid ""
"\"It was surprisingly well-kept as a secret. Only a small team was "
"developing it. For us to stumble upon it was a rare twist of fate.\""
msgstr ""
"｢驚くほど秘密としてうまく守られていたんだ。開発していたのは小さなチームだけ"
"だった。おれたちが行きあたることになったのは、珍しい運命のいたずらだな｣"

msgid ""
"\"Not to mention it's much harder to notice things when you aren't looking. "
"It's one thing to hack into governmental databases, and another to apply the "
"same amount of scrutiny to an arbitrary small station, even if your family "
"are there.\""
msgstr ""
"｢いうまでもなく、見ていないときには物事に気づくのがずっと難しい。ひとつ重要な"
"のは政府のデータベースに侵入することで、もうひとつは同じくらいの精密検査を適"
"当に選んだ小さなステーションにやってみることだ。家族がそこにいたとしてもな｣"

msgid ""
"\"If we had known lonewolf4's family was involved, we would have brought him "
"into the operation, but there was so little time. It was just one thing "
"after another.\""
msgstr ""
"｢ローンウルフ 4 の家族が巻きこまれると知っていたら、あいつを作戦に入れただろ"
"う。しかしほんとうにほとんど時間がなかったんだ。とにかく次から次だったからな｣"

msgid ""
"\"It does feel like I've taken a big weight off my chest. Even though it's "
"been a while, nightmares of what happened at Tenebros Station have haunted "
"me for the longest time. Maybe after this I'll finally be able to sleep well."
"\""
msgstr ""
"｢ほんとうに大きな重りが胸中から取れたように感じてる。しばらくのあいだだろう"
"が、テネブロス・ステーションでおきた悪夢はおれにとくべつ長くつきまとっていた"
"んだ。たぶんこれからはやっとよく眠れるだろう｣"

msgid ""
"They pause a second.\n"
"\"That's a great question. Let me think.\""
msgstr ""
"l337_b01 がちょっと間をあけた。\n"
"　｢それは重要な質問だ。考えさせてくれ｣"

msgid ""
"\"First things first, we have to get you out of here. You're fine for now, "
"but I'm not sure how long the lull in the storm will last, and when it's "
"gone, you're not going to have much time.\""
msgstr ""
"｢まず最初に、あんたをここから出さなければならない。あんたはいまのところは元気"
"だが、嵐がどれくらい静まったままでいるのかわからないしな。終わってしまえばあ"
"まり多くの時間はないだろう｣"

msgid ""
"\"Analysis show that the Wolfie has a non-standard blink engine with 78% "
"functionality remaining. Proposal: rewire blink engine target to the "
"{shipname} to exit atmosphere. Projections show +INF% chance of survival "
"versus remaining.\""
msgstr ""
"｢分析によれば、ウルフィーは非標準的なブリンクエンジンをもっていて、機能は "
"78% 残っています。提案です。ブリンクエンジンの対象を{shipname}に切り替えるよ"
"うに配線を変え、大気圏を出てください。見積もりでは、生きのびる確率はこのまま"
"でいるのに比べて +INF% です｣"

msgid "\"What's the projected survival chance?\""
msgstr "｢生きのびられる確率の見積もりは？｣"

msgid "\"NaN%\""
msgstr "｢NaN% です｣"

msgid ""
"\"Suboptimal, but I don't think we have much of a choice otherwise. Can the "
"ship survive an atmospheric ascent?\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Negative.\""
msgstr "｢否｣"

msgid ""
"\"Looks like we're going to have to trust lonewolf4's engineering. They were "
"always an ace at this stuff, so it may work?\""
msgstr ""
"｢ローンウルフ 4 の技術を信用しなければならなくなりそうだ。あいつはこの手のも"
"のにはいつも最高だったから、うまくいくんじゃないか？｣"

msgid ""
"\"{player}, I think I can handle this, you should head back to the ship.\""
msgstr "｢{player}、おれがこれには対処できると思う。あんたは船に戻るべきだ｣"

msgid "You pay your respects to lonewolf4 and leave the Wolfie behind."
msgstr "あなたはローンウルフ 4 に敬意を表し、ウルフィーをあとにした。"

msgid "Your ship groans around you as the storm shifts in intensity."
msgstr ""
"あなたの船があなたのまわりじゅうでうめいている。嵐が猛烈な状態に変わったの"
"だ。"

msgid "\"Shield integrity beginning to fail.\""
msgstr "｢シールドの完全性が失われはじめました｣"

msgid ""
"\"Give me a second, almost got it. I'm going to have to disable the "
"protective field first, so hang on tight.\""
msgstr ""
"｢ちょっとくれ。ほとんどできてる。最初に保護用の場を無効にする必要があるんだ。"
"だからしっかりつかまっていろ｣"

msgid "You sense a deep rumbling as the howling winds continue to pick up."
msgstr "あなたは深くて低い騒音を感じた。ほえる風が強くなりつづけている。"

msgid "\"Shields down.\""
msgstr "｢シールド停止｣"

msgid "\"One sec...\""
msgstr "｢ちょ……｣"

msgid ""
"You grab on to your commander chair as the ship begins to slide, pulled by "
"the storm. Your fractures kindly decide to remind you of their existence as "
"the stim effect begins to fade."
msgstr ""
"あなたは自分の船長席をつかんだ。嵐に引かれ、船がすべりはじめたからだ。あなた"
"の骨折は親切にもその存在を思いださせることに決めていた。刺激物の効果が薄れは"
"じめたのだ。"

msgid "\"Now!\""
msgstr "｢今だ！｣"

msgid ""
"Your stomach lurches as reality warps around you. You slowly open your eyes, "
"and it looks like you are once more in space. Nice predictable empty space."
msgstr ""
"あなたの胃が揺れて、あなたのまわりで現実感がゆがむ。ゆっくりと目を開けると、"
"あなたはまた宇宙にいるようだった。快適で意外性のないからっぽの空間だ。"

msgid "\"Shields recovering.\""
msgstr "｢シールドが回復しています｣"

msgid "\"You made it!\""
msgstr "｢やった！｣"

msgid ""
"And with that, your body gives out as it becomes aware of its grievances."
msgstr "それとともに、あなたの体はへたばって、その不満を知ることになった。"

#. vn.scene() -- vn.scene() is done in vne.flashbackTextEnd
msgid ""
"\"{player} has become conscious. Terminating search for a new captain. I "
"mean, welcome back to the world of the living.\""
msgstr ""
"｢{player}は意識がある状態になりました。新しい船長の検索は終了します。いや、つ"
"まり、生者の世界におかえりなさい｣"

msgid "\"You're back! I was so worried!\""
msgstr "｢気がついた！　とても心配したんだぞ！｣"

msgid "\"Where am I?\""
msgstr "｢どこにいるんです？｣"

msgctxt "onion08-2"
msgid "\"What happened?\""
msgstr "｢どうなりました？｣"

msgid "\"You are on your ship at {spb}, recovering from your injuries.\""
msgstr "｢あなたは自分の船に乗って{spb}にいます。そしてけがから回復中です｣"

msgid ""
"\"You passed out after you got off of {spb}! I had {shipai} rush you over to "
"the nearest place to get some medical care. Luckily, we found one of the "
"researchers was a licensed medic and was able to patch you up.\""
msgstr ""
"｢あんたは{spb}から出ると意識を失ったんだ！　おれが{shipai}をいそがせて、いち"
"ばん近くで医療をうけられるところへ行かせてな。運よくわかったのは、研究者のひ"
"とりが免許をもった医者で、あんたに応急処置をできるってことだった｣"

msgid "\"How are you feeling? You've been out for 2 decaperiods!\""
msgstr "｢気分はどうだ？　あんたは 2 デカ時限のあいだ意識がなかったんだよ！｣"

msgid "\"I'm OK.\""
msgstr "｢だいじょうぶです｣"

msgid ""
"\"You'll have fully recovered in a bit. I've been thinking a lot about what "
"happened recently. Maybe we can talk when you feel better. Just send me a "
"message on the Nexus!\""
msgstr ""
"｢あんたはもうちょっとで完全に回復するだろう。おれは最近おきたことについてたく"
"さん考えていたよ。たぶんあんたの気分がもっとよくなったら話せるな。とにかくネ"
"クサスでおれに通信を送ってくれ｣"

msgid "\"I've also wired you a payment for your troubles. Take care!\""
msgstr "｢手間をかけてもらったことへの報酬も送った。体をたいせつにな！｣"

msgid ""
"\"I was able to extract some information from lonewolf4's battle patterns. "
"These may prove useful when deploying more ships.\""
msgstr ""
"｢ローンウルフ 4 の戦いの型からいくらか情報を抽出できました。これはさらに船を"
"展開するとき役に立つと判明するかもしれません｣"

msgid ""
"\"Now I have to attend to the ship's infrastructure. l337_b01 always messes "
"with more than they need to and leaves the resulting issues up to me to sort "
"out.\""
msgstr ""
"｢もうわたしは船の基盤設備の面倒をみなければなりません。l337_b01 はいつも必要"
"以上に手を出して、結果としておきた問題の解決をわたしに任せていきます｣"

msgid ""
"The holograms are gone, but your headache is not. It seems like a good time "
"to reflect on what happened and get ready for what comes next. With "
"lonewolf4 defeated, it's still not clear who peeled Trixie nor what is going "
"on with the rest of the Onion Society."
msgstr ""
"ホログラムは消えたが、あなたの頭痛は消えなかった。おきたことと次に来ることへ"
"の準備を思案するにはよいときのようだ。ローンウルフ 4 は倒したにしても、トリク"
"シーを身ばれさせた者も、オニオン協会の残りの会員になにがおきているのかも、い"
"まだはっきりしなかった。"

#. TODO remove this in 0.14.0 or when a new mission is added in nightly
msgid ""
"Developer's Note: this is the last mission in the Onion Society campaign as "
"of Naev 0.13.x. Stay tuned for the continuation in 0.14.0."
msgstr ""
"開発者からの注意 : これは Naev 0.13.x でのオニオン協会キャンペーンの最後の"
"ミッションです。0.14.0 でのつづきをご期待ください。"

msgid ""
"You confronted lonewolf4 who l337_b01 believed peeled Trixie. After an "
"intense fight, lonewolf4's flagship crashed into {spb}. You and l337_b01 "
"were able to talk to them before they passed, prompting l337_b01 to "
"elaborate on the history of the Onion Society, as well as the happenings on "
"Tenebros Station that led to the deaths of v3c70r and the original l337_b01."
msgstr ""
"トリクシーを身ばれさせた者だと l337_b01 が信じたローンウルフ 4 とあなたは対決"
"した。激しい戦いのあと、ローンウルフ 4 の旗艦は{spb}に墜落した。あなたと "
"l337_b01 はローンウルフ 4 が亡くなるまえに話すことができた。それにうながされ"
"て l337_b01 はオニオン協会の歴史を詳しく話した。もちろんテネブロス・ステー"
"ションでの出来事もだが、それは v3c70r と最初の l337_b01 の死につながったもの"
"だった。"

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Black Cat">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>4</priority>
#. <chance>0</chance>
#. <location>None</location>
#. <notes>
#. <tier>1</tier>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. Black cat found on a derelict ship. Have to return it.
#.
#.
#.
#. Non-persistent state
msgid "Black Cat"
msgstr "黒ネコ"

msgid ""
"You make your way through the derelict, each step you take resonating "
"throughout the vacuous vessel. As your traverse a hallway you notice a "
"peculiar texture on one of the walls. As your light illuminates the wall, "
"you can make out hastily written graffiti. Although it is hard to read, you "
"can make out the following text \"#rBEW-RE OF C-T#0\". What could it mean?"
msgstr ""
"あなたは遺棄船を抜けていった。一歩ごとにうつろな船じゅうに反響音が響く。廊下"
"を横切っていくと、ある壁の表面が妙な具合になっているのに気がついた。あかりで"
"壁を照らすと、いそいで書かれた落書きだと見わけがついた。読みとるのは難しかっ"
"たが、｢#rね□に□をつけろ#0｣ という文章だとわかった。どういう意味なんだろう？"

msgid ""
"You eventually reach the command room when your ship suddenly informs you "
"that there is a life form present on the ship. Not only that, it's very "
"close! You frantically ready for a fight and prepare for the worst…\n"
"\n"
"It's right on top of you!"
msgstr ""
"やっと指令室に到着すると、とつぜんあなたの船から通知があった。この船には生命"
"体がいる。それだけではなく、とても近い！　あなたは必死になって戦いの用意をし"
"て、最悪な場合を覚悟した……\n"
"\n"
"それがあなたのすぐそばにいる！"

msgid ""
"You make out two glowing eyes glinting in the darkness. As you shine your "
"light on them, a dark shape emerges from the shadows.\n"
"\"Meow.\""
msgstr ""
"見わけられたのは、暗やみにきらめいて輝く二つの目だった。あなたがあかりで照ら"
"してみると、影の中から暗い姿が現れた。\n"
"　｢みゃおう｣"

msgid ""
"In front of you is what {shipai}, your ship's AI, confirms to be a Felis "
"catus or domesticated house cat. It looks at you with expressionless eyes "
"with a gaze that seems to pierce your soul.\n"
"After what seems an eternity with you holding your breath, the cat stands up "
"and walks past you."
msgstr ""
"あなたの前にいるのは、フェーリス・カトゥス、いいかえると飼いならされたイエネ"
"コであるとあなたの船の AI である{shipai}が確認した。ネコは感情をこめない目で"
"あなたを見つめ、その視線はあなたの魂を貫くかのようだった。\n"
"　永遠とも思えるあいだ、あなたは息を止めていた。それからネコは腰を上げ、あな"
"たを通りこして歩いていく。"

msgid ""
"You follow the cat throughout the ship as it leads you to… the airlock you "
"came in from!\n"
"It seems like it wants to come back with you. What do you do?"
msgstr ""
"あなたはネコにつづいて船じゅうを抜けていき、導かれたのは……あなたが入ってきた"
"エアロックだった！\n"
"　ネコはあなたといっしょに行きたがっているようだ。どうしようか？"

msgid "Take the cat with you"
msgstr "ネコを連れていく"

msgid "Let the cat be"
msgstr "ネコは放っておく"

msgid ""
"You open the airlock and the cat enters your ship, only to immediately turn "
"around and start scratching the airlock again. You open the airlock again "
"and it goes back into the derelict. Soon after, you hear scratching on the "
"other side of the door. You let out a big sigh and the cat walks into your "
"ship again. Not wanting to get stuck in an infinite loop, you gently prod "
"the cat so it goes into your ship."
msgstr ""
"あなたはエアロックを開け、ネコを船に入れた。しかしすぐに向きかえり、またエア"
"ロックをひっかきはじめただけだった。あなたはエアロックをまた開けた。するとネ"
"コは遺棄船に戻っていった。すぐあとに、あなたは扉のむこうからひっかく音を聞"
"く。あなたは大きくため息をつき、それからネコはあなたの船にまた歩いて入った。"
"無限ループにしたくはなかったので、あなたはネコを優しく押した。するとネコはあ"
"なたの船の中に入っていった。"

msgid ""
"The cat struts around and behaves like it owns the place. You're going to "
"have to figure out what to do with it. Your ship is no place for a cat to "
"live."
msgstr ""
"ネコはもったいぶって歩きまわり、自分が所有する場所のようにふるまった。あなた"
"はネコをどう処置するのか解決せざるをえなくなるだろう。あなたの船は、ネコが住"
"むための場所ではない。"

msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to abandon the cat to its fate aboard the sinister, "
"derelict ship?"
msgstr "ほんとうにネコを不吉な遺棄船上に放置して運命に任せたいですか？"

msgid "Take the cute cat with you"
msgstr "かわいいネコを連れていく"

msgid "Definitely let the beast be"
msgstr "ぜったいにその動物は放っておく"

msgid "You leave the cat behind and unceremoniously depart from the derelict."
msgstr "あなたはネコをあとに残し、あっさりと遺棄船から離れた。"

msgid "You left a sinister black cat on an abandoned derelict ship in {sys}."
msgstr "あなたは不吉な黒ネコを{sys}星系で放棄されていた遺棄船に残してきた。"

msgid ""
"You found a black cat on a derelict ship. It seems to want to go back "
"somewhere, but you aren't sure where. Maybe if you could find its owner?"
msgstr ""
"あなたは遺棄船で黒ネコを発見した。どこかへ帰りたいらしいが、どこなのかはわか"
"らない。もしかして、飼い主が見つけられれば？"

msgid ""
"A cute four-legged mammal \"Felis catus\" that seems to enjoy chasing random "
"things around the ship."
msgstr ""
"かわいい四本足の哺乳動物である ｢フェーリス・カトゥス｣ で、船じゅうで手あたり"
"しだいに物を追いかけるのを楽しんでいるらしい。"

msgid "Find the Black Cat's owner"
msgstr "黒ネコの飼い主を見つけろ。"

#. Important variables
#.
#. function () -- Overheat
#. local pp = player.pilot()
#. luaspfx.sfx( false, nil, meow )
#. if lmisn.is_lucky() then
#. player.msg(_("Black cat hair has clogged the radiators but burns up before overheating the ship."), true)
#. return
#. end
#. local t = pp:temp()
#. pp:setTemp( math.max(400, t+50) )
#. player.msg(_("Black cat hair has clogged the radiators and overheated the ship!"), true)
#. player.autonavReset()
#. end,
#. --
#. Temporarily disable
#. Already disabled
msgid ""
"The black cat accidentally hit the ship restart button, but nothing happens."
msgstr "偶然、黒ネコが船の再起動ボタンをたたいたが、なにもおきなかった。"

msgid "The black cat accidentally hit the ship restart button!"
msgstr "偶然、黒ネコが船の再起動ボタンをたたいた！"

#. Energy discharge
msgid ""
"The black cat managed to accidentally disconnect the energy capacitors, but "
"the back-up system takes over while you fix it."
msgstr ""
"偶然、黒ネコがエネルギーキャパシターの接続をどうにかして切断してしまったが、"
"予備システムが肩がわりしているあいだにあなたが修理した。"

msgid "The black cat managed to accidentally disconnect the energy capacitors!"
msgstr ""
"偶然、黒ネコがエネルギーキャパシターの接続をどうにかして切断してしまった！"

#. Larger chance of just random messages
msgid "The black cat stares at you ominously."
msgstr "黒ネコがあなたを不気味に見つめている。"

msgid "A waft of black cat hair flies around."
msgstr "黒ネコの毛が漂ってそこらじゅうを飛んでいる。"

msgid "The black cat's tail fluffs up and it sprints away."
msgstr "黒ネコのしっぽがぴくっと立って、ネコは全力疾走していった。"

msgid "The black cat scratches the airlock. It wants out?"
msgstr "黒ネコがエアロックをひっかいた。出たいのか？"

msgid "The black cat unceremoniously barfs up a hairball."
msgstr "黒ネコが無作法にも毛玉を吐いた。"

msgid "You hear weird noises from the black cat freaking out over nothing."
msgstr "なにもないのに黒ネコが興奮して異様な声を出すのをあなたは聞いた。"

msgid "The black cat suddenly sprints through the ship."
msgstr "黒ネコがとつぜん全力疾走して船じゅうを走りまわった。"

msgid "The black cat curls up and falls asleep on top of the control panel."
msgstr "黒ネコが制御盤の上で体を丸めて寝てしまった。"

msgid ""
"The black cat shows you its belly, but bites you when you try to pet it."
msgstr "黒ネコがあなたにお腹を見せた。しかしなでようとしたらかまれてしまった。"

msgid "The black cat uses the commander chair as a scratching post."
msgstr "黒ネコが船長席を爪とぎとして使っている。"

msgid ""
"The black cat bumps into your ship's self-destruct button, but you manage to "
"abort it in time."
msgstr ""
"黒ネコがあなたの船の自爆ボタンにぶつかった。しかしあなたはどうにか間にあうよ"
"うに中止できた。"

#. Proper (bad) events
#. This hook is run _BEFORE_ the enter hook.
#. Set up event ending
msgid "P-p-please bring them o-over."
msgstr "お、お、お願いだ。つ、連れてきてくれ。"

msgid "Nervous Individual"
msgstr "神経質な人"

msgid ""
"You open a communication channel with the {plt} and a hologram of a nervous-"
"looking individual materializes in front of you."
msgstr ""
"あなたは{plt}との通信回線を開いた。すると神経質な感じがする人物のホログラフが"
"あなたの前に姿を現した。"

msgid "\"H-h-hello there. You w-w-wouldn't happen to have a c-cat onboard?\""
msgstr ""
"｢こ、こ、こんにちは。あ、あ、あなたはたまたまネ、ネコを乗せてないですか？｣"

msgctxt "blackcat"
msgid "\"Yes.\""
msgstr "｢いますよ｣"

msgctxt "blackcat"
msgid "\"No (lie).\""
msgstr "｢いないです｣ (うそをつく)"

msgid ""
"Just as you utter the word \"No\", the black cat drowns out your reply with "
"a resonating \"Meow\", that is clearly heard on the other side of the "
"communication channel."
msgstr ""
"あなたが ｢いないです｣ と言葉を発すると同時に、黒ネコがあなたの返事を打ち消す"
"ように、いっしょに声を響かせた。｢みゃおう｣。これが通信回線のむこう側に聞こえ"
"たのはあきらかだった。"

msgid ""
"They let out a sigh of relief.\n"
"\"You f-f-found it! I thought I was a g-g-goner! I'll b-brake my ship so you "
"c-can bring it over.\""
msgstr ""
"むこうの人物が安心してため息をついた。\n"
"　｢み、見つけてくれた！　もうだ、だ、だめだと思っていました！　船をと、止める"
"ので、つ、連れてこられます｣"

msgid ""
"Given the streak of bad luck the feline has brought you, you figure it is in "
"your best interest to bring the cat over to the {plt}."
msgstr ""
"ネコがあなたに立てつづけの不運を持ちこんだので、あなたはネコを{plt}へ連れてい"
"くのがもっとも利益になることだと判断した。"

msgid ""
"Your ship locks its boarding clamps on the {plt}, and the airlock opens up "
"revealing some strangely musty air and pitch black darkness. How odd."
msgstr ""
"あなたの船が、{plt}と移乗用固定具で固定された。それからエアロックを開けると、"
"なにか奇妙にかび臭い空気とまっ暗やみがあらわになった。なんとも妙だ。"

msgid ""
"You realize the cat is nowhere to be seen and start to search for it to "
"bring it over. Funny how it always seems to be where you don't want it and "
"when you need it you can't find it."
msgstr ""
"あなたはネコが見える範囲にいないことに気がついたので、連れていくためにさがし"
"はじめた。なんともおかしなことに、ネコはいてほしくないときにはいつもいて、必"
"要なときには見つからないのだ。"

msgid ""
"You scour the ship and end up going back to the commander chair. As you are "
"about to look behind it, you hear a sonorous meow and a black shadow flies "
"past you towards the airlock."
msgstr ""
"あなたは船をさがしまわって、けっきょく船長席まで戻ってきた。あなたがその背後"
"を見ようとすると、よくとおる鳴き声が聞こえ、黒い影があなたを飛びこし、エア"
"ロックの方へ向かっていった。"

msgid ""
"You run to try to catch it, but hear the sound of the airlock closing and "
"detaching of the locking clamps. You run back to your command chair to see "
"what the other ship is doing, but you can not find it anywhere. They seem to "
"have a knack for fleeing."
msgstr ""
"あなたは走って捕まえようとしたが、エアロックが閉じる音と固定具がはずれる音が"
"聞こえた。あなたは船長席まで走ってもどり、むこうの船がしていることを確認しよ"
"うとする。しかしあの船はどこにも見つからなかった。あの船は逃げるこつをつかん"
"でいるようだ。"

msgid ""
"You sit resigned and outwitted at your command chair when you notice a "
"credit chip with {credits} on the floor. It looks like it has cat bite marks "
"too."
msgstr ""
"あなたは黙って従わされ裏をかかれて船長席に座っている。そのとき {credits} のク"
"レジットチップが床にあるのに気がついた。それにはネコのかみ跡もあるようだ。"

msgid ""
"You then get around to cleaning up the copious amounts of cat hair invading "
"every last corner of your ship. With the amount collected you make a cute "
"black cat doll. It's like a tiny version of the real thing without the "
"assholeness."
msgstr ""
"あなたはそれから、船じゅうの隅から隅まで入りこんでいたおびただしい量のネコの"
"毛を掃除してまわった。集めた毛で、あなたはかわいい黒ネコの人形を作った。これ"
"は本物を小さくしたようなものである。くそったれなところを除いて。"

msgid ""
"You rescued a black cat from a derelict ship and safely delivered it to its "
"owner, who was flying a Wild Ones pirate ship."
msgstr ""
"あなたは遺棄船から黒ネコを救出し、無事に飼い主のところへ届けた。その飼い主は"
"荒くれの海賊船で飛んでいた。"

msgid "No cat in sight…"
msgstr "ネコが見えない……"

msgid ""
"You go to get rid of the black cat, but can not find it anywhere. After a "
"long search you reach the only logical conclusion; that it vanished into "
"thin air. Guess you can forget about it for now."
msgstr ""
"あなたは黒ネコを追いはらおうとしたが、どこにも見つからなかった。時間をかけて"
"さがしたあとに、あなたは唯一の論理的結論にたっした。ネコは跡形もなく消滅した"
"のだ。さしあたりそのことは忘れてしまっていいだろう。"

msgid ""
"You rescued a black cat from a derelict ship only to have it disappear into "
"thin air in {sys}."
msgstr ""
"あなたは遺棄船から黒ネコを救出したが、ネコは{sys}星系で跡形もなく姿を消してし"
"まっただけだった。"

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Pirate Smuggling">
#. <priority>4</priority>
#. <cond>faction.reputationGlobal("Pirate") &gt;= -100</cond>
#. <chance>960</chance>
#. <location>Computer</location>
#. <done>Pirate Smuggle Cake</done>
#. <notes/>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. Handles the randomly generated Pirate contraband missions. They can appear
#. anywhere and give better rewards with higher risk.
#.
#.
#.
#.
#. --   Pirates shipping missions are always timed, but quite lax on the schedules
#. --   and pays a lot more then the rush missions
#. --
#. This is in common.cargo, but we need to increase the range
#. Note: this mission does not make any system claims.
#. Lower chance of appearing to 1/3 on non-pirate planets
#. Doesn't appear on Thurion and Proteron worlds for now
#. target destination. Override "always_available" to true.
#. We’re redefining the cargo
#. Serious stuff here
msgid "Stolen Goods"
msgstr "盗品"

msgid "A lot of goods obtained by illicit and illegal means."
msgstr "許可なく違法な手段で手に入れたたくさんの品物。"

msgid "Hacked Electronics"
msgstr "違法改造電子機器"

msgid "An assortment of illegally modified electronic goods."
msgstr "違法に改造した電子機器の詰めあわせ。"

msgid "Illegal Waste"
msgstr "違法な投棄物"

msgid "A melange of highly illegal waste."
msgstr "高度に違法な廃棄物の寄せ集め。"

msgid "Powerful Stimulants"
msgstr "強力な刺激物"

msgid "A bunch of illegal stimulants."
msgstr "違法な刺激物の束。"

msgid "Unmarked Boxes"
msgstr "しるしのついていない箱"

msgid ""
"A multitude of unmarked boxes containing what you can only assume to be "
"highly illegal items."
msgstr ""
"しるしのついていない大量の箱で、高度に違法な品物が入っているとしか思えない。"

msgid "Exotic Animals"
msgstr "外来の動物"

msgid "A collection of exotic animals that can not be legally traded."
msgstr "外来の動物の集まりで、合法的には取引できないものだ。"

msgid "Radioactive Materials"
msgstr "放射性物質"

msgid "Highly dangerous and illegal radioactive materials."
msgstr "とても危険で違法な放射性物質。"

msgid "Illegal Drugs"
msgstr "違法薬物"

msgid "A batch of drugs made illegal in most systems."
msgstr "一山の薬物で、ほとんどの星系では違法だ。"

msgid "Illegal Body Mods"
msgstr "違法な身体改造用品"

msgid "An array of illegal body modifications."
msgstr "ずらりと並んだ違法な身体改造用品。"

msgid "Unauthorized Weapons"
msgstr "無許可の武器"

msgid "An assemblage of illegal weapons."
msgstr "違法な武器の組みあわせ。"

msgid "Contraband"
msgstr "禁制品"

msgid "A diverse assortment of illegal contraband goods."
msgstr "違法な禁制品の多様な詰めあわせ。"

msgid "Counterfeit Goods"
msgstr "模造品"

msgid "An assortment of illegal counterfeit goods of many famous brands."
msgstr "多数の有名ブランドの違法な模造品の詰めあわせ。"

msgid "Stolen Art"
msgstr "盗難芸術品"

msgid "Artwork that was illegally seized from a collector or gallery."
msgstr "収集家や画廊から不法に奪われた芸術品。"

#. Below less serious stuff
msgid "User Databases"
msgstr "ユーザーのデータベース"

msgid ""
"Stolen user databases with lots of personal information obtained illegally."
msgstr ""
"盗みとられたユーザーデータベースで、違法に取得されたたくさんの個人情報が含ま"
"れる。"

msgid "Smelly Fruits"
msgstr "強いにおいのするフルーツ"

msgid ""
"Illegal fruits that have a strong smell that can stink up entire stations in "
"minutes."
msgstr ""
"強くにおう違法なフルーツで、数分でステーション全体を悪臭でいっぱいにできる。"

msgid "Catnip"
msgstr "ねこじゃらし"

msgid "Highly illegal drug that is very attractive to cats."
msgstr "重罪薬物で、ネコをとてもひきつける。"

msgid "Hypnotoads"
msgstr "ヒプノトーズ"

msgid "Illegal amphibian with some mind-control abilities."
msgstr "違法な両生類で、いくらか精神支配能力がある。"

msgid "Extra Spicy Burritos"
msgstr "エクストラ・スパイシー・ブリトー"

msgid "Burritos that are so spicy, they are illegal."
msgstr "とてもスパイシーなブリトーで、違法である。"

msgid "Pineapple Pizza"
msgstr "パイナップル・ピザ"

msgid "Pizza with pineapple on it. There is no way this is legal."
msgstr "パイナップルが乗ったピザ。これが合法なわけがない。"

msgid "Illicit Shader Code"
msgstr "不正なシェーダーコード"

msgid "Program used for rendering images with nefarious and illegal purposes."
msgstr "極悪で違法な目的で画像を描画するのに使われるプログラム。"

msgid "Tax-evasion Documents"
msgstr "脱税用文書"

msgid "Illegal documents detailing tax evasion by high empire officials."
msgstr "帝国政府高官によって書かれた、脱税をくわしく解説した違法文書。"

msgid "Leaked Documents"
msgstr "暴露された文書"

msgid "Documents illegally leaked from governmental entities."
msgstr "政府自体から違法に流出した文書。"

msgid "Incriminating Evidence"
msgstr "罪証"

msgid "Illegally obtained evidence that incriminates high empire officials."
msgstr "帝国政府高官を有罪とする違法に取得された証拠。"

msgid "Unauthorized Office Supplies"
msgstr "無許可の事務用品"

msgid ""
"Office supplies that don't meet the standards of the Empire bureaucracy, "
"including flimsy red staplers."
msgstr ""
"帝国の官僚的手つづきの基準にあっていない事務用品で、たとえば薄っぺらくて赤い"
"ホッチキスなどがある。"

msgid "Paper Deshredders"
msgstr "ペーパーデシュレッダー"

msgid ""
"Devices that are able to reconstruct original documents from their shredded "
"remains."
msgstr "裁断されたものの残りから、もとの文書を復元できる装置。"

msgid "Self-help Books"
msgstr "自習書"

msgid "Books for self-betterment made illegal by the Dvaered authorities."
msgstr "自己改善のための本で、ドベーレッド当局に違法とされた。"

msgid "Pacifist Manifestos"
msgstr "平和主義者宣言"

msgid ""
"Documents making the case for pacifism, made illegal by the Dvaered "
"authorities."
msgstr "平和主義を唱える本で、ドベーレッド当局に違法とされた。"

msgid "Zen Rock Gardens"
msgstr "禅岩石庭園"

msgid ""
"Sand and rock gardens with special rakes you can use for meditative "
"purposes. Made illegal by the Dvaered authorities."
msgstr ""
"砂と小石の庭園で、瞑想のために使用できるとくべつな熊手がある。ドベーレッド当"
"局に違法とされた。"

msgid "Scented Soap"
msgstr "香水入り石けん"

msgid ""
"Fragrant soaps that can lead you to have a peace of mind. Made illegal by "
"the Dvaered authorities."
msgstr "安らぎを与えてくれる香りのよい石けん。ドベーレッド当局に違法とされた。"

msgid "Unstable DNA"
msgstr "不安定 DNA "

msgid "Illegal DNA with strong reactive properties."
msgstr "強い反応性の性質をもつ違法な DNA。"

msgid "Bio-weapons"
msgstr "生物兵器"

msgid "Highly dangerous, illegal biological weapons."
msgstr "とても危険で違法な生物学的兵器。"

msgid "Abducted Drosophila"
msgstr "連れ去られたショウジョウバエ"

msgid ""
"Genetically modified small fruit flies illegally stolen from a laboratory."
msgstr "遺伝子改変された小さなミバエで、研究所から違法に盗まれたものだ。"

msgid "Mislabelled Plasmids"
msgstr "ラベルをまちがえたプラスミド"

msgid ""
"Independently replicating DNA that has been mislabelled and is no longer "
"clear what exactly it does. Illegal for its uncertain and dangerous nature."
msgstr ""
"個別に複写された DNA で、ラベルをまちがえて、もう正確にはなにをするのかはっき"
"りしなくなったもの。不確かで危険な性質であるため、違法である。"

msgid "Soromid Cheese"
msgstr "ソロミドチーズ"

msgid ""
"The 'don't ask, don't tell' of the cheese world. It is completely covered "
"with puffy green and blue mould."
msgstr ""
"チーズの世界における ｢いわざる聞かざる｣ だ。ふっくらした緑と青のかびで完全に"
"覆われている。"

msgid "Heretical Documents"
msgstr "異端文書"

msgid "Illegal documents referring to heresy."
msgstr "異説に言及する違法な文書。"

msgid "Itch Powder"
msgstr "かゆみ粉"

msgid "A banned substance with a history of disrupting robed processions."
msgstr "ローブを着た行列を混乱させた歴史があるため禁止された物質。"

msgid "Unauthorized Sirichana Merchandise"
msgstr "無許可のシリチャナ商品"

msgid ""
"Horribly tacky and outright bad merchandise with the Sirichana pasted all "
"over it. Sirichana toenail clipper anyone?"
msgstr ""
"ひどく安っぽく、徹底的に粗悪な商品で、シリチャナがそこらじゅうに貼りつけられ"
"ている。シリチャナの足用爪切りとかだれが欲しがるの？"

msgid "Tinfoil Caps"
msgstr "銀紙の帽子"

msgid "Tinfoil caps that do not look very stylish."
msgstr "まちがいなくあまりしゃれてはいないように見える銀紙の帽子。"

msgid "Scientific Preprints"
msgstr "科学的論文の前刷り"

msgid "Non-paywalled illegal scientific papers."
msgstr "有料でなくても見られる違法な科学論文。"

msgid "Sentient AI"
msgstr "感覚のある AI "

msgid "Highly illegal AI that is assumed to be sentient."
msgstr "感覚をもつと推定される高度に違法な AI。"

msgid "Bogus Proofs"
msgstr "偽の証明"

msgid ""
"Mathematical proofs with almost imperceptible modifications to make them "
"illegally false."
msgstr ""
"ほとんど気づかれないほどの修正をくわえた数学的証明で、違法なほどまちがってい"
"る。"

msgid "p-Hacked Results"
msgstr " P 値ハッキングした結果"

msgid ""
"Scientific trial results obtained through unreliable and illegal uses of "
"statistics."
msgstr "あてにならないものと違法な統計の使用によって得られた科学的試験結果。"

#. Add faction cargoes as necessary
#. Choose a random cargo and create it
#. TODO make this more nuanced
#. set it to name only
#. mission generics
#. Allow extra time for refuelling stops.
#. Choose amount of cargo and mission reward. This depends on the mission tier.
msgid "Smuggle {tonnes} of {cargo}"
msgstr "{tonnes}の{cargo}の密輸"

msgid "Smuggling contraband goods to {pnt} in the {sys} system.{msg}"
msgstr "{sys}星系の{pnt}への禁制品の密輸。{msg}"

msgid ""
"#rWARNING:#0 Contraband is illegal in most systems, and you will face "
"consequences if caught by patrols."
msgstr ""
"#r注意 :#0 禁制品はほとんどの星系で違法であり、巡視隊に見つかると重大な結果に"
"直面することになる。"

msgid "{tonnes} of {cargo} are loaded onto your ship."
msgstr "{tonnes}の{cargo}があなたの船に積みこまれた。"

#. only hook after accepting
#. 100STU per tick
#. set OSD
msgid ""
"A shifty, hasty bunch of dockworkers unload the {cargo} from your ship. One "
"of them hands you a credit stick worth #g{credits}#0 as they make their "
"leave."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You drop off the containers of {cargo} at an agreed-upon location and await "
"your payment. After some time, you receive an anonymous transfer of "
"#g{credits}#0."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The {cargo} packages are mixed in with legitimate deliveries to be handled "
"by a local agency. The overseer hands you #g{credits}#0 of their bribe."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The {cargo} is unloaded at the docks by a drunken bunch of pirates. "
"#g{credits}#0 is left in your ship as they finish up."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The {cargo} is taken off your hands and away for further distribution, not "
"before you are given your payment of #g{credits}#0."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"As you land, a group comes over to your ship right away to take care of the "
"{cargo}. After it's unloaded, you're paid your fair share of #g{credits}#0."
msgstr ""

#. increase faction
#. Date hook
#. Case still in time
msgid "Smuggling {cargo}"
msgstr "{cargo}の密輸"

#. Case missed deadline
msgid "You have failed to deliver the goods on time!"
msgstr "制限時間内に品物を配達できなかった！"

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Pirate Smuggle Cake">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>3</priority>
#. <chance>20</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <cond>
#. if require("common.pirate").systemPresence() &lt;= 0 then
#. return false
#. end
#. if player.wealth() &lt; 400e3 then
#. return false
#. end
#. return require("misn_test").reweight_active()
#. </cond>
#. <notes>
#. <tier>1</tier>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. Opens up Pirate contraband missions. The player is asked to take a cake
#. (illegal) to a random system.
#.
#.
#.
#. TODO replace images with something meant for the VN
msgid "Sweaty Individual"
msgstr "汗くさい人"

msgid "Burly Individual"
msgstr "たくましい人"

#. Note: this mission does not make any system claims.
#. target destination. Override "always_available" to true.
#. Choose reward
msgid ""
"You see a nervous looking individual that seems to be sweating profusely."
msgstr "神経質な感じでやたらと汗をかいている人に気がついた。"

msgid "You approach the giddy looking character."
msgstr "あなたは目まいがしているように見える人物に近づいた。"

msgid ""
"They are fairly absorbed in thought and take a while to notice you. "
"Suddenly, without warning, they jump out of their chair and almost fall to "
"the ground.\n"
"\"Crikes! You scared the shit out of me.\"\n"
"They clutch at their shirt as if trying to hold their heart in their ribcage."
msgstr ""
"その人はかなり考えごとにふけっていて、あなたに気づくまでしばらくかかった。そ"
"して前兆もなしに、とつぜんいすから飛びあがって、いすから落ちかけた。\n"
"　｢うわっ！　くそびっくりしましたよ｣\n"
"　そういうとシャツをつかんだ。まるで胸の中に心臓をとどめておこうとがんばって"
"いるかのようだ。"

msgid ""
"They pant for a while and then try to somewhat recover their composure as "
"they sit down once more. They seem sweatier than before.\n"
"\"Hey, say, you look like a pilot. You see, I was asked to deliver a "
"package, but I'm not feeling so well…\"\n"
"They cough to the side somewhat exaggeratedly while looking at you from the "
"corner of their eye."
msgstr ""
"それからしばらくあえぐと、いくらか平静を取りもどそうとして、もういちど座りな"
"おした。まえよりもっと汗をかいているようだ。\n"
"　｢ああ、ちょっと、あなたはパイロットみたいですね。ほら、小包の配達を頼まれて"
"いたんですが、ちょっと気分がよくなくて……｣\n"
"　そういって横にむけてややおおげさにせきをしつつ、横目であなたの方を見やる。"

msgid ""
"They lean closer to you and lower their voice.\n"
"\"I was asked to deliver a… a…\"\n"
"They furrow their brows for a second.\n"
"\"…a cake! To {pnt} in the {sys} system.\""
msgstr ""
"相手があなたの方へ乗りだして、声を低くした。\n"
"　｢配達を頼まれたんです。えー……｣\n"
"　1 秒ほどまゆを寄せた。\n"
"　｢ケーキです！　{sys}星系の{pnt}へ｣"

msgid ""
"\"It's nothing out of the ordinary, I swear! Only that this cake you see, "
"it's got some special… icing that is really sensitive. Like super sensitive. "
"The slightest disturbance can melt it and lay it all to waste. In "
"particular, any radiation can easily melt it even though it is shielded. "
"Especially stuff like scanning radiation. You catch my drift?\""
msgstr ""
"｢ふつうでないことはなにもありません。誓います！　ただ見てわかるとおりこのケー"
"キにはちょっと特殊なところがあって……ほんとうに傷つきやすい糖衣なんです。すご"
"く傷がつきやすいみたいで。わずかな外乱でも溶けることがあって、すべてが無駄に"
"なってしまうんです。とくに、どんな放射線でも簡単に溶ける可能性があります。そ"
"れはシールドしてあってもです。スキャン放射がとくにだめですね。いっていること"
"はわかりました？｣"

msgid ""
"\"All you would have to do is take the cake and go to {pnt} in the {sys} "
"system, without getting any of that nasty scanning radiation on you.\"\n"
"They shiver with disgust to emphasize and you can see some of their sweat "
"fly off onto the bar floor.\n"
"\"Once you deliver it I'll split the money half and half with you.\""
msgstr ""
"｢あなたがしなければならないことは、ケーキを持って、{sys}星系の{pnt}へ行くこと"
"だけです。たちの悪いあのスキャン放射はなにもうけないようにしてください｣\n"
"　その人は震えて気分が悪いことをはっきりさせている。あなたは汗がバーの床に飛"
"びちっていることに気がついた。\n"
"　｢配達したら、かねは半分ずつにわけましょう｣"

msgid "You stare at them coldly."
msgstr "あなたは冷たくじっと見つめる。"

msgid ""
"\"Fine, fine, take it all. It should be {credits}. Just remember no scanning "
"means no problems.\"\n"
"They extend their sweaty hand towards you.\n"
"\"So, are you in?\""
msgstr ""
"｢いいです、いいですよ、ぜんぶ取ってください。{credits} になるはずです。ただス"
"キャンされなければ問題はおきないってことだけは覚えておいてください｣\n"
"　そういってから、汗で濡れた手をあなたの方に伸ばす。\n"
"　｢で、やりますか？｣"

msgid "You decline their offer."
msgstr "あなたは申し出を断った。"

msgid ""
"They slump down in the chair in defeat.\n"
"\"Shit, what am I going to do. Think, Sam, think!\""
msgstr ""
"相手はまいってしまっていすに倒れこんだ。\n"
"　｢くそっ、なにしてるんだか。考えろ、サム、考えるんだ！｣"

msgid ""
"As you take your leave, you notice they have once again started to profusely "
"sweat."
msgstr ""
"あなたが別れを告げると、あの人はまたやたらと汗をかきはじめたことに気がつい"
"た。"

msgid "You accept their mission without shaking their hand."
msgstr "あなたは握手はせずに任務を引き受けた。"

msgid ""
"\"You're a lifesaver!\"\n"
"They lean forward and get a bit more serious.\n"
"\"One thing though, you do know how to use stealth to get around scanning "
"right?\""
msgstr ""
"｢あなたは救いの神ですよ！｣\n"
"　そういって前に乗りだすと、もうちょっと真剣になった。\n"
"　｢やっぱりもうひとつあります。ステルスを使ってスキャンを回避するってことはた"
"しかにわかってますよね？｣"

msgid "Stealth?"
msgstr "ステルス？"

msgid "Of course!"
msgstr "もちろん！"

msgid ""
"\"Oh boy, you're not going to deliver this cake in one piece without "
"stealth. It's very simple. All ships have three main statistics: range they "
"are detected at, signature range, and stealth range. Detection determines "
"how far away ships can detect your presence, while signature range controls "
"how well they can target your ship and identify it. When within signature "
"range, ships can then scan you which does nasty things like melting cakes.\""
msgstr ""
"｢ああ、ちょっと、このケーキを無事に配達するのにステルスなしじゃできませんよ。"
"ステルスはとても単純です。すべての船には 3 つのおもな統計値があって、探知され"
"る距離、識別される距離、それからステルス距離です。被探知はどれくらい離れた船"
"からあなたの存在が探知できるかを決定します。いっぽう、被識別距離はどれくらい"
"うまくあなたの船を選択して身元をあきらかにできるかを制御します。被識別距離内"
"にいると、船はあなたをスキャンできるので、ケーキが溶けるというような嫌なこと"
"がおきます｣"

msgid ""
"\"To avoid getting spotted and scanned, you can go into stealth with {key}. "
"When in stealth, you move much slower than normal, however, ships can only "
"detect you when they are within your stealth range. No detection, no "
"scanning, no problems. You can only use stealth if there are no ships "
"nearby, and it is easier to stealth in asteroids or systems with "
"interference. And if you get detected while in stealth, your cover will be "
"blown.\""
msgstr ""
"｢つきとめられたりスキャンされたりするのを避けるために、{key} でステルスモード"
"に入れます。とはいえ、ステルス中はふつうよりずっと動きが遅くなります。船があ"
"なたを探知できるのは、ステルス距離内に入ったときだけです。探知されなければ、"
"スキャンされませんし、問題もおきません。ステルスを使えるのは、船が近くにいな"
"いときだけです。そして小惑星帯や干渉のある星系ではステルスがしやすいです。そ"
"してもしステルス中に探知されたら、あなたの覆いは吹きはらわれるでしょう｣"

msgid ""
"\"So as long as you stealth with {key} and stay away from ships, you won't "
"be scanned and the cake will be alright.\""
msgstr ""
"｢だから {key} でステルスにして船から離れているかぎり、あなたはスキャンされ"
"ず、ケーキは無事です｣"

msgid ""
"\"If a ship starts to scan you, it'll be marked on your radar and overlay "
"map. Furthermore, if you're carrying stuff that you don't want scanned, your "
"autonav system will automatically be paused so you react. Make sure to get "
"away and stealth so that they can't scan you any more. Don't want to spoil "
"the cake!\""
msgstr ""
"｢どこかの船があなたをスキャンしはじめたら、その船にはレーダーやオーバーレイ"
"マップで目立つようにしるしがつきます。そのうえ、スキャンされたくないものを運"
"んでいる場合、あなたが対応できるように自動操縦システムは自動的に停止します。"
"しっかり避けて、ステルスしてください。そうすれば、むこうはそれ以上スキャンは"
"できません。ケーキをだめにしようとしないでくださいね！｣"

msgid ""
"\"Great. One second, let me get the cake.\"\n"
"They go to the restroom and come back holding a nondescript brown box that "
"seems to have 'Cake' hastily scribbled on it. They promptly hand it over to "
"you while looking both ways.\n"
"\"OK, so that's it. Make sure to take this to {pnt} in the {sys} system, and "
"watch out for scanning!\""
msgstr ""
"｢じゃあいいですね。ちょっとケーキを取りにいかせてください｣\n"
"　相手はトイレに行って、特徴のない茶色の箱を持って戻ってきた。その箱には "
"｢ケーキ｣ が入っているのだろう。その表面に ｢ケーキ｣ とあわてたように走り書きが"
"されている。左右を確認しつつ、箱は即座にあなたの手に渡された。\n"
"　｢これでよし。それではこれで。まちがいなくこれを{sys}星系の{pnt}へ持っていっ"
"てください。それとスキャンには気をつけて！｣"

msgid ""
"As you leave, behind you can hear them let out a big sigh of what you can "
"only assume is relief."
msgstr ""
"あなたが離れると、ほっとしたからとしか思えない大きなため息があなたに聞こえ"
"た。"

msgid "Cake"
msgstr "ケーキ"

msgid ""
"A cake that is supposedly sensitive to scanning radiation. Don't let anyone "
"scan it."
msgstr ""
"スキャン放射で傷つきやすいと推定されるケーキ。だれにもスキャンさせないこと。"

msgid "Deliver Cake"
msgstr "ケーキの配達"

msgid "Fly to {pnt} in the {sys} system without getting scanned"
msgstr "スキャンをうけずに{sys}星系の{pnt}へ行け。"

msgid ""
"Deliver a cake to {pnt} in the {sys} system. Apparently it has a special "
"frosting and will be damaged if you are scanned. Use stealth to avoid "
"getting scanned."
msgstr ""
"ケーキを{sys}星系の{pnt}へ配達せよ。どうもこれには特殊な糖衣がかけてあって、"
"スキャンされると傷ついてしまうらしい。ステルスを使ってスキャンされるのを回避"
"すること。"

#. only hook after accepting
#. Land hook
msgid "After you land you are promptly greeted by a burly looking individual."
msgstr "着陸すると、即座にたくましく見える人から出迎えられた。"

msgid ""
"\"So you've been sent by Sam? That weasel, I knew they weren't cut out for "
"this work.\""
msgstr ""
"｢で、サムがよこしたのはあんただね？　あのイタチ、この仕事には向いてないってわ"
"かってたんだ｣"

msgid ""
"You guess that this is the person you were supposed to deliver the cake to "
"and hand it over."
msgstr "この人にケーキを配達して手渡すことになっているのだとあなたは推測した。"

msgid ""
"They take a look at the word 'Cake' written on the box and burst into "
"laughter. After a while they calm down and turn to you.\n"
"\"This was their idea, wasn't it? Always been a bit weird that one.\""
msgstr ""
"相手は箱に書かれた ｢ケーキ｣ という言葉を見て笑いを爆発させた。すこしたって落"
"ちつくと、あなたの方を向く。\n"
"　｢これはあいつの考えだろ？　いつもちょっと妙なんだよな｣"

msgid ""
"\"I guess you're not naïve enough to think this is a cake right?\"\n"
"They chuckle.\n"
"\"Anyway, you did good work bringing it here. I'll get you your reward wired "
"and if you're interested in doing new jobs look into the mission computers. "
"I've white-listed you to act as a courier.\""
msgstr ""
"｢あんたはこれがケーキだと考えるほど世間知らずじゃないと思ってるが、そうだよ"
"な？｣\n"
"　たくましい人がにやにやする。\n"
"　｢とにかく、あんたはここへ持ってくる仕事をうまくやってくれた。報酬は送ってお"
"くし、もし新しい仕事に興味があるならミッションコンピューターを見てくれ。あん"
"たは配達人としていける人だと登録しておくから｣"

msgid ""
"\"Take care.\"\n"
"As they lumber away, you suddenly notice that quite a few suspicious figures "
"in the background disappear and follow them away. What have you gotten into?"
msgstr ""
"｢注意しとけ｣\n"
"　相手が重々しく去っていくと、あなたはとつぜん気がついた。かなり多数の怪しい"
"人影が目立たないところから姿を消して、いっしょに去っていったのだ。あなたはな"
"にに巻きこまれたのだろうか？"

msgid ""
"You helped deliver a 'cake' for some shady individuals. Your success has "
"opened up more 'special' delivery missions from the mission computer."
msgstr ""
"あなたはあるいかがわしい人たちのために ｢ケーキ｣ を届けるのを助けた。うまく届"
"けたことで、あなたはミッションコンピューターからさらなる ｢とくべつな｣ 配達任"
"務を引き受けられるようになった。"

