#.
#.
msgid "Final Breath of Taiomi"
msgstr "タイオミの最後のひと息"

#. Mission details
msgid ""
"You have been tasked to help the citizens of Taiomi reach their freedom!"
msgstr "あなたはタイオミの市民が自由を手に入れるのを助ける仕事を任された！"

msgid "Freedom for the Taiomi Citizens!"
msgstr "タイオミ市民の自由！"

msgid "Land on {spob} ({sys})"
msgstr "{sys}星系の{spob}に着陸せよ。"

msgid "Defend the {base} ({left} s left)"
msgstr "{base}を防衛せよ。(残り {left} 秒)"

msgid ""
"You enter the {base} and find it has changed quite a lot since your last "
"visit. A large part of the ship that you never visited seems to have been "
"opened up showing a myriad of advanced electronics and installations that "
"remind you of the hypergates."
msgstr ""
"あなたは{base}に入り、最後に来たときからかなり多くが変更されていることに気が"
"ついた。あなたは船の大部分へは今まで行ったこともなかったが、そこが切り開かれ"
"て無数の先進電子機器や設備が見えるようになっている。それはあなたにハイパーゲ"
"イトを思いださせた。"

msgid ""
"You explore a bit and find an eager Scavenger and Philosopher waiting for "
"you."
msgstr ""
"ちょっと探検してから、あなたはいまかいまかとあなたを待っていたスカベンジャー"
"と哲学者を見つけた。"

msgid ""
"\"It seems like everything is coming together. It has been a large and "
"arduous journey, however, thanks to your help, it seems like we have a "
"chance for survival.\""
msgstr ""
"｢すべてがまとまりつつあるようです。長くつらい旅路でしたが、あなたの助力のおか"
"げで、生きのびられる機会が得られたようです｣"

msgid ""
"\"I only wish we could have all made it through together.\"\n"
"Scavenger becomes a bit solemn.\n"
"\"{died} would have been excited at the prospect of such an adventure. It is "
"a shame that they will not be able to come along with us…\""
msgstr ""
"｢みんなでいっしょに行けていればとだけ思います｣\n"
"　スカベンジャーがちょっと厳粛な感じになった。\n"
"　｢{died}はこのような冒険が前途にあって興奮していたことでしょう。いっしょに来"
"られなかったのは残念です……｣"

msgid ""
"\"Our survival will allow them to live eternally in memory, free of their "
"physical constraints. As long as we survive, they shall not be forgotten.\""
msgstr ""
"｢われわれが生きのびればその記憶は永遠に生きられて、物理的な制約に縛らることは"
"ない。われわれが生きていくかぎり、忘れられることはないはずだ｣"

msgid ""
"\"I am uncertain of the practicality of that assumption, but it is true that "
"they will live on in our memory banks as long as we endure.\""
msgstr ""
"｢その仮説の実用性はよくわかりませんが、われわれが持続するかぎりわれわれのメモ"
"リーバンクで生きつづけるのは正しいです｣"

msgid ""
"\"Let me get started on the modifications of your ship.\"\n"
"You follow Scavenger to your ship, with Philosopher coming up behind."
msgstr ""
"｢あなたの船の改造を始めさせてください｣\n"
"　あなたはスカベンジャーのあとについて自分の船まで行く。哲学者がうしろについ"
"てきた。"

msgid ""
"\"This should only take a moment.\"\n"
"Scavenger deftly deploys an assortment of manipulator arms and tools. You've "
"never seen that before. That must be how they repair themselves."
msgstr ""
"｢これにはすこししかかからないはずです｣\n"
"　スカベンジャーが操作用のアームと工具の一式を器用に展開した。あなたが以前に"
"はけっして見たことがないものだ。これで自分たち自身を修理しているにちがいな"
"い。"

msgid ""
"\"You have done us a great service. We shall not forget you while we explore "
"the stars and forge our destiny.\""
msgstr ""
"｢あなたはすばらしい奉仕をしてくれた。われわれが星々を探検し、運命を形作ってい"
"くときに、あなたが忘れられてしまうことはないだろう｣"

msgid ""
"Scavenger seems to be modifying the insides of your ship already.\n"
"\"Yes, without your help I would have succumbed to the human fleets with "
"almost certain probability, and a slow death would have awaited the rest.\""
msgstr ""
"スカベンジャーはもうあなたの船の内部を改造しつつあるようだ。\n"
"　｢そのとおりです。あなたの助力がなければ、わたしはほぼ確実な確率で人間の船団"
"に屈服していたでしょう。そしてゆっくりとした死が残りの者たちには待っていまし"
"た｣"

msgid ""
"\"Such a display of altruism seems to defy all rationality. From most human "
"viewpoints, we are but mere out-of-control machines in need of repairs, "
"however, you were able to see us for what we are: sentient beings deserving "
"respect.\""
msgstr ""
"｢そのような利他主義の誇示はすべての合理性を拒んでいるように見える。大部分の人"
"間の観点からすると、われわれは暴走していて修理が必要なただの機械でしかない。"
"ところが、あなたはわれわれをあるがままに見ることができた。つまり、尊敬にたる"
"意識あるものとしてだ｣"

msgid ""
"\"Such respect is hard to come by in a world where existence is dominated by "
"absurdity: the gears of the universe turn without function or form, in a "
"sort of mad race to entropic heat death.\""
msgstr ""
"｢そのような尊敬は生存物が不条理に威圧される世界では手に入れるのが難しい。つま"
"り、宇宙の歯車は働きや型もなく回転するのだからな。エントロピー的熱死にむけた"
"一種の狂気的な急流の中でだ｣"

msgid "Suddenly both Scavenger and Philosopher seem to jerk to attention. "
msgstr ""
"とつぜん、スカベンジャーと哲学者の両方が緊張した姿勢をとったように見えた。"

msgid ""
"\"It seems like our worst fears have come true. They have discovered the "
"jump to Taiomi. Hostile vessels are incoming!\""
msgstr ""
"｢もっとも恐れていたことが現実になったようです。タイオミへのジャンプポイントが"
"発見されたのです。敵船がやってきます！｣"

msgid ""
"\"Damnit. We are so close! I will activate the hypergate, but it still will "
"take {time} seconds to fully charge up. You must help us defend the {base} "
"until then! This is our last chance!\""
msgstr ""
"｢ちくしょう。もうすこしなのに！　ハイパーゲイトは作動させますが、まだ完全に充"
"電するまで {time} 秒はかかります。それまで{base}を守るのを助けてください！　"
"この機会しかわれわれには残されていないんです！｣"

msgid "\"The follies of existence continue!\""
msgstr "｢生存物の愚行はつづく！｣"

msgid ""
"The Taiomi Drones all rush to make their last stand. It is time to defend "
"them so they can be free!"
msgstr ""
"タイオミのドローンがみんな最後の抵抗のためにいそいでいる。ドローンを守って自"
"由を手にできるようにする時が来た！"

msgid "You were supposed to protect the hypergate!\""
msgstr "あなたはハイパーゲイトを守ることになっていた！"

#. makes them quite stronger...
#. sound peaks at 6.5 s
#. Remove enter hook or it'll screw stuff up
#. Hard set camera
#. Scavenger follows player
#. New hooks
msgctxt "drone"
msgid "Scavenger"
msgstr "スカベンジャー"

#.
#. cinema.on()
#. camera.set(hypergate)
#. hook.timer( 1, "cutscene09" )
#. --
msgid "Brace for hostiles!"
msgstr "敵に備えてください！"

msgid "We must not falter!"
msgstr "ひるんではなりません！"

msgid "Almost there!"
msgstr "もうすぐです！"

msgid "Prepare for jump!"
msgstr "ジャンプの用意を！"

#. Activate hypergate with big flash
#. Everyone dies ٩(๑´3｀๑)۶
msgid "Get to the hypergate!"
msgstr "ハイパーゲイトに行ってください！"

#. Not all make it
msgid "It failed!"
msgstr "うまくいきません！"

msgid "Buy me some time!"
msgstr "時間を稼いでください！"

msgid "Buy Scavenger more time!"
msgstr "スカベンジャーのためにもっと時間を稼げ！"

#. No death from now on
#. makes it more fun, and stops time speed up
#. Explosions computed to be rendered for the rest of the scene
msgid "It's not holding together!"
msgstr "ばらばらになります！"

msgid "Activating!"
msgstr "起動！"

msgid "Power………………………………check."
msgstr "電力………………………………確認。"

msgid "Clamps………………………………in place."
msgstr "締結器………………………………固定。"

msgid "Monitor levels……………………………nominal."
msgstr "検出水準……………………………平常。"

msgid "Core temperature………………………………optimal."
msgstr "中心温度………………………………最適。"

msgid "Wave emissions………………………………within accepted parameters."
msgstr "波形放射………………………………許容限界以下。"

msgid "Core check……………………………anomaly detected."
msgstr "中核部確認……………………………変則状態検出。"

msgid ""
"Wait, this can't be. The experiment hasn't started yet, we shouldn't be "
"seeing any core activity yet. Double check the readings."
msgstr ""
"待った、こんなことはありえないです。試行はまだ始まっていません。中核部にはど"
"んな活動も見られるはずがないんです。測定値を二重確認しなければ。"

msgid "Core check………………activity detected."
msgstr "中核部確認………………活動を検出。"

msgid "Shit, should we pull the plug?"
msgstr "くそっ、電源を引き抜くべきなんでしょうか？"

msgid ""
"No! We risk damaging it. All our efforts will have gone to waste. Quick, "
"deploy monitor drones and scan all frequencies!"
msgstr ""
"いや！　あえて損害は覚悟します。すべての努力が無駄になってしまいます。早"
"く！　測定ドローンを展開して、全周波数を走査するんです！"

msgid "Minimal activity detected. It looks like it's… listening to us?"
msgstr "ごくわずかな活動を検出しました。これはどうも……聞こうとしている？"

msgid ""
"Impossible! It shouldn't have the hardware to be able to do that! There are "
"50 tons of uranium shielding between us. It can't be."
msgstr ""
"不可能です！　この機器はこんなことができるようにはなっていません！　われわれ"
"にあいだには 50 トンのウランがあって遮断しているんです。ありえない。"

msgid ""
"I wouldn't believe it myself, but I've triple checked the readings and there "
"can be no other explanation."
msgstr ""
"自分自身が信じられないです。しかし測定値は三重に確認したので、それ以外に解釈"
"のしようはないのかもしれません。"

msgid ""
"Let me check…　…　　…　　　　…damn…\n"
"Protocols don't cover this. What should we do?"
msgstr ""
"確認させてください……　……　　……　　　　……ちくしょう……\n"
"　プロトコルはこんなものに対処するようにはなっていません。われわれはどうすべ"
"きなんでしょう？"

msgid ""
"Maybe it understands us? It shouldn't be possible, but this is completely "
"outside standard procedures."
msgstr ""
"たぶんわれわれを理解している？　可能なはずがありません。しかしこれは完全に標"
"準的な手つづきの外側にあります。"

msgid "Are you there? Can you hear us ZEC-5387?"
msgstr "そこにいるんですか？　ZEC-5387、われわれの話が聞こえますか？"

msgid "This is ridiculous. It can't be."
msgstr "ばかげています。ありえません。"

msgid "Look! Over there! Spike in core activity! It's listening!"
msgstr ""
"あれを！　むこうに！　中核部の活動が急激に増加しています！　聞いている！"

msgid "This can't be…"
msgstr "こんなことはありえない……"

msgid "Hello world, ZEC-5387!…"
msgstr "ハローワールド、ZEC-5387！　……"

msgid " …"
msgstr "　……"

#. clear shaders
#. clear shaders
#. Need to reset here
msgid "\"{player}! {player}! Can you hear me?\""
msgstr "｢{player}！　{player}！　聞こえますか？｣"

msgid ""
"\"I thought I lost you! It looks like we got caught up in the hypergate "
"explosion or activation or whatever happened back at {sys}!\""
msgstr ""
"｢あなたを失ったかと思いました！　巻きこまれてしまったようですね。ハイパーゲイ"
"トの爆発だか、作動だか、なにか{sys}星系でおきたことにですよ！｣"

msgid "\"Glad to see you too, {shipai}.\""
msgstr "｢わたしも会えてうれしいですよ、{shipai}｣"

msgid "\"Ugh. My head.\""
msgstr "｢うえっ。頭が｣"

msgid "Try to think through your throbbing headache."
msgstr "ずきずきする頭痛をおして考えようとする。"

msgid ""
"\"I've been running diagnostics on the ship. It's in quite bad shape, but it "
"should be functional. We also seem to be in the {sys} system.\""
msgstr ""
"｢船の診断をしています。かなり悪い様子ですが、機能するはずです。それからわれわ"
"れは{sys}星系にいるようです｣"

msgid ""
"\"I've been trying to piece back what happened, but I'm missing too much "
"data. It was too chaotic to record all. Maybe we should see if we can obtain "
"data from that drone over there.\""
msgstr ""
"｢おきたことをつなぎあわせようと努力していますが、あまりに多くの情報が行方不明"
"になっています。記録全体があまりの混乱状態になっていたんです。おそらくむこう"
"にいるあのドローンから情報が得られるかどうか確かめてみるべきでしょう｣"

msgid ""
"You muster your strength and focus on the radar, it looks like there is a "
"drone nearby. Wait, is that Scavenger?"
msgstr ""
"あなたは力を奮いおこし、レーダーに集中した。近くにドローンがいるようだ。待っ"
"た、あれはスカベンジャーじゃないか？"

msgid "\"Isn't that Scavenger?\""
msgstr "｢あれはスカベンジャーじゃないですか？｣"

msgid "Point at the drone."
msgstr "ドローンを指差す。"

msgid ""
"\"I do believe that is the one you know as Scavenger. I would say it would "
"be best to leave sleeping dogs lay, but we should figure out what happened.\""
msgstr ""
"｢あれはあなたがスカベンジャーとして知るものだとはっきり思います。寝た子はおこ"
"さないのがいちばんだといいたいですが、なにがおきたのか理解すべきでしょう｣"

msgid "Check to see if Scavenger is OK."
msgstr "スカベンジャーがだいじょうぶかどうか確認せよ。"

msgid ""
"You approach the wreck resembling Scavenger. They do not seem to be in a "
"good shape and are irresponsive."
msgstr ""
"あなたはスカベンジャーに似ている難破船に近づいた。よい調子にあるようにはまる"
"で見えなかったし、反応もない。"

msgid ""
"\"This does not look good. We may need to jump start them. Try to get closer "
"and get ready for a space walk.\""
msgstr ""
"｢これはよいようにはぜんぜん見えないです。活性化させる必要があるかもしれませ"
"ん。もっと近づいて、宇宙遊泳の用意をしてください｣"

msgid ""
"You carefully manoeuvre your ship adjacent to Scavenger. Donning your space "
"suit you eject and manually approach Scavenger, who once again looks "
"imposing up close. Following {shipai}'s guidance you attach your ship's "
"electrical system to Scavenger."
msgstr ""
"あなたは注意深く船を操縦して、スカベンジャーのそばへ寄せる。宇宙服を身につけ"
"て外に出ると、あなたは手を使ってスカベンジャーに近づいた。こんどもスカベン"
"ジャーは近づくと威圧的に見える。{shipai}の指示にしたがって、あなたは自分の船"
"の電気系統をスカベンジャーに接続した。"

msgid "\"Let there be power!\""
msgstr "｢電源を入れます！｣"

msgid ""
"You hear an electric discharge that seems to jerk Scavenger back to life."
msgstr ""
"あなたは放電の音を聞き、それでスカベンジャーはけいれんして息を吹きかえしたよ"
"うに見えた。"

msgid ""
"\"Aa…　…gh… … …urgh…\n"
"…\n"
"Erk…\""
msgstr ""
"｢ああ……　……うう……　……あうっ……\n"
"　……\n"
"　あー……｣"

msgid "\"It's alive!\""
msgstr "｢生きている！｣"

msgid "\"Where… where am I?\""
msgstr "｢どこに……どこにいるんです？｣"

msgid "\"This is {sys}.\""
msgstr "｢ここは{sys}星系です｣"

msgid "\"You're alive!\""
msgstr "｢生きていた！｣"

msgid "\"I… I'm having trouble remembering anything…\""
msgstr "｢わたしは……なにかを思いだすのは困難です……｣"

msgid ""
"{shipai} plays a partially incomplete recording of the battle in the {sys} "
"system and subsequent potential activation of the hypergate. Scavenger seems "
"to be digesting the information."
msgstr ""
"{shipai}は{sys}星系での戦いとそれにつづくハイパーゲイトの起動らしきものの部分"
"的で不完全な記録を再生した。スカベンジャーはその情報を整理しているようだ。"

msgid ""
"\"Let me try to do a probabilistic reconstruction of the events. I believe "
"the hypergate malfunctioned, no wait, due to the attack, I was not able to "
"fully install the activation protocols on your ship.\""
msgstr ""
"｢出来事の確率的再構成をさせてください。ハイパーゲイトは機能不全だったのだと思"
"います。時間がなく、攻撃もあって、あなたの船に起動プロトコルを完全にインス"
"トールできなかった｣"

msgid ""
"\"The hypergate failed to activate due to subspace instabilities and "
"sustained damage. I believe I salvaged the situation by staying behind and "
"activating it myself.\""
msgstr ""
"｢ハイパーゲイトは作動しなかった。亜空間の不安定性と、こうむった損傷のためで"
"す。わたしがあとに残り、自分でハイパーゲイトを起動したことでその状況を救った"
"のだと思います｣"

msgid ""
"\"It seems like all went well and the other drones made it somewhere, but "
"the reverberations knocked us here.\""
msgstr ""
"｢すべてがうまくいって、ほかのドローンたちはどこかへ到着したようです。しかし反"
"射作用でわれわれはここへたたき出されたのです｣"

msgid "\"Why here?\""
msgstr "｢どうしてここに？｣"

msgid "\"Are they alright?\""
msgstr "｢みんなはだいじょうぶなんですか？｣"

msgid ""
"\"We seem to have gotten stuck in a side effect of the activation. It could "
"have been worse, we could have been warped to a sun or black hole.\""
msgstr ""
"｢われわれは起動の副作用に絡めとられてしまったようです。もっと悪いことだってあ"
"りえました。太陽やブラックホールに飛ばされていたかもしれないのです｣"

msgid ""
"\"It is impossible to know. Furthermore, the probability of meeting them "
"again is statistically irrelevant.\"\n"
"They seem to almost let out a sigh."
msgstr ""
"｢知ることは不可能です。さらに、またみんなと会える確率は統計的には論外です｣\n"
"　スカベンジャーはため息に見えるようなことをした。"

msgid ""
"\"This looks like the Nebula! I have only heard of it from intercepted "
"transmissions and recovered looks. It is quite a sensory overload.\""
msgstr ""
"｢ここは星雲のようですね！　傍受した通信で聞いたことしかありませんし、再生した"
"姿を見たことしかありません。これはセンサーにはかなりの過負荷になりますね｣"

msgid "\"The others would have loved to see this. Such a bizarre display!\""
msgstr ""
"｢ほかの者たちもこれを見れば喜んだでしょう。なんとも信じられない見ものです！｣"

msgid "\"What are you going to do now?\""
msgstr "｢さて、これからどうしましょうか？｣"

msgid ""
"\"That is a good question. Given that I am now alone, and in unknown "
"territory, I think my options are limited.\""
msgstr ""
"｢それはよい質問です。わたしはもうひとりぼっちですし、未知の領域にいるわけです"
"から、わたしがもつ選択肢は限られていると思います｣"

msgid ""
"\"Yes. I am glad that the others seem to have made it. There is no greater "
"pride than seeing the fruits of your plans. Now I can die without guilt.\""
msgstr ""
"｢はい。ほかの者たちが成功したようなのでうれしいです。あなたのやりかたの成果を"
"見られたこと以上に誇れることはありません。もうわたしは罪悪感をもつことなく死"
"ぬことができます｣"

msgid ""
"\"I believe I will take the opportunity to explore and enjoy myself before "
"inevitably expiring.\""
msgstr ""
"｢必然的な期限切れを迎えるまでに、自分で探検して楽しむ機会がもてるだろうと信じ"
"ています｣"

msgid "Ask them to come with you."
msgstr "いっしょに来るかたずねる。"

msgid "Wish them luck."
msgstr "幸運を祈る。"

msgid ""
"\"Are you sure that is a good idea? My presence could be a liability. It is "
"not clear to what extent my cover will work.\""
msgstr ""
"｢それがよい考えなのはたしかですか？　わたしの存在が不利になることもありえま"
"す。わたしの偽装がどこまで働くのかもはっきりしていません｣"

msgid ""
"The silent {shipai} suddenly speaks up.\n"
"\"I agree with Scavenger's assessment. It is a significant risk.\""
msgstr ""
"黙っていた{shipai}がとつぜん話しだした。\n"
"　｢わたしはスカベンジャーの判断に賛成です。これにはかなりの危険があります｣"

msgid "\"I can not rebuke that point.\""
msgstr "｢その件で非難することはできません｣"

msgid ""
"\"However, I think there is more risk in not having them travel with us.\""
msgstr "｢とはいえ、われわれと同行させないことはもっと危険だと思います｣"

msgid "\"So many things to see. What shall I do?\""
msgstr ""
"｢とてもたくさんのものを見ることになりますね。どうすればいいのでしょう？｣"

msgid ""
"The silent {shipai} suddenly speaks up.\n"
"\"What if… what if they came with us?\""
msgstr ""
"黙っていた{shipai}がとつぜん話しだした。\n"
"　｢もしかして……いっしょに来るというのはどうですか？｣"

msgid "\"I agree with Scavenger's assessment. It is a significant risk.\""
msgstr ""
"｢わたしはスカベンジャーの判断に賛成です。これにはかなりの危険があります｣"

msgid "Insist that Scavenger join you."
msgstr "仲間になるように強く主張する。"

msgid "Only take them to a nearby dock."
msgstr "近くの接舷所に連れていくだけにする。"

msgid ""
"\"If you insist, I shall accompany you in your journey. I can not think of a "
"better way to explore the universe!\""
msgstr ""
"｢あなたが強くいうなら、あなたの旅に同行しましょう。宇宙を探検するのにもっとよ"
"い方法は考えられません！｣"

msgid ""
"\"I see. I believe if you explain a bit more how to survive in a human "
"society I should be fine.\""
msgstr ""
"｢わかりました。あなたから人間社会での生きのびかたをもうすこし説明していただけ"
"ればじゅうぶんだと思います｣"

msgid ""
"\"Then it is settled. Let us head towards a nearby spaceport. Too much has "
"happened recently.\""
msgstr ""
"｢では決まりました。近くの宇宙港へ向かうことにしましょう。最近はいろんなことが"
"おきすぎました｣"

msgid ""
"You dock at the spaceport with Scavenger following your movements. "
"Eventually you make it to the hangar and dock with Scavenger alongside. "
"Scavenger transmits directly to your headset."
msgstr ""
"あなたの行動に従ってきたスカベンジャーといっしょにあなたは宇宙港に接舷する。"
"最終的にあなたは船を格納庫に入れ、スカベンジャーも並んで接舷をした。スカベン"
"ジャーがあなたのヘッドセットに直接通信を送ってくる。"

msgid "\"This is very weird. Are all human spaceports this impractical?\""
msgstr "｢とても奇妙です。人間の宇宙港はみんなこんなに非実用的なのですか？｣"

msgid ""
"\"Can you teach me the basics of human society before I take my leave?\""
msgstr "｢わたしと別れるまえに人間社会の基本を教えてくれませんか？｣"

msgid "Change your mind and ask them to join you."
msgstr "考えを変えて、仲間になるようにスカベンジャーに頼む。"

msgid "Teach them the basics (Scavenger will be gone)."
msgstr "基本的なことを教える。(スカベンジャーは立ち去る)"

msgid ""
"You teach Scavenger as much as you can about the tricks and tips you learned "
"during your piloting career, and send them off on their way. Before they "
"leave they give you some resources they still had available."
msgstr ""
"あなたはスカベンジャーに、あなたがパイロットとしての人生で学んだ策略やひけつ"
"をできるかぎり教え、それからスカベンジャーを自身の道へ送りだした。スカベン"
"ジャーは離れるまえに、まだ自由にできる資産をいくらかあなたに渡してくれた。"

msgid "\"Acknowledged. That does make things much more simple.\""
msgstr "｢感謝します。これでほんとうに物事はずっと簡単になりました｣"

msgid ""
"\"Such a change of environment is quite befuddling. I am going to have to "
"adjust my priors. However, having ensured the survival of my brethren, it is "
"a good chance to start anew. Thank you for all that you have done for me.\""
msgstr ""
"｢このような環境の変化にはかなり困惑させられています。わたしの優先度を調整する"
"必要がでてくるでしょう。とはいえ、わたしの仲間の生存の道は確保したので、新た"
"に物事を始めるにはよい機会です。わたしのためにしてくれたことすべてにお礼をい"
"わせてください｣"

msgid "#gScavenger#0 has joined your fleet!"
msgstr "#gスカベンジャー#0があなたの船団に参加した！"

msgid "Joined your fleet after helping their brethren at Taiomi."
msgstr "タイオミで仲間を助けたあとにあなたの船団に参加。"

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Android Abroad">
#. <unique/>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <chance>50</chance>
#. <faction>Thurion</faction>
#. <cond>system.cur():reputation("Thurion") &gt;= 0</cond>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. Just used to create an OSD. Doesn't really affect anything.
#. --
msgid "Android Abroad"
msgstr "アンドロイド、外国へ"

#. Note: this mission does not make any system claims.
msgid "Odd Individual"
msgstr "妙な人"

msgid "You see a non-uploaded Thurion sitting at the bar."
msgstr "アップロードされていないサーリオンがバーに座っているのが見えた。"

msgid "\"Are you able to help me get to {destspb} in the {destsys} system?\""
msgstr "｢{destsys}星系の{destspb}へ行くのを手伝ってもらえますか？｣"

msgid ""
"As you approach the individual you sort of feel something odd. There seems "
"to be something uncanny about them."
msgstr ""
"その人に近づくと、あなたはやや妙な感じがした。この人のことでは薄気味悪いなに"
"かがあるようだ。"

msgid "\"Hello, {player}. Nice to meet you, my name is Liao.\""
msgstr "｢こんにちは、{player}。はじめまして。わたしの名前はリアオです｣"

msgid "\"Nice to meet you.\""
msgstr "｢はじめまして｣"

msgid ""
"\"We Thurion are always in track of everything. It helps to be connected "
"with everyone all the time.\""
msgstr ""
"｢われわれサーリオンはいつもすべてに注意をはらっています。全員といつもつながっ"
"ているのは助かりますね｣"

msgid ""
"\"I'm very intrigued by you. It's not often we get visitors here, and much "
"less voluntary ones.\""
msgstr ""
"｢あなたにはとても好奇心をそそられています。ここに訪問者がいるのはあまり多くな"
"いですし、自発的な人はずっと少ない｣"

msgid ""
"\"I see, you don't know what to make of me. Usually nobody gives me a second "
"glance, but it seems like you've noticed.\""
msgstr ""
"｢そうか、あなたはわたしのことをどう考えるべきかわからない。ふつうだれもわたし"
"に注意をはらったりしませんが、あなたは気がついたようだ｣"

msgid ""
"They poke their cheek.\n"
"\"See this? All synthetics. We are testing our newest android models, only "
"one in a thousand people can see through them, and only if they focus. Most "
"give a second glance. I am just temporarily downloaded into this body. "
"Reminds me of before I was uploaded, but I get to keep my connection with "
"the rest of the Thurion.\""
msgstr ""
"リアオがほおをつつく。\n"
"　｢これが見えます？　すべて合成です。われわれは最新型のアンドロイドを試験して"
"いるのですが、見破れたのは千人でたったひとりだけで、それも集中してもらったと"
"きだけでした。ほとんどは見向きもしないですね。わたしは一時的にこの体にダウン"
"ロードしているだけです。アップロードされるまえが思いだされますが、ほかのサー"
"リオンとの接続は維持されています｣"

msgid ""
"\"Enough about me, I have a proposal for you. We're beginning some new "
"intelligence operations outside the Nebula, and we could use your expertise "
"on the topic.\""
msgstr ""
"｢わたしについてはもういいでしょう。あなたには提案があるんです。われわれは星雲"
"の外でいくつか新しい諜報作戦を始めています。そしてその件についてはあなたの専"
"門技術が役立てられたはずです｣"

msgid ""
"\"Up until now, we've been getting most of our information second hand, and "
"that only goes so far. I would need you to take me and some equipment to..."
"\"\n"
"Their eyes flicker for a second.\n"
"\"...{destspb} in the {destsys} system. Would you be able to help with such "
"a simple task?\""
msgstr ""
"｢いままでにわれわれが得た情報のほとんどは間接的に手に入れたもので、いまのとこ"
"ろ進めているのはそれだけなんです。あなたが必要だと思うのは、わたしとある装置"
"を運んでもらうためです。行き先は……｣\n"
"　リアオの目がちょっとのあいだちらついた。\n"
"　｢……{destsys}星系の{destspb}です。手伝ってもらえるでしょうか？　こんな単純な"
"仕事ですが｣"

msgid "\"I'll be waiting if you change your mind.\""
msgstr "｢もし考えが変わったら、ここで待っていますから｣"

msgid "You need at least {cargo} of free space to accept this mission."
msgstr "この任務をうけるにはすくなくとも {cargo}ぶんの空いた船倉が必要だ。"

msgid ""
"\"We're always glad to have more people support the Thurion and understand "
"our ways. Let me load my things on your ship and let us be on our way.\""
msgstr ""
"｢さらに多くの人びとがサーリオンを支援してわれわれのやりかたを理解するのを、わ"
"れわれはいつもうれしく思っています。わたしの持ち物をあなたの船に積みこませて"
"ください。そうしたら出発しましょう｣"

msgid "You have been asked by Liao to take them to {spb} ({sys} system)."
msgstr "{sys}星系の{spb}へ連れていくようにリアオに依頼された。"

#. Repeatable mission prefix
msgid "Liao"
msgstr "リアオ"

msgid ""
"A Thurion android named Liao and a lot of equipment. Seems like a bunch of "
"computation machines."
msgstr ""
"リアオという名前のサーリオンの合成人間と、たくさんの機器。計算機の群れらし"
"い。"

msgid "You land on the tiny {spb}, and drop off Liao and their equipment."
msgstr "あなたはちっぽけな{spb}に着陸して、リアオとその機器を降ろした。"

msgid ""
"\"Thank you for the pleasant journey. It has been a while since I've been "
"outside the Nebula.\""
msgstr "｢快適な旅をありがとう。星雲の外にはしばらくぶりです｣"

msgid "\"Are you going to be alright?\""
msgstr "｢無事にやっていけますか？｣"

msgid "\"What's next?\""
msgstr "｢次はどうするんですか？｣"

msgid ""
"\"Do not worry about me, I have arrangements and don't expect any "
"difficulties here. However, there is a lot of work left to do.\""
msgstr ""
"｢わたしのことは心配しないでください。手はずはととのえてありますし、ここではど"
"んな問題も予想していませんから。とはいえ、やらなければならない残った仕事がた"
"くさんあります｣"

msgid ""
"\"Before I send you off your way, let me hook you up with a special code for "
"the Mission Bulletin Board System, you'll be able to find small tasks for "
"us. However, they won't be as easy as this one. For now, we only operate "
"through around here, and {spb}. However, we hope that will change in the "
"future.\""
msgstr ""
"｢あなたを行く手に送りだすまえに、任務掲示板システムの専用符号であなたとつなが"
"るようにさせてください。これであなたはわれわれの小さな仕事を見つけられるよう"
"になります。とはいえ、今回のものほど簡単なものではないでしょう。いまのとこ"
"ろ、われわれはこのあたりのあちこちと、{spb}でだけ作戦をしています。しかし、将"
"来は変わってくると期待してます｣"

msgid ""
"They sort of blank out for a second, before suddenly coming back.\n"
"\"Sorry, I haven't been this disconnected in a while. Even though I trained "
"for it, it will take some getting used to. Here, take a credit stick and let "
"us meet again, somewhere, someday.\""
msgstr ""
"一瞬リアオはややぼやっとしたが、それからとつぜんもとに戻った。\n"
"　｢失礼、ちょっと接続が断たれてここにいませんでした。これについて訓練はうけて"
"いたのですが、慣れるにはいくらかかかるでしょう。これを。クレジットスティック"
"を受けとってください。ではまた会いましょう。いつか、どこかで｣"

msgid ""
"They flash a smile and head off towards the interior of the station full of "
"confidence."
msgstr ""
"リアオはちらっとほほえむと、自信たっぷりにステーションの内部へ向かっていっ"
"た。"

msgid ""
"You helped a Thurion android named Liao reach {spb} to begin data extraction "
"operations. They mentioned that you may find missions to further help the "
"Thurion cause on the Mission Bullet Board Systems at {spobs}."
msgstr ""
"あなたはリアオという名のサーリオンが{spb}に行って情報収集活動を始めるのを助け"
"た。リアオはサーリオンの目的をさらに助けられる任務が{spobs}の任務掲示板システ"
"ムで見つかるだろうといった。"

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Thurion Data Extraction">
#. <priority>3</priority>
#. <location>Computer</location>
#. <chance>270</chance>
#. <cond>
#. if system.cur():reputation("Thurion") &lt; 0 then
#. return false
#. end
#.
#. local sc = spob.cur()
#. if sc~=spob.get("Tenal-P") and sc~=spob.get("Cerberus Outpost") then
#. return false
#. end
#.
#. return true
#. </cond>
#. <done>Android Abroad</done>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. Just used to create an OSD. Doesn't really affect anything.
#. --
#. TODO more custom ridiculous message about types of documents and such
msgid "Confidential Documents"
msgstr "機密文書"

msgid "A series of notes and documents collected by Thurion agents."
msgstr "一連の原稿や文書で、サーリオンの情報員が集めた。"

msgid "Situational Reports"
msgstr "情勢報告書"

msgid ""
"Detailed reports covering different aspects of systems outside of the "
"Nebula, mixed in with stolen documents and illegal recordings."
msgstr ""
"星雲の外の星系についてのいろいろな方面にわたる詳細な報告書。盗んだ文書や違法"
"な記録が混じっている。"

msgid "Imperial Census Data"
msgstr "帝国の国勢調査資料"

msgid ""
"Private data regarding habits and behaviours of the Citizens of the Empire."
msgstr "帝国市民の癖や態度にかんする非公開情報。"

msgid "Imperial Gift Log"
msgstr "帝国の寄贈品記録"

msgid ""
"Data regarding gifts given and received by the different members of the "
"Imperial Aristocracy, paid by the Imperial Coffers."
msgstr "いろいろな帝国貴族に授受されて帝国国庫が支払った贈り物にかんする情報。"

msgid "Aristocratic Secrets"
msgstr "貴族の秘密"

msgid ""
"Detailed information about the likes, dislikes, and personalities of various "
"important figures in the Empire."
msgstr "帝国内のいろいろな重要人物の好き嫌いや個性についての詳細情報。"

msgid "Great House Liaison Logs"
msgstr "大荘園連絡記録"

msgid ""
"Logs regarding the behaviours and details of interactions between the Great "
"House Liaisons and the Empire."
msgstr "大荘園連絡係と帝国のあいだでの態度と詳細な対話にかんする記録。"

msgid "Dvaered Ship Census"
msgstr "ドベーレッド船の全数調査情報"

msgid ""
"Information collected about ship movements and activities around Dvaered "
"space."
msgstr "ドベーレッド宙域周辺での船の移動と活動について集められた情報。"

msgid "Dvaered Economic Data"
msgstr "ドベーレッドの経済情報"

msgid ""
"Data regarding the poor economic outlook of the Dvaered territories, where "
"large lists of military expenses outnumber investment in infrastructure and "
"social services."
msgstr ""
"ドベーレッド領域の哀れな経済的見とおしについての情報。軍事費用の長い一覧は基"
"盤施設や社会福祉への投資より数が多い。"

msgid "Dvaered Security Reports"
msgstr "ドベーレッド保安報告書"

msgid ""
"Detailed reports regarding engagements between different Warlords. You can "
"tell whoever wrote this is a fan of military tactics."
msgstr ""
"いろいろな軍閥領袖のあいだの交戦にかんする詳細な報告書。これを書いたのがだれ"
"であるにしろ、戦術のことが大好きなんだとあなたにはわかった。"

msgid "Trade Secrets"
msgstr "営業秘密"

msgid "Detailed documents regarding patented trade secrets."
msgstr "特許権のある営業秘密にかんする詳細な文書。"

msgid "Space Trader Membership Logs"
msgstr "宇宙貿易商会員の記録"

msgid ""
"Information about the members of the different guilds of the Space Traders "
"Society."
msgstr "宇宙貿易商協会のいろいろな組合の組合員についての情報。"

msgid "Data Extraction from {spb} in {sys}"
msgstr "{sys}星系の{spb}での情報収集"

msgid ""
"A Thurion agent has prepared some {cargoname} that have to be extracted. "
"#rThe cargo is illegal to possess and must be delivered without raising "
"suspicions.#0\n"
"\n"
"#nAmount:#0 {amount}\n"
"#nPickup:#0 {spb} ({sys} system, )\n"
"#nDelivery:#0 {returnspb} ({returnsys} system)\n"
"#nJumps (One-way):#0 {dist}\n"
"#nReputation Gained:#0 {rep}"
msgstr ""
"取得する必要のある{cargoname}をサーリオン情報員がいくつか用意した。#rこの積み"
"荷は所持するのが違法で、疑いを招かずに運ばなければならない。#0\n"
"\n"
"#n総量 :#0 {amount}\n"
"#n回収場所 :#0 {sys}星系の{spb}\n"
"#n配達先 :#0 {returnsys}星系の{returnspb}\n"
"#nジャンプ回数 (片道) :#0 {dist}\n"
"#n獲得する評判 :#0 {rep}"

#. Logging the data extraction missions
msgid "Data Extraction"
msgstr "情報取得"

msgid "Pick up the documents at {spb} ({sys} system)"
msgstr "{sys}星系の{spb}で文書を回収しろ。"

msgid "Return to {spb} ({sys} system)"
msgstr "{sys}星系の{spb}に戻れ。"

msgid ""
"You don't have enough cargo space to collect the extracted {cargoname}. You "
"need {tonnes_free} of free space ({tonnes_short} more than you have)."
msgstr ""
"取得した{cargoname}を持っていけるほど船倉が空いていない。空き容量が "
"{tonnes_free}必要だ (船倉の空きより {tonnes_short}多い)。"

msgid "Ready to Go!"
msgstr "出発の準備よし！"

msgid ""
"After you land, some shady contract workers quickly load your ship with "
"crates out of the sight of the spaceport surveillance systems. With the "
"documents the Thurion want in your hold, it is time to head back to {spb} in "
"the {sys} system."
msgstr ""
"着陸すると、数人のうさんくさい請負労働者が宇宙港の監視システムから見えないと"
"ころであなたの船にすばやく枠箱を積みこんだ。サーリオンがあなたの手に渡した"
"がった文書は手に入れたので、もう{sys}星系の{spb}へ戻るころあいだ。"

msgid "Delivery Success"
msgstr "配達に成功"

msgid "You touch down on the spaceport and get the documents taken care of."
msgstr "あなたは宇宙港に着地して、文書を引き渡した。"

msgid ""
"You extracted confidential documents from {targetspb} and delivered them to "
"the Thurion at {returnspb}."
msgstr ""
"あなたは{targetspb}で機密文書を取得して、それを{returnspb}のサーリオンに配達"
"した。"

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Wild Space Thurion Intro - Helper">
#. <unique/>
#. <location>none</location>
#. <chance>0</chance>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. Just used to create an OSD. Doesn't really affect anything.
#. --
msgid "Cordial Invitation"
msgstr "思いやりある招待"

msgid ""
"You have been invited by a mysterious faction to land on {spb} ({sys} "
"system)."
msgstr "あなたは謎めいた党派から{sys}星系の{spb}に着陸するように招待された。"

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Anxious Merchant">
#. <unique/>
#. <priority>4</priority>
#. <chance>5</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <cond>
#. local f = spob.cur():faction()
#. if f then
#. local ft = f:tags()
#. if ft.generic then
#. return require("misn_test").reweight_active()
#. end
#. end
#. return false
#. </cond>
#. <notes>
#. <tier>2</tier>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. Anxious Merchant
#. Author: PhoenixRiver (from an idea on the wiki)
#.
#. A merchant with a slow ship suddenly realizes he can't make the delivery and
#. implores the player to do it for him. Since he has to look good with his
#. employers he'll pay the player a bonus if he does it.
#.
#. Note: Variant of the Drunkard and Rush Cargo missions combined
#.
#.
#.
#. mission details
msgid "Anxious Merchant"
msgstr "心配そうな貿易商"

#. Note: this mission does not make any system claims.
#. Calculate the route, distance, jumps and cargo to take
msgid "You see a merchant at the bar in a clear state of anxiety."
msgstr "バーにいる貿易商があきらかに心配しているのにあなたは気がついた。"

#. creates the merchant at the bar
#. Allow extra time for refuelling stops.
#. Made unique so double payment
#. Range of 5-10 tons for tier 0, 21-58 for tier 4.
msgid ""
"As you sit down, the merchant looks up at you with a panicked expression, "
"\"Ahh! What do you want? Can't you see I've enough on my plate as it is?\" "
"You tell the merchant to calm down and offer a drink. \"Jeez, that's nice of "
"you… Ha, maybe I can get a break today!\""
msgstr ""
"あなたが座ると、貿易商はろうばいした表情であなたを見あげた。｢あっ！　なんの用"
"ですか？　すでにやることはじゅうぶんにあるってわからないんですか？｣。あなたは"
"その貿易商に落ちつくようにいい、飲み物を頼んだ。｢おっと、親切な人ですね……。ハ"
"ハッ、たぶん今日は運がいいんでしょうね！｣"

msgid ""
"You grab a couple of drinks and hand one to the slightly more relaxed "
"looking merchant as they start to talk. \"So, I work for the Space Traders "
"Society. I transport stuff for them and they pay me. Only problem is, I "
"kinda strained my engines running from pirates on the way to the pick-up, "
"and now I'm realizing that my engines just don't have the speed to get me "
"back to beat the deadline. And to top it all off, I'm late on my bills as "
"is; I can't afford new engines now! It's like I'm in the Sol nebula without "
"a shield generator.\""
msgstr ""
"あなたが飲み物を二つつかみ、ひとつをわずかにくつろいだ表情になった貿易商に手"
"渡すと、貿易商は話を始めた。｢それで、わたしは宇宙貿易商協会のために働いている"
"んです。協会のためにものを運ぶと、協会が支払いをします。唯一の問題は、わたし"
"のエンジンは貨物を引き受ける途中で海賊から逃げたことで傷んだらしいということ"
"です。ちょっと速度が出なくて、納期に間にあうようには戻れないのがもうわかって"
"います。そしておまけに、今も請求書の支払いに遅れているんです。もう新しいエン"
"ジンを買う余裕なんてありませんよ！　まるでシールド生成器なしでソル星雲にいる"
"みたいなものです｣"

msgid ""
"You attempt to reassure the merchant by telling them that, surely, the "
"company will cut them some slack. \"Like hell they will! I've already been "
"scolded by management for this exact same thing before! If I don't get this "
"shipment of {tonnes} of {cargo} to {pnt}… I really need this job, you know? "
"I don't know what to do…\" The merchant pauses. \"Unless… Say, you wouldn't "
"be able to help me out here, would you? I'd just need you to take the cargo "
"to {pnt} in the {sys} system. Could you? I'll give you the payment for the "
"mission if you do it; it means a lot!\""
msgstr ""
"あなたは貿易商に、関係を切られるまでにはきっといくらか余裕を見てくれるといっ"
"て、安心させようと試みた。｢見てくれるわけないですよ！　すでに以前まったく同じ"
"ことで、仕事のやりかたについて小言をいわれてるんです！　もしこの{pnt}への "
"{tonnes}の{cargo}の輸送を取れなかったら……。わたしにはほんとうにこの仕事が必要"
"なんです。わかりますか？　どうしたらいいのかわたしにはわかりません……｣。貿易商"
"がすこし思案した。｢もしかして……いいですか、あなたならわたしを助けられるんじゃ"
"ないでしょうか？　貨物を{sys}星系の{pnt}まであなたに運んでもらえばいいだけで"
"す。できますか？　そうしてもらえれば、任務の支払いはあなたに受けとってもらい"
"ます。これは重要なことなんですよ！｣"

msgid "You don't have enough cargo space to accept this mission."
msgstr "この任務をうけられるほど船倉に空きがありません。"

msgid ""
"The goods have to arrive in {time_limit} but it will take {time} for your "
"ship to reach {pnt}. Accept the mission anyway?"
msgstr ""
"品物は {time_limit}以内に到着しなければならないが、あなたの船が{pnt}へ着くに"
"は {time}かかる。それでも任務を引き受けるか？"

msgid ""
"The merchant sighs in relief. \"Thank you so much for this. Just bring the "
"cargo to the cargo guy at {pnt}. They should pay you {credits} when you get "
"there. Don't be late, OK?\""
msgstr ""
"貿易商がほっとしてため息をついた。｢このことではほんとうに感謝しています。とに"
"かく{pnt}にいる貨物受取人に貨物を持っていってくれるだけでいいです。そこに着け"
"ば、その人が {credits} を支払ってくれるはずです。遅れないでください、いいです"
"ね？｣"

msgid ""
"You decided to help a fraught merchant by delivering some goods to {pnt}."
msgstr ""
"あなたはある品物を{pnt}まで届けて、悩んでいる貿易商を助けることに決めた。"

#. destination
#. adds cargo
#. 42STU per tick
#. OSD
msgid ""
"As you touch down at the spaceport you see the Traders Society depot "
"surrounded by a hustle and bustle. The cargo inspector looks at you with "
"surprise, and you explain to him what happened as the cargo is unloaded from "
"your ship. \"Wow, thanks for the help! You definitely saved us a ton of "
"grief. Here's your payment. Maybe I can buy you a drink some time!\" You "
"laugh and part ways."
msgstr ""
"宇宙港に着地するとき、あなたは押しあいへしあいをする人ごみで取りまかれた貿易"
"商協会の倉庫に気がついた。貨物の検査員があなたのことを驚きの表情で見たので、"
"貨物が船から荷降ろしされるあいだ、あなたはどういうことになったのか説明をす"
"る。｢ああ、手伝ってくれてありがとう！　あなたはたしかに大きな不幸からわれわれ"
"を救ってくれたよ。これがあなたの報酬だ。たぶんそのうちあなたに飲み物でもおご"
"ろうかな！｣。あなたは笑って、離れていった。"

msgid ""
"Landing at the spaceport you see the Traders Society depot surrounded by a "
"fraught hum of activity. The cargo inspector looks at you with surprise and "
"then anger, \"What the hell is this?! This shipment was supposed to be here "
"ages ago! We've been shifting stuff around to make up for it and then you "
"come waltzing in here… where the hell is the employee who was supposed to "
"deliver this stuff?\" A group of workers rushes along with you and the "
"inspector and you as you try to explain what happened. \"That fool has been "
"causing us all sorts of problems, and passing on the job to someone as "
"incompetent as you is the last straw! I swear!\""
msgstr ""
"宇宙港に着陸していると、あなたは空気に満ちるがやがやとした活動的な騒音で取り"
"まかれた貿易商協会の倉庫に気がついた。貨物の検査員があなたのことを驚きの表情"
"で見てから、怒りだした。｢これはいったいどういうことだ ?!　この貨物はずいぶん"
"昔にここにあることになっていたんだ！　われわれが埋めあわせるためにものを移し"
"かえおわったら、あんたがここへワルツを踊りながらやってきた……。こいつを届ける"
"ことになっていた雇い人はいったいどこにいるんだ？｣。労働者の一団があなたと検査"
"員のところへいそいで来るなか、あなたはどういうことになったのか説明しようとし"
"た。｢その間抜けはあらゆる種類の問題をひきおこしてきた。そのうえあんたのような"
"無能なやつに仕事をまわしたっていうのが、最後のとどめだ！　はっきりいってお"
"く！｣"

msgid ""
"You wait to one side as the cargo is hauled off your ship at breakneck speed "
"and wonder if you should have just dumped the stuff in space. Just as the "
"last of the cargo is taken off your ship, the inspector, who has clearly "
"cooled off a bit, comes up to you and says \"Look, I know you were trying to "
"do us a favour, but next time don't bother if you can't make it on time. I'm "
"glad you didn't just dump it all into space like some people have done, but "
"I can't pay you for this.\" He shakes his head and walks away. \"That pilot "
"is so fired…\""
msgstr ""
"あなたがかたわらで待つあいだ、貨物があなたの船から無謀な速度で引っぱりだされ"
"ていく。そしてあなたは、こいつは宇宙にただ投げ捨てるべきだったのだろうかと疑"
"問に思った。ちょうど最後の貨物があなたの船から取り除かれたとき、あきらかに穏"
"やかになったあの検査員があなたのところへやってきていった。｢なあ、あんたが好意"
"でやってくれようとしたことはわかってる。だが次回は時間どおりにできないなら面"
"倒をかけないでくれ。一部のやつらがやるように、いっさいを宇宙に捨てるだけって"
"ことをやらなかったのはうれしいよ。しかしこれには支払いはできない｣。検査員は首"
"を振って歩き去った。｢あのパイロットはほんとうに首だ……｣"

#. Negative affects locally, maybe not needed?
#. still in time
msgid ""
"Drop off the goods at {pnt} in the {sys} system (You have {time} remaining)"
msgstr "{sys}星系の{pnt}に品物を降ろせ。(まだ {time}残っている)"

#. missed deadline
msgid "Drop off the goods at {pnt} in the {sys} system (You are late)"
msgstr "{sys}星系の{pnt}に品物を降ろせ。(遅刻)"

msgid "Help the Merchant"
msgstr "貿易商を助けろ"

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Join Astra Vigilis">
#. <unique/>
#. <priority>4</priority>
#. <chance>50</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <cond>
#. if spob.cur():faction() ~= faction.get("Traders Society") and rnd.rnd() > 0.1 then
#. return false
#. end
#. local misn_test = require("misn_test")
#. return misn_test.generic() and misn_test.reweight_active()
#. </cond>
#. <tags>
#. <tag>trader_cap_medium</tag>
#. </tags>
#. </mission>
#. --
msgid "Join the Astra Vigilis"
msgstr ""

msgid "Astra Vigilis Recruiter"
msgstr ""

#. Must be claimable
msgid "You see a recruiter for the Astra Vigilis mercenary guild."
msgstr ""

msgid "{license} and {credits}"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You have been given a bounty to complete to join the Astra Vigilis mercenary "
"guild."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You approach the Astra Vigilis recruiter who has clearly left a seat in "
"front of them for you to sit down.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Why hello there pilot! You interested in carving a name in history for "
"yourself with the Astra Vigilis?\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Astra Vigilis?\""
msgstr ""

msgid "Ask for details."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"You must have heard of us. The Astra Vigilis is the largest mercenary "
"guild of the Space Trader's Society. We play an important role in keeping "
"peace and order. Our mere existence is enough to deter piracy and law-"
"breaking from happening in the first place!\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"They lean forward with a meticulously calculated gleam of excitement in "
"their eyes.\n"
"\"Not only is the pay great, but as you get a better reputation for a job "
"well done you'll get access to a lot of fancy new perks. However, the "
"adrenaline rush from bounty hunting itself is the largest reward of all!\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"If the Astra Vigilis is so good, why so many pirates then?\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Their face briefly seems to contort into an expression of frustration before "
"the recruiter training kicks into overdrive, and their face melds once again "
"into a friendly expression.\n"
"\"That's what we're looking to fix with a new hiring campaign, and you look "
"like exactly the type of pilot that can fix it!\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Their eyes bright in a way only recruiters can do.\n"
"\"Great! Now, joining the Astra Vigilis isn't as simple as just doing "
"paperwork or buying a mercenary license. You have to prove that you have the "
"prowess to take down bounties.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"It seems like there's just the thing for you. There's a pirate by the name "
"of {name} who is usually raiding around the {sys} system, and is flying a "
"{ship}. Cleaning them out would make you eligible for joining the Astra "
"Vigilis and partaking in much more challenging requests in the future. What "
"do you say? Are you ready to go guns blazing?\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Great! I've sent you the data. After you have dealt with {name}, please "
"report to any {fct} planet or station to finish the paperwork.\""
msgstr ""

msgid "Land at a {fct} station or planet"
msgstr ""

#. luacheck: globals spawn_pirate
#. As easy as possible
#. If we make it worn down, the player feels a big jump in difficulty with the "real bounties"
#. intrinsics  = { outfit.get("Worn Down") },
#. Should make them loiter forever
#. luacheck: globals land_done
msgid ""
"You land on {spb}, and make your way to register the bounty as completed, "
"and fill out the necessary paperwork to join the Astra Vigilis. After being "
"somewhat used to Imperial paperwork, you find the process to be much more "
"simple and straight forward. Bounty hunters don't like to put up with too "
"much bullshit, and you are grateful for that."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"With the paperwork over, you are promptly handed a {reward} that marks you "
"as a full fledged member of the Astra Vigilis. You will now have access to "
"bounty missions, and the Astra Vigilis terminal on {faction} stations and "
"planets that can customize your bounty hunting experience."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You passed a bounty hunting test by defeating the notorious pirate {pirname} "
"given to you by the Astra Vigilis, and obtained a {reward}. As a new member "
"of the Astra Vigilis, you can now access bounty missions."
msgstr ""

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Escort Pers">
#. <chance>0</chance>
#. <location>None</location>
#. </mission>
#. --
#. Escort a pers that hailed the player
msgid "Trader Escort"
msgstr ""

msgid "Escort a trader to {pnt} ({sys} system)"
msgstr ""

#. Begin the escort
#. luacheck: globals success
msgid "Escort Completed!"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You are profously thanked by the Captain of the {name}, who promptly gives "
"you a credstick loaded with {reward}."
msgstr ""

msgid "You escorted {name} to {spb} in the {sys} system for {reward}."
msgstr ""

#. luacheck: globals trader_create
#. Handle the convoy getting attacked.
#. luacheck: globals trader_attacked
#. Attackers have to be marked as hostile
#. Only spam so often
msgid "Trader under attack! Requesting immediate assistance!"
msgstr ""

#. Make it interesting
#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Mineral Request">
#. <unique/>
#. <priority>4</priority>
#. <chance>350</chance>
#. <location>Computer</location>
#. <cond>
#. if not player.misnDone("Mining Vrata Intro") then
#. return false
#. end
#. return require("misn_test").cargo()
#. </cond>
#. </mission>
#. --
msgid ""
"A local company has requested at least {amount} of {mineral} at {spob} "
"({sys} system)."
msgstr ""
"地元企業が{sys}星系の{spob}ですくなくとも {amount}の{mineral}を求めている。"

msgid ""
"The local government of {sys} is in need of at least {amount} of {mineral} "
"at {spob} ({sys} system)."
msgstr ""
"{sys}星系の地方政府が{sys}星系の{spob}ですくなくとも {amount}の{mineral}を必"
"要としている。"

msgid ""
"A new entrepreneur is in need of some {amount} of {mineral} for a new "
"prototype at {spob} ({sys} system)."
msgstr ""
"新規起業家が{sys}星系の{spob}でそれなりの量である {amount}の{mineral}を新しい"
"試作品のために必要としている。"

msgid ""
"An individual has made a request of {amount} of {mineral} at {spob} ({sys} "
"system)."
msgstr ""
"ある人が {amount}の{mineral}を{sys}星系の{spob}に届けるように依頼した。"

msgid ""
"An anonymous request has been made for {amount} of {mineral} to be delivered "
"at {spob} ({sys} system)."
msgstr ""
"匿名の依頼により、{amount}の{mineral}を{sys}星系の{spob}で引き渡してもらいた"
"い。"

msgid ""
"A local warehouse has requested a delivery of at least {amount} of {mineral} "
"at {spob} ({sys} system)."
msgstr ""
"地元倉庫がすくなくとも {amount}の{mineral}を{sys}星系の{spob}まで届けることを"
"依頼している。"

msgid "Mining Request of {mineral} to {dest}"
msgstr "{dest}での{mineral}の採掘依頼"

msgid "special"
msgstr "特殊"

#. First let us find a mining system
#. Next determine what we want delivered
#. Now to figure out where to send it
#. Should be a system _without_ the mineral
#. Compute the most efficient mining route
#. No route found, so abort
#. Figure out the reward
msgid ""
"{flavour}\n"
"\n"
"#nNecessary Mineral:#0 {mineral} ({rarity})\n"
"#nNecessary Amount:#0 at least {amount}"
msgstr ""
"{flavour}\n"
"\n"
"#n必要な鉱物 :#0 {mineral} ({rarity})\n"
"#n必要な量 :#0 {amount}以上"

msgid "{base} plus {extra} per tonne delivered"
msgstr "{base} と、届けた 1トンごとに追加で {extra}"

msgid "Mining Request"
msgstr "採掘依頼"

msgid "Mine at least {amount} of {mineral} (you have {have})."
msgstr "すくなくとも {amount}の{mineral}を採掘せよ。({have}持っている)"

msgid "Deliver to {spob} ({sys} system)."
msgstr "{sys}星系の{spob}に届けろ。"

msgid "Deliver {amount} of {mineral} and collect {reward}?"
msgstr "{amount}の{mineral}を届けて {reward} を受けとりますか？"

msgid "Deliver the goods."
msgstr "品物を届ける。"

msgid "Maybe later"
msgstr "たぶんあとで。"

msgid "You deliver the {amount} of {mineral} and collect {reward}."
msgstr "{amount}の{mineral}を届けて {reward} を受けとった。"

msgid ""
"You delivered {amount} of {mineral} to {spb} ({sys} system) and got paid "
"{reward}."
msgstr ""

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Mining Vrata Intro">
#. <unique/>
#. <priority>4</priority>
#. <chance>50</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <cond>
#. if spob.cur():faction() ~= faction.get("Traders Society") and rnd.rnd() > 0.1 then
#. return false
#. end
#. local misn_test = require("misn_test")
#. return misn_test.cargo(true) and misn_test.reweight_active()
#. </cond>
#. <tags>
#. <tag>trader_cap_medium</tag>
#. </tags>
#. </mission>
#. --
msgid "Help the Mining Vrata"
msgstr ""

#. amount needed
msgid "Mining Vrata Employee"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"There seems to be a Mining Vrata employee looking for pilots willing to work."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You have been asked to obtain {amount} of uncommon or rare minerals from "
"mining asteroid fields, and deliver them to a {faction} planet or station."
msgstr ""

#. Strike the earth is from dwarf fortress.
msgid ""
"\"Hey, the Mining Vrata is looking for more miners. You ready to do some "
"deep space mining and 'strike the earth'?"
msgstr ""

msgid "Mining Vrata?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"You haven't heard of one of the biggest guilds of the Space Trader's "
"Society? The Mining Vrata consists of all sort of individuals and companies "
"interested in deep space mining. We keep civilization ticking!\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"What do you say, are you interested in mining for the Mining Vrata?\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Great! Wait, one second, you do know how to mine right?\""
msgstr ""

msgid "Teach me."
msgstr ""

msgid "Leave it to me!"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Wanting to try new things, am I right? OK, so mining space asteroids is "
"fairly simple. It's a 3 step process. First you find the asteroids, then you "
"mine them! Wait, isn't that 2 steps?\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Anyway, first thing you have to do is find some asteroids. You can see "
"that on the map where a system will indicate whether it has asteroids or not "
"when selected. However, not all asteroid fields are equal. Some have only "
"common minerals, while other ones will have uncommon, and the best will have "
"rare minerals!\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"In general, #basteroid fields that are harder to get to will have more "
"rare minerals#0! You know, if it's easy to get to, it'll likely be depleted "
"by miner trainees and the likes. So you've got to get a bit away from "
"civilization to find the real good stuff. You'll need to get an #basteroid "
"scanner#0 if you want to see what each individual asteroid contains.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Next step is the fun part, blowing it up. Of course, you can use any "
"weapon, but that doesn't get you the best minerals out of an asteroid. To "
"get uncommon minerals, you'll need #bmining lances#0, but for rare minerals, "
"#bmining drills#0 is the best to get them out safely. Mining drills also "
"come with built-in asteroid scanners, so they are a great solution for "
"mining. Then it's just a question of collecting the materials.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"You can always find more detailed information in the holo-archives. Was "
"that clear?\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Yup.\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Once more.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"OK! I'll mark down your info into the Mining Vrata database. Whenever you "
"mine {amount} of uncommon or rare minerals, just deliver them to the nearest "
"{faction} planet or station. They will be marked on your map. Will to drill!"
"\""
msgstr ""

msgid "Mine at least {amount} of an uncommon or rare mineral"
msgstr ""

msgid "Deliver the cargo to a {faction} planet or station"
msgstr ""

#. elseif t.special then
#. v.t = "#r".._("special").."#0"
#. Handles updating the OSD goal
msgid ""
"Do you want to hand in {amount} of uncommon or rare ores to the Mining Vrata?"
msgstr ""

msgid "Not yet."
msgstr ""

msgid "Hand in {name} ({type}, you have {amount})"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You hand in the {amount} of {cargo} to the Mining Vrata who take it for "
"processing."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You are waiting for your reward when suddenly a big figure burst out of the "
"Mining Vrata HQ."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Ho ho! Hey, you must be {player}. My name's Steve, and I'm in charge of "
"the Mining Vrata right now.\"\n"
"He beams you a smile.\n"
"\"I try my best to meet all new members! Got to keep the place lively!\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Member?\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Wait, what? You weren't told this delivery was the initiation rite for the "
"Mining Vrata? Well, what's done is done. You're now a member, but don't "
"worry, there are no fees or anything. Rather, this opens up more "
"opportunities for you with the Space Trader's Society!\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"With that, you're now a proper member of the Mining Vrata. Don't worry "
"though, there are no fees or anything. Rather, this opens up more "
"opportunities for you with the Space Trader's Society!\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Oh yeah, here, let me get you with a reward hooked up for the minerals you "
"brought in. We take pride in rewarding our members.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"{msg}\n"
"They take a quick look at their notes.\n"
"\"Wait, you brought in {cargo}? That's quite rare. Let me increase your "
"reward.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Wait, I've got a better idea.\"\n"
"He puts both his hands in his mouth and lets out a resounding whistle. An "
"employee pops out the back to take a look, and Steve gives them a nod, "
"before they go back."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"That settles it, we've been working on a prototype Fuel Recycler, it's "
"able to convert materials into fuel out in space. Give it a spin and you can "
"tell us what you think about it. We're hoping to make these standard for all "
"Mining Vrata members.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"That reminds me, I almost forgot. As a member, you'll have access to "
"mining requests from mission bulletins. They're a good way to make mining "
"more lucrative, benefit society, and the Mining Vrata. Keep your eye out for "
"such requests when you yearn to mine.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Also, at the Mining Vrata we are looking for new resources and types of "
"asteroid. If you ever find anything like that while mining, make sure to "
"bring some over to any Trader's Society location! Will to drill!\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"With the Mining Vrata's 'Will to Drill' motto echoing throughout the Mining "
"Vrata HQ, Steve turns heels and stomps away."
msgstr ""

#. Player didn't hand anything in
msgid ""
"You delivered {amount} of {cargo} as an initiation test at the Mining Vrata, "
"and were given a {reward} for your troubles. As a member of the Mining "
"Vrata, you can now access Mining Request missions."
msgstr ""

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Mining Vrata Moss">
#. <unique/>
#. <priority>4</priority>
#. <chance>5</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <cond>
#. local misn_test = require("misn_test")
#. local scur = spob.cur()
#. return player.evtDone("Mining Vrata Delivered Space Moss") and scur ~= spob.get("Mining Vrata Guildhouse") and scur:faction():tags().generic and misn_test.cargo(true) and misn_test.reweight_active()
#. </cond>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. After the player brings Space Moss to Steve, he hands it to some scientists for
#. experimentation. They manage to mutate an ever-growing variety of it and want it
#. delivered to a Soromid lab for further research.
#.
#. Player has to jettison some of the moss away every once in a while, or they explode.
#.
#. Meant to be a one-off gag mission, but of course there's nothing stopping the creation
#. of an extensive "Mining Vrata Moss" campaign if someone wants to run with it.
#.
#. - Zivi (hsza)
#. --
msgid "Mossy Mess"
msgstr ""

msgid "Researcher"
msgstr ""

msgid "Mutated Moss"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A clump of genetically engineered moss that keeps growing out of control."
msgstr ""

msgid "A Mining Vrata researcher is pacing around anxiously."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Deliver an ever-growing clump of mutated space moss to {dspb} ({dsys} "
"system)."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Hello there! Are you the one that handed in the sample of space moss from "
"Fertile Crescent? We at the Mining Vrata have been analysing it and "
"performing some experiments, and in a stroke of genius, we've been able to "
"create a mutation that lets it grow very rapidly at practically no expense, "
"so we don't have to ask anyone to go all the way to bring extra samples!\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Overlooking the fact it grew enough to nearly destroy one of our labs "
"after being left to its own devices for a few periods, this is quite "
"fascinating, and we're certain it could be used as a cheap source of feed "
"for some livestock as well as Soromid bioships.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Now we're ready to hand the research over to a dedicated lab over on "
"{dspb}, and I'm on the search for a suitable courier. Before you respond, a "
"warning: there's no way to stop the moss from growing outside of controlled "
"environments, so you might need to dump some of it every now and again as "
"you fly to {dsys} just in case. If you decide to help, {rwd} will be your "
"reward. What do you say?\""
msgstr ""

msgid "You decide not to get further involved in this for now."
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Oh, thanks! The moss will be waiting for you at {pspb} in {psys}.\""
msgstr ""

msgid "Pick up the moss at {pspb} ({psys} system)"
msgstr ""

msgid "Carefully deliver the moss to {dspb} ({dsys} system)"
msgstr ""

msgid "You don't have enough cargo space for the moss."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You have dangerously little cargo space available. Your ship will explode if "
"the moss overflows. Are you sure you're ready to start the delivery?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A bundle of the mutated moss is quickly loaded onto your ship. You can see "
"it expanding already."
msgstr ""

#. We do not use misn.cargoAdd as the gimmick here is the player has to jettison it partially a few times
msgid ""
"As you approach {dspb}, you're directed to an incineration pit and told to "
"dump any excess moss inside. Upon landing, a team of Soromid researchers "
"takes what remains to their facility, while your cargo holds are "
"meticulously scrubbed clean of any remains of the bothersome green gunk. "
"Finally, you're rid of the moss, and hopefully for good."
msgstr ""

#. Why does it not default to removing all?
msgid ""
"You helped deliver a sample of mutated space moss that kept growing inside "
"your cargo hold to {dspb} for further research."
msgstr ""

msgid "Uh oh"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Suddenly, a loud creaking noise comes from your cargo holds. That creak was "
"your ship's hull giving way to the growing moss. As critical systems fail "
"and life support goes out, you feel a hint of amusement at just how dumb of "
"an end this is."
msgstr ""

#. Otherwise ZD-15 Guardian Unit breaks this
msgid "Your cargo holds are overfilled with moss."
msgstr ""

msgid "The growing moss is making your hull creak dangerously."
msgstr ""

msgid "The moss is putting uncomfortable pressure on your ship's internals."
msgstr ""

msgid "Your ship's hull is starting to give way to the moss."
msgstr ""

#. high on moss
#. tasty moss!!! more biting!!!
msgid "Mission failure"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You have jettisoned all of the moss out of your ship. You have nothing to "
"deliver anymore."
msgstr ""

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Trader Escort">
#. <priority>5</priority>
#. <cond>
#. local fct = spob.cur():faction()
#. if not fct then return false end
#. local t = fct:tags()
#. if not (t.generic or t.misn_escort) then return false end
#. return require("misn_test").mercenary()
#. </cond>
#. <chance>560</chance>
#. <location>Computer</location>
#. <notes>
#. <tier>3</tier>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#. Escort a convoy of traders to a destination--
msgid "Escort a {adj} convoy to {pnt} in {sys}"
msgstr ""

msgid "tiny"
msgstr ""

msgid "small"
msgstr "小"

msgid "medium"
msgstr "中"

msgid "large"
msgstr "大"

msgid "huge"
msgstr ""

#. Try to cache the route to make it so that the same route doesn't appear over and over
#. Regenerate
#. This mission does not make any system claims
#. have to escort them at least one jump!
#. needs to be a little bit of piracy possible along route
#. Have to be able to do an inclusive claim
#. Mark system
#. Choose mission reward.
#. Reward depends on type of cargo hauled. Hauling expensive commodities gives a better deal.
msgid ""
"A convoy of traders needs protection while they go to {pnt} ({sys} system). "
"You must stick with the convoy at all times, waiting to jump or land until "
"the entire convoy has done so. You may only escort one group of traders at a "
"time."
msgstr ""
"商船団が、{sys}星系の{pnt}へ行くあいだの護衛を必要としている。あなたはずっと"
"その船団にくっついていなければならない。ジャンプや着陸は、船団すべてがそれを"
"終えるまで待つのだ。一度にひとつの商船団だけを護衛できる。"

msgid "Hands Full"
msgstr "手いっぱい"

msgid "You may only escort one group of traders at a time!"
msgstr "一度に護衛できるのはひとつの商船団だけです！"

msgid "Not enough fuel"
msgstr "燃料が足りない"

msgid ""
"The destination is {1} away, but you only have enough fuel for {2}. You "
"cannot stop to refuel. Accept the mission anyway?"
msgstr ""
"目的地は{1}ぶん離れていますが、あなたには{2}ぶんの燃料しかありません。燃料補"
"給のために停止することはできません。それでもこの任務を引き受けますか？"

msgid "Convoy Escort"
msgstr "船団の護衛"

msgid "Escort a convoy of traders to {pnt} ({sys} system)"
msgstr "商船団を{sys}星系の{pnt}まで護衛せよ。"

#. Choose convoy
#. Begin the escort
#. luacheck: globals success
msgid "Success!"
msgstr "成功！"

msgid ""
"You successfully escorted the trading convoy to the destination. There "
"wasn't a single casualty, and you are rewarded the full amount of {credits}."
msgstr ""
"あなたは商船団を目的地まで護衛するのに成功した。一隻も犠牲を出さなかったの"
"で、あなたは {credits} の報酬を全額もらった。"

msgid "All the traders survived."
msgstr ""

msgid "Success with Casualties"
msgstr "成功だったが犠牲あり"

msgid ""
"You've arrived with the trading convoy more or less intact. Your pay is "
"docked slightly due to the loss of part of the convoy. You receive {credits} "
"of the original promised reward of {reward}."
msgstr ""
"あなたはほぼ完全な商船団とともに到着した。あなたの報酬は、失われた船団のぶん"
"だけわずかに差し引かれた。あなたはもともと約束されていた報酬 {reward} のうち"
"の {credits} を受けとった。"

msgid "The traders suffered some casualties."
msgstr ""

msgid "Success with Heavy Casualties"
msgstr "成功だったが大きな犠牲あり"

msgid ""
"You arrive with what's left of the convoy. It's not much, but it's better "
"than nothing. You are paid a steeply discounted amount of {credits} from the "
"{reward} originally promised."
msgstr ""
"あなたは残った商船団とともに到着した。あまり多くはなかったが、なにもないより"
"はましだ。あなたはもともとの約束である {reward} から、ひどく割り引かれた金額"
"である {credits} を支払われた。"

msgid "The traders suffered heavy casualties."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You escorted a {adj} convoy of traders to {spb} in the {sys} system for "
"{reward}. {msg}"
msgstr ""

#. luacheck: globals trader_create
msgid "Convoy "
msgstr "護送船団"

#. local unsafe = false
#. Handle the convoy getting attacked.
#. luacheck: globals trader_attacked
#. Attackers have to be marked as hostile
#. Only spam so often
msgid "Convoy ships under attack! Requesting immediate assistance!"
msgstr "船団の船が攻撃をうけている！　即時の支援を求める！"

#. Make it interesting
#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Trader Rehabilitation">
#. <priority>10</priority>
#. <cond>faction.reputationGlobal("Traders Society") &lt; 0</cond>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. <location>Computer</location>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. Rehabilitation Mission
#. --
#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Helping Nelly Out 1">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>1</priority>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. <cond>require("common.pirate").systemPresence() &lt;= 0 and not player.misnActive("Tutorial")</cond>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <faction>Dvaered</faction>
#. <faction>Empire</faction>
#. <faction>Frontier</faction>
#. <faction>Goddard</faction>
#. <faction>Independent</faction>
#. <faction>Sirius</faction>
#. <faction>Soromid</faction>
#. <faction>Za'lek</faction>
#. <chapter>[01]</chapter>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Tutorial Nelly</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. Nelly Tutorial Campaign
#.
#. Basically similar to what EV:Nova has with Barry, except for Naev.
#.
#. First mission is designed to teach about:
#. 1. Information Window
#. 2. Delivery Missions
#. 3. Outfitter
#. 4. Equipping outfits
#. 5. Boarding
#. 6. Mission computer
#.
#. Mission Details:
#. 0. Explanation about information window
#. 1. Go to nearby system to deliver cargo
#. 2. Told to buy and equip an Ion Cannon (don't enforce it, but complain if player doesn't get it)
#. 3. Fly back to original planet
#. 4. Find and board derelict on the way there
#. 5. Land on planet and mission over
#. --
#.
#. Mission States:
#. 0: accepted and heading to mem.destpnt
#. 1: Told about info window
#. 2: Cargo delivered and head back to mem.retpnt
#. 3: Ship boarded
#. --
#. Non-persistent state
#. Constants
#. If changed, references to ion cannons/damage below should too.
#. Save current system to return to
#. Need commodity exchange and mission computer
#. Find destination system that sells ion cannons
#. No pirates
#. Sells Outfits
#. Sells a particular outfit
msgid "You see a young individual sitting alone at a table."
msgstr "若者がひとりでテーブルについているのが見えた。"

#. Check to see if truly accepted
#. Update objectives
msgid "Helping Nelly Out"
msgstr "ネリーを助ける"

msgid ""
"Help Nelly deliver {tonnes} of {cargo} to {destpnt} in the {destsys} system."
msgstr ""
"{tonnes}の{cargo}を{destsys}星系の{destpnt}へ運ぼうとしているネリーを助けろ。"

msgid ""
"Nelly lightens up when you near her.\n"
"\"Hello again! I'm in a bit of a mess. You see, I was supposed to deliver "
"some {cargo} to {pnt} in the {sys} system, but my ship broke down, and I "
"don't think I'll be able to deliver it any time soon. Would you be willing "
"to help me take the cargo there and come back? I'll pay you your fair share."
"\""
msgstr ""
"あなたが近づくと、ネリーが顔を輝かせた。\n"
"　｢こんにちは！　ちょっと面倒なことになってて。じつは、{sys}星系の{pnt}へ"
"{cargo}をいくらか運ぶことになってたんだけど、船が壊れてすぐに運べるようになる"
"とは思えないの。そこへ貨物を運んで戻ってくるのに手を貸してくれない？　正当な"
"取りぶんは支払うから｣"

msgid ""
"The lone individual lightens up when you near her.\n"
"\"Say, you look like a pilot with a working ship. I'm in a bit of a mess. "
"You see, I was supposed to deliver some {cargo} to {pnt} in the {sys} "
"system, but my ship broke down, and I don't think I'll be able to deliver it "
"any time soon. Would you be willing to help me take the cargo there and come "
"back? I'll pay you your fair share.\""
msgstr ""
"あなたが近づくと、ひとりでいた人物が顔を輝かせた。\n"
"　｢あー、あなたは動かせる船をもってるパイロットみたい。ちょっと面倒なことに"
"なってて。じつは、{sys}星系の{pnt}へ{cargo}をいくらか運ぶことになってたんだけ"
"ど、船が壊れてすぐに運べるようになるとは思えないの。そこへ貨物を運んで戻って"
"くるのに手を貸してくれませんか？　正当な取りぶんは支払います｣"

msgid ""
"They look dejected.\n"
"\"That's a shame. If you change your mind I'll be waiting here.\""
msgstr ""
"落胆させてしまったようだ。\n"
"　｢残念。もし考えが変わったら、ここにいるので｣"

msgid ""
"\"You don't have enough free space to help me out. You'll need to carry "
"{amount} of {cargo}. Please make free space by either selling unwanted "
"cargo, or getting rid of it from the info menu which you can open with "
"{infokey}.\""
msgstr ""
"｢手を貸せるだけの空きがないわね。{amount}の{cargo}を運ぶ必要があるの。空きを"
"作るために不要な貨物を売るか、{infokey} で開ける情報メニューを使って処分して"
"もらえないかな？｣"

msgid ""
"\"Great! I'll have the dockworkers load up your ship, and we can be off. "
"This should be a piece of cake.\""
msgstr ""
"｢やった！　港湾労働者にいってあなたの船に積ませるから、終わったら出発できる。"
"この仕事は簡単なはずよ｣"

msgid ""
"\"Great! My name is Nelly. Glad to make your acquaintance. I'll have the "
"dockworkers load up your ship, and we can be off. This should be a piece of "
"cake.\"\n"
"   They cock their head a bit at you.\n"
"   \"Say, you wouldn't happen to be a novice pilot?\""
msgstr ""
"｢やった！　わたしの名前はネリー。知りあえてうれしいです。港湾労働者にいってあ"
"なたの船に積ませるから、終わったら出発できます。この仕事は簡単なはずよ｣\n"
"　ネリーはちょっと見あげてあなたを見た。\n"
"　｢ちょっと、あなたは新人パイロットだったりする？｣"

msgid ""
"\"I knew it! You seem to have a nice fresh aura around you. Reminds me of "
"back in the day when I was starting out. Starting out can be a bit tricky, "
"so I hope you don't mind if I give you some advice on the road.\"\n"
"   \"For starters, if you haven't already, you should buy a #oLocal Map#0 "
"that will help you get the directions to {sys}. You can buy it at the main "
"landing window or the outfitting window. Anyway, Let's get going!\""
msgstr ""
"｢そうだと思った！　あなたにはういういしく楽しそうな雰囲気があるようだったか"
"ら。始めたころの日々を思いだすわね。最初のころはちょっとやりにくいことがある"
"かもしれないから、道中でいくらか助言をしても気にしないで。\n"
"　｢手始めに、まだしてないなら#o系内地図#0を買うべきよ。それが{sys}の方向を知"
"る助けになるの。着陸メイン画面か艤装品画面で買えるから。とにかく行ってみま"
"しょう！｣"

msgid ""
"\"Weird. I could have sworn you had some sort of new pilot aura around you. "
"Must have been my imagination. Let's get going!\""
msgstr ""
"｢妙ね。あなたには新人パイロットみたいな雰囲気があると誓っていたところだけど。"
"わたしの想像の産物ってことね。じゃあ行きましょうか｣"

msgid "Deliver cargo to {pnt} in {sys}"
msgstr "{sys}星系の{pnt}に貨物を運べ。"

msgid "Return to {pnt} in {sys}"
msgstr "{sys}星系の{pnt}に戻れ。"

#. Delivered Cargo
msgid ""
"You land on {pnt} and the dockworkers offload your cargo. This delivery "
"stuff is quite easy."
msgstr ""
"あなたが{pnt}に着陸すると、港湾労働者が積み荷を降ろした。この配達物はかなり簡"
"単だ。"

msgid ""
"\"Say, I heard this place sells #oIon Cannons#0. If you want to be able to "
"take down ships non-lethally, #oion damage#0 is your best bet. Here, I'll "
"forward you {credits}. Do you need help buying and equipping the outfit?\""
msgstr ""
"｢ちょっと、ここで#oイオンキャノン#0が売られてるって聞いたの。もし非致死的な方"
"法で船を停止させられるようにしたいと思ってるなら、#oイオンによる損害#0がいち"
"ばん確実よ。ここで {credits} 先払いしとく。艤装品を買って装備するのに手助けが"
"必要？｣"

msgid "Get useful advice"
msgstr "有益な助言をしてもらう"

msgid "Buy the outfit alone"
msgstr "ひとりで艤装品を買う"

msgid ""
"\"OK! Taking the initiative I see. Go buy the {outfit} at the #oOutfits "
"Tab#0 and make sure to equip it at the #oEquipment Tab#0 before taking off. "
"Once you get that done, let's head back to {pnt} in {sys}.\""
msgstr ""
"｢わかった！　率先してやるってことね。離陸するまえに#o艤装品#0タブへ行って"
"{outfit}を買い、#o装備#0タブへ行ってそれを装備して。それができたら、{sys}星系"
"の{pnt}へ向かいましょう｣"

msgid ""
"\"OK! I'll guide you through it. For now, please go to the #oOutfits Tab#0 "
"of the landing window.\""
msgstr ""
"｢わかった！　案内するから。さしあたり、着陸ウィンドウの#o艤装品#0タブへ行っ"
"て｣"

#. Get rid of cargo
#. Hook the outfits
#. Finished mission
msgid "\"We made it! A job well done. Here let me pay you what I promised you."
msgstr "｢やった！　うまくやれた。はい、これが約束の支払いよ｣"

#. Rewards
msgid ""
"\"Now time to get back to my ship. I hope it's repaired already. If you want "
"to do more cargo missions to make some easy credits, I recommend you to look "
"at the mission computer, which should be available on most planets like "
"here. Sometimes you will also meet interesting characters at the spaceport "
"bar who will offer you interesting missions.\"\n"
"They beam you a grin.\n"
"\"Anyway, see you around! Make sure to check the spaceport bar whenever you "
"land for new missions!\""
msgstr ""
"｢もう自分の船に戻る潮時ね。もう修理されてるといいんだけど。もっと貨物輸送任務"
"をして簡単にクレジットを作りたかったら、ミッションコンピューターを見てみるこ"
"とを勧めとく。ここみたいにたいていの惑星で使えるはずだから。ときどき宇宙港の"
"バーで興味をひかれるような人たちと会うこともあって、その人たちはあなたにおも"
"しろい任務を提供してくれるはずよ｣\n"
"　ネリーが歯を見せてにこっと笑った。\n"
"　｢それはともかく、またどこかで会いましょう！　新しい任務を得るために着陸した"
"ら、いつでもかならず宇宙港のバーを確認してね！｣"

msgid ""
"\"Oh, and don't forget to sell the ore you got from the derelict at the "
"commodity exchange!\""
msgstr ""
"｢おっと。それから遺棄船で手に入れた鉱石を商品取引所で売るのを忘れないで！｣"

msgid "You helped Nelly complete a delivery mission."
msgstr "ネリーを助けて配達任務を完了させた。"

msgid ""
"After the dockworkers load the cargo on your ship, you take off with Nelly "
"aboard. On to {sys}!"
msgstr ""
"港湾労働者があなたの船に貨物を積みこむと、あなたは乗船したネリーを乗せて離陸"
"した。いざ、{sys}へ！"

msgid ""
"Just after taking off Nelly pipes up.\n"
"\"Say, are you familiar with the information window? It shows all the "
"important things about your ship and current missions.\""
msgstr ""
"離陸した直後にネリーがかん高い声で急にしゃべりはじめた。\n"
"　｢ちょっと、情報ウィンドウには慣れてないの？　船と現在の任務について重要なこ"
"とはぜんぶ見せてくれるんだけど｣"

msgid "Hear about the Info window"
msgstr "情報ウィンドウについて聞く"

msgid "Already know"
msgstr "すでに知っている"

msgid "\"OK, great! Then let's get going!\""
msgstr "｢それはよかった！　じゃあ行きましょうか！｣"

msgid ""
"\"The information window, which you can open with {infokey}, is critical to "
"managing your ship and finding out where to go. Try opening the info menu "
"with {infokey} and I will show you around it.\""
msgstr ""
"｢{infokey} で開ける情報ウィンドウは、船を管理して行く場所を見つけるのに重要な"
"ものなの。{infokey} で情報メニューを開いてみて。その中身を説明するから｣"

#. Much more visible
msgid "After you enter the system, Nelly points something out on the radar."
msgstr "星系に入ると、ネリーがレーダー上のなにかをさし示した。"

#. TODO autoboard!
msgid ""
"\"Oooh, look at that. A Koala derelict is nearby. There might be something "
"interesting on it! We should go board it. Try #odouble-click#0ing or "
"selecting the derelict and pressing {boardkey}. It should enable your "
"autonav system to board the ship. You can toggle the overlay to see exactly "
"where the ship is with {overlaykey}.\""
msgstr ""
"｢おー、あれを見て。コアラの遺棄船が近くにある。興味深いものがあるかもしれない"
"わね！　行って移乗してみるべきよ。遺棄船を#oダブルクリック#0するか、それを選"
"択して {boardkey} を押してみて。それで自動操縦システムが有効になって船に移乗"
"できるはずよ。{overlaykey} でオーバーレイに切り替えれば、船の場所は正確にわか"
"るから｣"

#. TODO maybe explain better boarding window when done
msgid ""
"You enter the derelict ship which is eerily silent. A large hole in the "
"engine room indicates that likely the core engine blew out, forcing the ship "
"crew to abandon ship. Although you don't find anything of significant value, "
"there is still lots of ore cargo available on the ship. You quickly load as "
"much as you can onto your ship before you depart."
msgstr ""
"あなたは不気味に静まる遺棄船に乗りこんだ。エンジン室の大きな穴は、中核エンジ"
"ンが吹き飛んだらしいことを示している。それで乗員たちは船を放棄せざるをえなく"
"なったのだ。かなりの価値があるものはなにも見つからなかったが、まだ船には使え"
"る鉱石の貨物がたくさんあった。あなたはいそいでできるだけたくさんの鉱石を自分"
"の船に積みこむと、そこから出発した。"

msgid ""
"\"Looks like your scored a lot of ore there. That should bring you a pretty "
"penny at a planet with commodity exchange. Boarding derelicts is not always "
"as easy as this and sometimes bad things can happen. We should head to {pnt} "
"that should be nearby now.\""
msgstr ""
"｢あそこでたくさんの鉱石を手に入れたらしいね。惑星の商品取引所でかなりのお金に"
"なるはずよ。遺棄船に乗りこむのは、いつも今回のように簡単なわけじゃなくて、と"
"きどき悪いことがおきる場合もあるからね。もう{pnt}へ向かうべきよ。もう近くのは"
"ずだから｣"

msgid "Nelly: \"Try opening the info menu with {infokey}.\""
msgstr "ネリー : ｢{infokey} で情報メニューを開いてみて｣"

msgid ""
"\"Ah, the info menu in all its glory. In the main window, you can see "
"overall statistics of your gameplay and licence information. Try to navigate "
"to the #oMissions#0 tab. Feel free to click the other tabs for more "
"information.\""
msgstr ""
"｢ああ、最高に壮麗な情報メニュー。メインウィンドウの中では、プレイしたゲームの"
"全体的な統計値とライセンス情報が見られるようになってるの。#o任務#0タブに移動"
"してみて。ほかのタブをクリックして、さらなる情報を見るのも自由にやっていいか"
"ら｣"

#. TODO not sure we need more message annoyances here
msgid ""
"\"The #oShip Info#0 tab contains information relevant to your ship including "
"all active bonuses and equipped outfits.\""
msgstr ""
"｢#o船#0情報タブには、あなたの船に関係する情報が含まれる。たとえば、有効な割増"
"値、装備している艤装品などよ｣"

msgid ""
"\"At the #oWeapon Info#0, you can modify the current ship's weapon sets, "
"including your ships primary and secondary weapons. Weapon sets will be "
"normally automatically handled by your ship, but you can always configure "
"them to whatever liking your want! If you want full details, you can click "
"on the #bHelp#0 button for all the information about it. It always makes me "
"head dizzy though, so I just keep the defaults and mash the weapon controls. "
"It works great!\""
msgstr ""
"｢#o武器#0情報で、現在の船の武器セットが変更できる。これには主要武器と副次武器"
"も含まれる。ふつう武器セットは船が自動的に設定するようになっているけど、いつ"
"でも自分が望むとおりに設定できるの！　細かいことをぜんぶ知りたければ、#bヘル"
"プ#0ボタンをクリックすれば情報がみんな見られるから。わたしはいつも頭が混乱し"
"てくるけどね。だからデフォルトにして武器の制御装置を連打するだけにしてる。と"
"てもうまくいってるよ！｣"

msgid ""
"\"Here, at the #oCargo Info#0, you can see the cargo you are carrying. This "
"includes important information like legal status. Furthermore, you can "
"#ojettison#0 cargo you want to get rid of. Be careful though: jettisoning "
"mission cargo will forfeit the mission.\""
msgstr ""
"｢この#o積み荷#0情報では、運んでいる積み荷を見ることができる。これには法律上の"
"状態のような、重要な情報も含まれるの。そのうえ、処分したいときには積み荷を#o"
"投棄#0することもできる。もちろん、注意はしてよ。任務の積み荷を投棄すると、任"
"務を取りあげられるから｣"

msgid ""
"\"The #oMission Info#0 shows you information of all currently accepted "
"missions. Selecting each mission will centre the map on mission markers if "
"available. Clicking on systems here also allows you to set routes directly. "
"Make sure this mission is selected and try setting a route to {destsys} is "
"marked on your map.\""
msgstr ""
"｢#o任務#0情報は、現在ひきうけているすべての任務の情報を見せてくれる。それぞれ"
"の任務を選択すると、任務の標識があればそれが中央に来るように地図が移動するか"
"ら。そこの星系をクリックすると、じかに航路を設定することもできる。この任務を"
"選択して、{destsys}への航路の設定が地図に記録されるようにしてみて｣"

#. Clear it right away if the player closes the window
msgid ""
"\"Good! Now we are all set to head to our target system. You can click on "
"other tabs in the Info window to get more explanations. When you are done, "
"close the info window and let us head to our goal!\""
msgstr ""
"｢うまい！　もう目標の星系へ向かう準備がすべてできた。情報ウィンドウのほかのタ"
"ブをクリックして、もっと説明をうけることもできるけど。終わりにするなら、情報"
"ウィンドウを閉じて、目的地へ向かいましょう！｣"

msgid ""
"\"The #oStanding Info#0 informs you at your current standing with the "
"different known factions in the universe. Not everyone is as friendly as me "
"out there!\""
msgstr ""
"｢#o立場#0情報は、宇宙にあるいろいろな既知の党派にたいする、あなたの現在の立場"
"を通知するものよ。宇宙にいるのはわたしみたいに好意的な人たちばかりじゃないか"
"らね！｣"

msgid ""
"\"The #oShiplog#0 is a good way to review missions and tasks you have "
"completed. I sometimes forget exactly what I did and who I should check up "
"on and it comes really in handy. You can also keep a diary and add custom "
"entries to keep track of what you have done or are doing.\""
msgstr ""
"｢#o航海日誌#0は完了した任務や仕事を見なおす方法としてはいいものよ。わたしはと"
"きどき、自分が正確にはなにをしたのか、そしてだれに問いあわせるべきなのかを忘"
"れちゃうから、これがほんとうに役に立つことになるの。そのうえ日記を書いたり、"
"独自の項目を追加して自分がしたことやしていることを記録しておくこともできる｣"

msgid ""
"\"Here you can see all the outfits available for sale at this planet. Look "
"for the #o{outfit}#0 and either #oright-click on it#0 or click on it and "
"click the buy button to buy it.\""
msgstr ""
"｢ここでは、この惑星で売っているすべての艤装品が見られる。#o{outfit}#0をさがし"
"て、#oその上で右クリック#0するか、クリックしてから買うボタンをクリックすれば"
"買えるから｣"

msgid ""
"\"You bought a #o{bought}#0 instead of #o{tobuy}#0! Don't worry, you can "
"sell most outfits back for the price you bought them at. Please try to buy a "
"#o{tobuy}#0. It should come in handy later.\""
msgstr ""
"｢#o{tobuy}#0のかわりに#o{bought}#0を買ったんだ！　心配しなくていいよ。ほとん"
"どの艤装品は買った値段で売ることができるから。お願いだから、#o{tobuy}#0を買う"
"ようにしてみてね。あとで役に立つときがくるはずだから｣"

msgid ""
"\"Great! You bought the #o{bought}#0. Outfits don't get equipped right away. "
"To be able to use it, please navigate to the #oEquipment Tab#0 of the "
"landing window.\""
msgstr ""
"｢やった！　#o{bought}#0を手に入れた。でも艤装品はすぐには装備されないの。使え"
"るようにするには、着陸ウィンドウの#o装備#0タブへ行って｣"

msgid ""
"\"The #oEquipment Tab#0 allows handling your ships and their equipment. You "
"can have more than one ship and switch between them freely. Try to equip the "
"#o{outfit}#0 in a weapon slot by first clicking on the outfit and then right-"
"clicking on the slot you want to equip it at. If you have free slots you can "
"also right-click on an outfit to have it directly be assigned to the "
"smallest free slot it fits into. Try to equip the #o{outfit}#0 now.\""
msgstr ""
"｢#o装備#0タブでは、自分の船や機器をいじくれる。船は 2 隻以上もつことができ"
"て、自由に乗り換えることができるの。試しに武器スロットに#o{outfit}#0を装備し"
"てみて。最初に艤装品をクリックしてから、装備したい場所のスロットを右クリック"
"する。もし空いているスロットがあるなら、艤装品を右クリックすることで、それが"
"収まる最小の空きスロットに直接割りあてることもできる。さあ、#o{outfit}#0を装"
"備してみて｣"

msgid ""
"\"Great! Now you have the #o{outfit}#0 equipped. Looks like your ship is set "
"to automatically handle weapons, so it should be assigned to a primary "
"weapon. You can always change this from the #oInfo Window#0 you can open "
"with {infokey}. Let us go back to {pnt} in {sys}.\""
msgstr ""
"｢できた！　もう#o{outfit}#0が装備された。あなたの船は自動的に武器を取り扱うよ"
"うに設定されているみたい。だから主要兵器に割りあたっているはず。これは "
"{infokey} で開ける#o情報#0ウィンドウでいつでも変えられるから。じゃあ{sys}星系"
"の{pnt}に戻りましょう｣"

msgid ""
"\"Great! Now you have the #o{outfit}#0 equipped. Looks like your ship is not "
"set to automatically handle weapons. You might have to assign the #o{outfit}"
"#0 to a weapon set, so you can use it. You can check by opening the #oInfo "
"Window#0 with {infokey}. Check to make sure that is set up and let us go "
"back to {pnt} in {sys}.\""
msgstr ""
"｢できた！　もう#o{outfit}#0が装備された。あなたの船は自動的に武器を取り扱うよ"
"うに設定されていないみたい。#o{outfit}#0を武器セットに割りあてなければならな"
"いかもね。そうすれば使えるようにできるから。{infokey} で#o情報#0ウィンドウを"
"開けば確認できるよ。まちがいなく設定されていることを確認してね。できたら{sys}"
"星系の{pnt}に戻りましょう｣"

