#~ msgid ""
#~ "This powerful energy weapon is built to bombard from great range with ion "
#~ "bursts, causing debilitating damage to a target's shields and electrical "
#~ "systems, which can leave a ship effectively defenceless. It was developed "
#~ "by the Za'lek for use on their heavier droness to supplement the short "
#~ "range and high damage of their beams."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "この強力なエネルギー兵器は、長距離からのイオンバーストで砲撃するために作ら"
