#~ "this Demon sports a completely reworked electronics system, with top-"
#~ "notch specially tailoured lock-on algorithms. However, as per the no free "
#~ "lunch theorem, this comes at a cost of a much weaker drone command and "
#~ "control system, and the extra weapon slot and missile system storage "
#~ "required removing more of the ship's shield emitters and already thin "
#~ "armour."
